{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:19.901711+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_000d2870a004d59a59aa295e0646d04b6a7956fc7e004530c108f19947fc3685","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 6 (Exact control identity) of arXiv:2608.02417, 'A Bismut--Elworthy--Li formula for linear stochastic evolution equations in Banach spaces'] Let \(\xi\in\mathscr D_t\). Then
