{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:10:08.777827+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0033789497d474c69b5681ff923f051beede6825324717335b52c4090e8f43d5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop unmin of arXiv:2411.18359, 'Large systems of symmetrized trapped Brownian Bridges and Schr\"odinger processes'] Under the assumptions of Proposition (cormain of the paper), the following hold
