{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.236101+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_004f654c050aae93095452787cf33826c229dd73ae9af1fe4771162ae61fd0ae","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop: Lp estimates for simple functions of arXiv:2602.04429, 'Disordered systems and (subcritical) polynomial chaos\\ with heavy-tail disorder'] {}
