{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:46:00.336962+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_005d82a0ee896cca9b441f911bed97aa8e2be3e24205095e7a238f206d6a9434","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition newL of arXiv:2607.19651, 'Metastability and phase transition in a social network model with multiple opinions'] For any given opinion $o\in\mathcal{O}$, we define the ladder sets supporting opinion $o$ as follows:
