{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:33:43.750263+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_00983a69185303a40dc30bdc0b9f1ccb02c0ed02122d33d1ca20d3582db17031","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:fokker_superpo_den of arXiv:2608.30493, '\bf McKean-Vlasov Differential Equations:\\ {An introduction and a focus on some kinetic m'] Let $\nu\in\mathcal{P}(\mathbb{R}^d)$ and let $v:(0,\infty)\to L^{1}(\mathbb{R}^d)$ be a non-negative function

