{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:37:51.452021+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_00dda5e8c5533c857525a2928d1c28a2f20701853e42fe70f0d936a30e451689","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 22 of arXiv:2604.03213, 'Asymptotic expansion for transport maps \\ between laws of multimatrix models'] Given $f\in \cC^{3k}_p(\cB^1\cup \cB^2)$, with $\cB^1$ and $\cB^2$ Hilbert bases of $H_1$ and $H_2$. We set
