{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:09.042449+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_013356bbf0f27d5a89cef0f8e7161b99bbff56e192239273bff5f0e97803e7a6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 1 of arXiv:2606.27078, 'Semimartingale Optimal Transport with Jumps: A General Framework and Equivalent Formulatio'] Let $\Theta\subseteq\mathbb{R}^d\times\mathbb{S}_+^d\times\mathcal{L}$ be closed, convex, and satisfy Assumptions~\ref{B} and~\ref{J}. Moreover, let the cost function $L$ satisfy Assumption~\ref{L}. 
