{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:15:54.927795+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_018f689cd5b6e3da9e69e7cc9eeb9fe30b8a5306d49b2443b759f46e2473ae4c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:serial-iff-condensed-is-serial of arXiv:2608.29708, 'Intuitionistic and Constructive Modal Logics for Classical Modal Logicians'] {dosen_models_1985}}] 
  Let $\mathfrak{F} = (W, \leq, \sqsubset)$ be an f-frame.
  \begin{enumerate}[label=(\arabic*)]
    \item If $\mathfrak{F}$ is $\Box$-p, then $\sqsubset$ is serial iff $\sqsubset_\beta$ is serial.
    \item If $\mathfrak{F}$ is $\Diamond$-p, then $\sqsubset$ is serial iff $\sqsubset_\delta$ is serial.
