{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:22:21.887355+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_01bc67eef5802aa89a6be8c9738188ed7e6f65992838715f4dafcea560f8b193","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary thm:lowerbound of arXiv:2411.11345, 'Real Gaussian exponential sums via a real moment map'] We have 
