{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:59:45.011655+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_01be46d47dcfa0f88cb5da2d1b08bc078a8e54ecd2540c5960b4bd6364009a0e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma spde E T2 of arXiv:2605.13479, '\LARGE Dean-Kawasaki Equation with Biot-Savart and Keller-Segel Interactions: Existence an'] Under the same setting as in Proposition (entropy estimate of the paper), for every $\delta\in(0,1)$ fixed, $\beta > 2$ and $0 < \alpha <1/2$, we have
