{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:47:53.353967+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_01ddd93e6c326e048b8e462c28dd181ae0c521622c2881ec4e25cbcc7731672e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2607.16017, 'On large networks of integrate-and-fire neurons with short-term synaptic plasticity'] \begin{equation}
