{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:48:30.904679+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_01e85ed4f3ff456f0a3016a2addae698514f45a170cd7cef46f04eb00f8bdc93","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 9 (Matrix and spectrum of $T_\ell$) of arXiv:2609.00922, 'The Morse Index, Nullity and Jacobi Fields of Constant-Curvature 2-Spheres in Complex Proj'] Relative to the basis $(w_d)$, the matrix of $T_\ell$ is real symmetric and tridiagonal,
with
