{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.497369+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_01eee370e8f6bfbf5bdf82da93b5d8faa97acd7e622b11052e1842b3b1a7c277","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 8 of arXiv:2605.29030, 'Preferential relocations enhance survival \\ for Markov chains with killing'] Unique ergodicity holds for the kernel $\g$ given in \eqref{E:boldpi}  
