{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:48:49.906841+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_01f2ca7cede917c18495011cb740c3a60684afac0a9aaa1b38cbb7e74b6986bd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:EW-SHF of arXiv:2511.08479, '\Large From disordered systems to the Critical 2D Stochastic Heat Flow'] As $\vartheta\to-\infty$ we have the convergence in distribution, for any $\varphi \in C_c(\mathbb{R}^2)$,
