    \end{equation}
In words, the separation profile for random transpositions is given by a Gumbel distribution. (Stated as a conjecture by the paper; open unless the paper says otherwise.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:41:33.825788+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_01fbdcc31635a58c05813f7179ed47b3003e0b8a1a1ca9371b4d2872fd78c51f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 9 of arXiv:2604.10266, 'A singular SDE driven by additive fractional Brownian motion with Hurst parameter $H<\frac'] The limit process $X=\{X_t,t\geq 0\}$ has the following properties:
