{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.976296+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_02395cab4f2b1aa7d0bac1e9092b0f1271fe5f44cc05f6a239fca950f6655e5a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma thm:factor_hl of arXiv:2412.05999, 'Non-Archimedean GUE corners and Hecke modules'] Let $\tau_1,\ldots,\tau_{\binom{n}{k}} \in S_n$ be a set of coset representatives for $S_n/(S_k \times S_{n-k})$, let $\mu \in \Sig_k, \nu \in \Sig_{n-k}$, and define
