        \end{equation}
        is an $L^{\beta(J_{\xi})}$-martingale with respect to the natural filtration $\{\mathcal{L}_t, t\geq 0\}$ of $\mathbf{n}$ given $\widetilde{\mathcal{G}}$, where $((m-1)\beta)(i):=(m_i-1)\beta_i$, and $\widetilde{\mathcal{G}}$ is defined in (equation eqn:Sigma_fields_G of the paper) as the $\sigma$-field generated by the positions and types of the spine.         

