{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:32:35.563069+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_025ced0979a5e68ec3a83fb570f7bca8967f453e3fa2ec08a3b0d7b5384a90ca","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lm9.1 of arXiv:2605.21366, 'The Martin boundary of the Directed Landscape'] The following holds on a full probability event.
