{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:11:02.375117+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0263a2cc88977f422b9401896e4081b40fa6f5d707fdf3dece25ea2183c4f2d8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary stationary distribution of arXiv:2507.10294, 'Guessing Strategies for Shelf-Shuffling Machines'] The stationary distribution of $M$ is uniform. 
