{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:04:39.767526+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_026bf0cb8d1f78442d0d87b9b744f29a5ae6e0b24361ac82ebdf1159248ffc50","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2609.00978, 'Towards Categorical K\"ahler Geometry'] Let $X$ be a Noetherian separated scheme over $\mathbf k$ and $j\colon Z\hookrightarrow X$ a closed subscheme with ideal sheaf $\cI_Z\subseteq \cO_X$.
