{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:47:04.953375+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_026f8f0ce6e9516b637a6c6ceea0fe3a0f4fb9d70db3f4539dcbd435835f7651","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn def-topdim of arXiv:2412.03067, 'Geodesic Trees and Exceptional Directions in FPP on Hyperbolic Groups'] Set $\dim_t \emptyset = -1$. The topological dimension of a non-empty metric
