{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:52:23.566881+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0280b3324b33d3cc968f148a303ebed2856e6c2bc5ddee92b273a76f156d9c3a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma L:recF of arXiv:2602.05317, 'Strong local nondeterminism for stochastic time-fractional\\ slow and fast diffusion equat'] Let $t > s > 0$, $- 1 < a < 0$, $-3 < b < a$, and $F_b$ be defined as
