{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.302477+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0281896985c473eb67b2d22da7971b051059840cafda43ea30b7cfaff41b8c76","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 1 of arXiv:2606.24056, 'Decorated stable $p$-adic self-similar processes with stationary increments'] Let \(H>0\).  A real-valued process \(X=\{X(t)\}_{t\in\Q_p}\) is called \(p\)-adic
