{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:57:28.223981+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_029b9de5ac72bbe6d050423a8215135d27cc9866c39ce8edb6a50e0a323a2505","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 12 of arXiv:2607.17943, 'Coadjoint averaging and cross-scale fluxes in a fast-slow stochastic Euler-Arnold system o'] \emph{(Stationary Flux)}
