{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:31:49.846403+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_029bb748e68108ae475b3e51bd46fe8a09906eb86986da42c1ba0c52de063c39","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: proof of condition K2 of arXiv:2608.23756, 'Measure-valued fluid limits for partial service queues\\with correlated patience and servi'] For each $t \geq 0$ and $\varphi \in C_b(\mathbbm{R}_+^3)$, we have:
	\begin{subequations}
