{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:01:15.338285+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_02c3e8f4aaf3cef31986b56ee4da992c7b2f1f01c49cf34777ee6a9c3f39c0df","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 ({\cite[Lemma 6.1) of arXiv:2608.30415, 'On generalized complex projective product spaces'] {F-G-L-O}}]

