{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:23:37.874246+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_02c69562c25a36863b4db1b32ce3a79c6d06efea4eff9de38b95622c9e749184","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 28 (Green's first identity for the truncated tree $\mathcal{T}_{X}^R$) of arXiv:2609.03647, 'Extension Problems for the Vladimirov--Taibleson Operator and the Hierarchical Laplacian'] Let $g,h$ be functions on the vertices of $\mathcal T_X$, and assume that
\begin{align*}
    \sum_{v_A\in\mathcal T_X^R}|g(v_A)|
