{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.309402+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_02c99e89ad20e03cbc1b65c4f7e9781cce76706359bf86bd16c3595f77bcfd99","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 7 of arXiv:2606.24485, 'On the convex hull of a planar Brownian bridge with a random Gaussian endpoint'] For $0 < t < 1$ and $0 < \sigma \le 1$, the quantity $A_\si(t)$ is given by
