{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:30:08.166499+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_02e85fa989d9fe44ff46a614e3dea667c17f7b46dde4e4193da2fb0a8406f73e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:jointSurvival of arXiv:2608.13452, 'Wasserstein stability of the zero cell of a Poisson hyperplane tessellation under directio'] Given the coupling $(Z_0^{(1)},Z_0^{(2)})$ defined by (equation eq:couplingZeroCells of the paper),
