{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:26:26.787901+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_02fa1362662e928585841df251982347c459fc313665599fed037d15c22ba9a1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:blowupregieme of arXiv:2608.05105, 'Cluster-Cluster model in $\mathbb{Z}^d$'] For any stationary and ergodic starting configuration the following hold.
