{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:38:57.141849+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_035cc56a39dee63e8c1b7395957c9be2ac3bbc5c314b301c09b8ce4192c59cdf","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 4 of arXiv:2604.05910, '\textbf{Well-posedness and Hurst parameter estimation for fluid equations driven by fracti'] Let $\xi \in \mathcal{B}_\infty$. We say that a process
$\omega \in C([0,T];\mathcal{B}_\alpha)
