    Assume the conditions (equation e:DL of the paper) and (equation e:tilde-U-exist of the paper) hold. Then, we have
    \begin{equation*}
       \lim_{\varepsilon\to0}\varepsilon^{1/\theta_1}\log\mathbb P\left\{\max_{t\in[0,1]}|U(t,x)-U(0,x)|\le\varepsilon\right\}= -C_1^{1/2\theta_1}\kappa ,
