Consequently, taking expectations yields
\begin{equation}
    C_{p,1} \mathbf{E}\left[ \momentp{p}{\mu_{\mathcal X^J_{t}}} + \momentp{p}{\mu_{\mathcal V^J_{t}}} \right]
    \leqslant \mathcal L_p(t) \leqslant
