\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:59:58.446806+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_038b161025048a54f68d0c2250764dd22b97d9fbd4b33ea92e94260bb248573a","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition Good event for percolation configurations on the dual lattice of arXiv:2604.24743, 'The impact of disorder and non-convex interactions on delocalisation of height functions'] For any $x \in (\ensuremath{\mathbb{Z}}^2)^*$ and any (large) integer $L \in \ensuremath{\mathbb{N}}$, we let
