{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:56:36.587321+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_03bc797fa923055ab751e1a0ce6b86c2037f60119a6827e7b166f9b657b64d42","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem nu-2-lem of arXiv:2608.30518, 'Grow-up rates of inhomogeneous semilinear heat equations in the critical dimension'] It follows that $\nu_2\in C^1(1,\infty)$ and
