for some differentiable function $h:I\to \mathbb R$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:58:40.868193+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_04204c74218e610e3b2d09c84b34158c6486290a7cc23cc7da55b9ec93bb7971","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem eq_1230 of arXiv:2605.10479, 'Poisson approximation of random lattices'] Let $S \subseteq \mathbb R^n$ be a measurable set with $S \cap (-S) = \emptyset$ and $0 < { \rm Vol }_n(S) < c n$. Then,
