{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:57:28.220306+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0442b75da57de654e201e4274a64b1db59035818e8f78590a5a1f260354172a3","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 (The boundary family $p=1/2$) of arXiv:2607.17630, 'Higher-Order Hankel Obstructions to Free Infinite Divisibility\ for Beta Distributions'] For every $q>0$,
