{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:53.447422+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0443ad1d4efc5d090ad6c2f674b813935a530016c38c871718f811eeadda28ca","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2606.15843, 'Long-time behaviour of DLRA for SDEs'] Suppose Assumptions (H3), (H7) and (H8) hold. Moreover, suppose Assumption~\ref{AS:relation2} holds.
