{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.488343+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0448171c7d541dc3ab66c9dc3356a6e4726797ece0d57f2f663f26eb1a2937a1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 (Reverse Ginibre inequality) of arXiv:2605.28473, 'The BKT transition and surface tension differentiability'] There exists a universal constant $\crev>0$ with the following properties.
