{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:51:33.324560+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_044ac4092ad734779e7f8882b6d64b215007fc274256e5c4d665718c91b796eb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] The $G$-equivariant weak equivalences, cofibrations, and fibrations are part of a stable, proper, and topological model structure on $\cat{$\bm{G}$-OrthSp}$. This model structure is cofibrantly generated with generating cofibrations
