    and generating acyclic cofibrations
    \[
        J\hskip0pt minus 1pt=\hskip 0pt minus 1pt\{\textbf{\textup{O}}(V,-)\smashp_H G_+\smashp(\partial D^n\hskip0pt minus 2pt\hookrightarrow\hskip0pt minus 2pt D^n)_+\hskip0pt minus 1pt :\hskip 0pt minus 1pt \text{$H\subset G$,\,$V$ an $H$-representation,\,$n\ge0$}\}\cup K_G.
