{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:01:15.336390+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0453e4035cbd9dd962f46fb4100deb44d2eaa7233c639c537f602784c81a58c9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 5 of arXiv:2608.30415, 'On generalized complex projective product spaces'] Let $m_1\leq \cdots \leq m_k\leq n_1 \cdots \leq n_\ell$, and $p_j \geq 1, 1 \leq j \leq \ell$. Then,  
