{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:31:02.807428+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_04902075948a16e95a03313bea90d4435a6bc69cc8856b59b12c0bea7ac1b755","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma priori-combine of arXiv:2609.01488, 'Stabilization by a background magnetic field: global well-posedness of the full compressib'] Let $M\geq 3$ and $M_{\rho}:=\|\rho_0\|^{{\frac{4M-4}{2M-5}}}_{M}+\|\rho_0\|^{2(M-1)}_{M}+1.$ Assume $(\rho,\mathbf u,p,\mathbf h)$ is a smooth solution to   the system (equation no-heat-mhd3 of the paper) on $\mathbb T^3\times[0,T]$ for some $T>0$ satisfying (equation suppose-1 of the paper) and
 \begin{equation}
 \sup_{t\in[0,T]}\|\rho\|_{M}\leq4\|\rho_0\|_M.
\end{equation}
Then, there is a positive constant $A_6$ satisfying $A_6\sim M_\rho$ such that
\begin{align}\frac{d}{dt}&\mathcal E(t)+\frac{1}{4}\underline\rho\|\mathbf u_t\|^2_{M-1}+\frac12\|\mathbf u\|_{M+1}^2+\delta_0\|(p,\mathbf h)\|^2_{M-1-r}\nonumber\\
&\lesssim (1+\|(\mathbf u,p,\mathbf h)\|_2)\|(\mathbf u,p,\mathbf h)\|_2^3+\|\rho_0\|_M\|\mathbf u\|^3_{M}+\|\rho_0\|^2_{M}\|\mathbf u\|^4_M\nonumber\\
&\quad+\|(\mathbf u,p,\mathbf h)\|^4_{M}+\|(\mathbf u,p,\mathbf h)\|^3_{M}+(1+\|\rho_0\|^2_M)\|(\mathbf u,\mathbf h)\|^4_M,
\end{align}
and
\begin{equation}
\|(\mathbf u,p,\mathbf h)\|^2_M\leq \mathcal E(t)\leq B_4M_{\rho}\|(\mathbf u,p,\mathbf h)\|^2_M
\end{equation}
with $\mathcal E(t):=A_6\mathcal A(t)+E_{M}(t).$  Here the positive constants $B_4$ and $\delta_0\in(0,1)$ depend only on $\mathbb T^3,|\mathbf n|,$ $M,\mu,\lambda,\gamma,\bar P,\underline{\rho}^{-1},\bar\rho,M_0,r,c.$","status":"unverified"}

