{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.972429+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_04bc091c57de5023203dc189bdd24ae60da3fc9df88e0617c97c68975df0a992","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defi of arXiv:2412.05999, 'Non-Archimedean GUE corners and Hecke modules'] For any $n\ge 1$, let
