{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:32:11.128793+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0528840683be820cc253b76a15fcf4ec0a5d0081bf6e408da330ab7e53fe888a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:I[eps,G] of arXiv:2510.09818, 'On the Fourier dimension of fractional Brownian graphs'] [LL25]
