{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:57:28.703734+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0554d6abb1cbdcd5c54aeec820e6af03d8e72c85c23f4c78941435563a429a82","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 21 of arXiv:2609.01128, 'Nonabelian Chabauty for the Thrice-punctured Line over Cyclotomic Fields'] Assume the $p$-adic period conjecture. For $K=\bQ(\zeta_8)$, $S=\left\{(1-\zeta_8)\right\}$ and totally split primes $p$,
