{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.352683+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0563544389ff5bbeff8f2bbb1cdaa1b0cb83dc4e95ae75460555b0ec4c753a73","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 15 of arXiv:2606.17472, '2606.17472'] Let $a<b$. It holds that
