{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:45:10.114470+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_05895aed024d75a55a903b8a8c023aae327444ff453c87c7aa296fe699156b2e","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:spectral_radius of arXiv:2505.07145, 'Nonamenable Poisson zoo'] The \textbf{spectral radius} of the graph $G$ is the quantity
