{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:38:08.487281+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_059871077a99ae235329b9ab7d3dc538298af7d3fe93b54fca3c7180904116c4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:feebee-auc-rewrite of arXiv:2609.02304, 'Bayes-Optimal BER and AUC: \\Estimation and Evaluation of Estimators'] The optimal AUC value can be written as
