{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:57:16.061668+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_05b2b9272121fbed23290fc44166a3e38005b4715c4057124386eb8be253f745","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem many_to_two of arXiv:2506.10623, 'Polynomial slowdown in an angle-dependent 2d branching Brownian motion'] [Many-to-two] 
