{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:54:15.648151+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_05b8d5789245a91565c550a77ec355e2efaecb6fbcd3ca59c71d45747c082008","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 107 (Pure-power tensor law and faithful transfer) of arXiv:2608.08756, 'Infinite-Dimensional L\'evy Area and Spectral Ancestry'] If $T$ is positive compact and
