{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:31:45.220345+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_05b9a2c6ae01e67516a0bd6ea8ca3493b35c2fcee79f74c1d9c6a6821f6563b4","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor_a=0 of arXiv:2412.06086, 'Zeros of conditional Gaussian analytic functions, random sub-unitary matrices and q-series'] \phantom{a}
