{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:11:11.718865+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_05bc19abd93c9682564c667226af91c3bd566b74e333c3e5ec4d8d0e7925956d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:sector-barrier of arXiv:2609.00698, 'Kinetic Wedge Layers and Diffusive Limit of Neutron Transport in Polygonal Domains'] Let $0<\omega<\pi$, and let $s\in\mathbb R$ and $a>0$ satisfy
