{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:12.419010+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_05deba9afe0451e9610406d49818f6148aab35dc02f160194c040d17f7a6be13","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Dfn eq: restriction of a set to a closed ball of arXiv:2412.08236, 'Aging and sub-aging for Bouchaud trap models on resistance metric spaces'] [{The local Hausdorff metric $\lHausdMet{S}{\rho_{S}}$}]
  For $A \in \mathcal{C}(S)$ and $r>0$,
