Moreover, $\sum_{x\in A_0} h(x) \leq C_a \left(\frac{\log N}{M}\right)^{a+1}$ where $C_a>0$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.700740+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_05e1f4e8cc17a86c06e1ede52d60d25b6c79e5130106de539d53f8e1c8c4c528","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemOccTree of arXiv:2411.18563, 'Lower tails for triangles inside the critical window'] Fix $M> 0$, $\gamma \in [0,1)$, and $\vartheta>0$. Fix $\zeta \in (0,1]$ and let $H$ be a graph on $n$ vertices such that $\Delta = \Delta(H)=\omega(1)$ and 
