{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:25.060921+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_05f72aea3469974af2f05281621b370c3f01eb3984cd212e62d2335deebd3c52","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 of arXiv:2607.02019, 'Critical branching processes in random environment with immigration and an application to '] The survival probability $q_n$ is given by
