{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:41:54.347919+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_05f796cd5f6ed8545dba916b67cfd4b1373f9724537fc5272f1fb0a3de6eceba","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem th:failure-gap of arXiv:2412.01489, 'One- and two-particle spectral gap identities for the symmetric inclusion process and rela'] For some graphs $G=(V,(c_{xy})_{x,y\in V})$ and site weights $\hat\alpha=(\hat\alpha_x)_{x\in V}$, we have
