{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:27:11.281847+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_05f9cfa1b56defb83fdcee69ae28885093908d4113417657500f9626482fad94","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition p:suffcapcon of arXiv:2605.20587, 'Persistence and entropic repulsion of stationary Gaussian fields with spectral singularity'] Suppose (equation e:blowup of the paper) holds for $\alpha \in (0,\infty]$. Then the following are sufficient conditions for (equation e:capcon of the paper):
