{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:48:35.801645+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_061eb60da9f79919a0b549e45e7576c977029c999ff45ffa6e2ea2f8684a64d9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:main_intro of arXiv:2411.09482, 'Anomalous Regularization in Kazantsev-Kraichnan Model'] Let $d\ge 3$, 
