{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:01:22.588645+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_061efe098edbdc9ec5da04883d804260ae5362e70e085f5d207e85c88f24b8c0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma approxiamtion IC global of arXiv:2605.16963, 'Stochastic Euler Equations with Pseudo-differential Noise: Continuous and Discontinuous Pe'] Let $d \geq 2$ and $p\ge 1$.  
