{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:15:16.642256+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_064f82013b106f60af0d1c0351ac5dc761e66930d949624402990b77c1df058a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Mainlocal 4 (Mesoscopic form of the relative pressure-work principle) of arXiv:2608.30715, 'Endpoint Energy Atoms Force Local Pressure Concentration in Three-Dimensional Navier--Stok'] Under the assumptions of Theorem~\ref{thm:main}, let
\(R_n\downarrow0\) be arbitrary. There exist
