{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33.993500+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_069927867813732ecbec183ed75b3146d539f7cfc67045f6978884cf9ce9f513","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 34 of arXiv:2609.03386, 'Twisted Gradient Flow Approach to Vegetation-Rainfall-Bushfire Interactions Model'] There exists a constant $C_{25}>0$, which depends on the following values:

