{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:25:39.084548+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_06e436cb22e97d75f89991ea5f395b8c82f1efe727e1b2dff19579896f715020","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:GetoG of arXiv:2606.11677, 'Feynman--Kac formula for the heat equation with a one-center point interaction in $d=3$.'] For any $t>0$ and $x\in {\mathbb{R}}^3\backslash \{0\}$, $G_{\varepsilon,t}(x)$ converges to 
