{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:40:21.309497+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_074576c2863fcab7556e94308e99b990b8008a33776831d9c2162339c5566151","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 20 of arXiv:2604.07697, 'Stochastic fractional heat equation with general rough noise'] $($\cite[Proposition 3.2]{HHLNT2017}$)$
