{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:50:27.006696+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_07464b447721a082326d28974e1018a516de0a64e41f34054fe574f3baac1dc2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop kn has to go to infinity of arXiv:2505.11700, 'Distribution of the cokernels of determinantal row-sparse matrices'] Suppose that the following hold:  
