	There exist deterministic $C<\infty$ and $c>0$ such that
	\begin{equation}
		\mathbb{Q}(\mathcal{X}_\mu\ge M)\le C\exp(-cM^{\sigma})\qquad\text{for every }M\ge 0\, ,
