        \end{equation}
        Moreover, the two projections are intertwined by the quotient map:
        \begin{equation}
            \pi \circ \mathrm{clip}^{\mathrm{sv}}_{\sqrt\alpha, \sqrt\beta} = \mathrm{clip}_{\alpha, \beta} \circ \pi.
