{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.791798+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_07815bbc7cb8f61c5d98e150ef44d9d8f1b2559dc127dba06d3cd02b72a68d49","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:E-properties of arXiv:2606.10973, 'Quasisymmetric rigidity of the Brownian sphere'] \begin{enumerate}
