{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:44:12.628002+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_079e72e1bad9d13ef061a6135d11785f74a92c261ccee01844e44e82db35257b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:independence of arXiv:2511.22162, 'Landau Hamiltonian with Gaussian white noise potential and the asymptotics of its bottom o'] Let $(\varphi_j)_{j = 1, \dots, n}$ be $n$ test functions in $C^\infty_c$, each supported in an open boxes $B_j$. Suppose it holds that
