\end{cases}
\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.308932+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_07a0880ec9f210a40e3442f22e331f8d3927691ed8a048c657055e5f11689703","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 1 of arXiv:2606.24485, 'On the convex hull of a planar Brownian bridge with a random Gaussian endpoint'] Let $B^{0\to y}$ be a one-dimensional \( 0 \)-to-\( y \) Brownian bridge on $[0,1]$, and let
