{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:48:24.518949+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_07bd9033aad8224e55c350407335469a46f485a90edf13a5f02a0e722df2d55f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:description of arXiv:2512.17808, 'Zeros of polynomial powers under the heat flow'] For any $t>0$, the limiting distribution $\mu_t$ satisfies the following.
