{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.491926+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_08193c8e3f670bd65d8525718477a264ffddff308d832f0d733b2ffa1f4b4aab","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 27 (\cite{sbssxw-rank-1-scaling-limit}*{Lemma 8.2}) of arXiv:2509.09589, 'Geometry of critical discrete structures: long-range percolation on the hierarchical latti'] Fix $n\geq 2$, and let $\mvy$ and $(v(i) \, ;\, i\in [n])$ be as above.
Let $\mva  := (a_i \geq 0;\ i \in [n])$ be such that 
$c_n:= \sum_{i \in [n]} y_i a_i/{\sum_{i\in [n]} y_i} > 0$.  
Let $y_{\max}:= \max_{i \in [n]} y_i$ and $a_{\max} := \max_{i \in [n]} a_i$. 
Let $\ell= \ell(n)  \in [n]$ be such that
