{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:22:39.688060+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0825548a4fda507d034d3423155884ea868173a92946e76df60509ec3d995761","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:scaling_limit_double_limit of arXiv:2508.18807, '{\bf Critical long-range percolation I: High effective dimension}'] We have that
