{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:49:25.047362+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0825d1bdb0f49d15ae6ac4bd4a52886b316f5df6b0b433347ba5296763ab4644","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma LS of arXiv:2609.03637, 'On the abstract approach to spectral constants:\\ a proof of the Clou\^atre--Ostermann--Ra'] Let $\mathcal H$ and $\mathcal K$ be Hilbert spaces. Let
