{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:42:08.467998+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_08b7af8368804e63ad476cf3414b24bf0ccec02591514bad47393b9260586fb5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem T:CLT-Yn of arXiv:2511.17101, 'Central limit theorem for the range of critical branching random walk'] Assume (equation eq:assmption of the paper). When $d>8$, there is a constant $\kappa=\kappa_d>0$ such that
