{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:52:45.025492+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_08b9c5edbd7c32f6a706d1a07ff29622d9233ac44de958ddc018f28b9c1870bc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 10 of arXiv:2606.06757, 'Path-Dependent Ergodic Optimal Control \\ and Backward Stochastic Differential Equations'] [Stability of cost]
