{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:39:41.436156+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_08ca37d0da88c334230cf336bb2e73597d86c60d6006d5774b00a80bd7ce2d36","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 4 of arXiv:2604.07275, 'Some probabilistic properties and time-changed versions of a renewal process based on Mitt'] The mgf $\hat{M}_{\alpha}(u,t)$ of  $\{\hat{N}_{\alpha}(t)\}_{t\ge0}$ solves the following fractional differential equation:
