{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.361801+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_08efa90c901256c5cca43556b4a3f284ab908c9581a97d95cb67c0bce83607e5","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 56 of arXiv:2511.09517, 'From Cannings model to Brownian motion conditioned on local time profile'] Assume \eqref{H1}--\eqref{H2}. Then:
