{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:25.274940+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_08f8ea5c454d41f2bd3575d4e9c8769e2fdeab87a5466da35b903bb9bc9c8910","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 (Density--Stiefel representation) of arXiv:2606.21137, 'A Sudakov--Fernique proof of Lehner-type edge bounds for matrix-valued GUE sums'] Assume \(M\ge N\).  Then, in distribution,
