{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:30:52.735261+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_08fe727a9e67c45a01555357e9ed9894d77d0351c0b09ebb396a644d5af53c6f","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defi 10 of arXiv:2506.10213, 'Coupling of forward-backward stochastic differential equations on the Wiener space, and ap'] A decoupling field $w$ is called regular 
