{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:23.338582+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0935e86cf47214fa46407ed8db971829a27182582d24b859216e837a3b9c485c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 10 of arXiv:2512.05687, '$L^p$-Boltzmann-Gibbs principle \\ via Littlewood-Paley-Stein inequality'] {\rm (1)} We assume the condition {\rm (SG)} in Section \ref{sec:1.20.4}
