{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:55.645698+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_099433224134405107fba8778fec2f40f56ed3a2b3b9437517200eca80010481","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 16 (Deterministic control of the shifted distances) of arXiv:2605.24937, '2605.24937'] Let $L\in[\tfrac12,2]$, $\overline a_0,\overline a_1\ge0$, and $\bar N := N\wedge 1/(1-L)_{+}$.
