{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:58:44.401611+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_09a19d91a0c52c40d72475630e574b670c03502a496fe916844125029e701a3c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 20 (von Neumann \cite{vonNeumann, MR157874}) of arXiv:2609.02837, '2609.02837'] Let $\phi: \R^n_{+}\!\!\downarrow \to \R_{+}$ be given and extend it to $\R^n$ via \eqref{E:UIN-extension-phi}. Define $\|\cdot\|_{\phi}$ on $\M_n$ by
