{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:40:21.313996+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_09aa3a36f977840602a615da627777de9e1bca11202fc6a28fcfdf6620d264d1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 5 (Covariance inequality) of arXiv:2604.08623, 'Central limit theorem for the Allen-Cahn equation with supercritical random initial condit'] For any $F,G \in \mathbb{D}^{1,2}$ centered, we have
