{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:40:59.403766+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_09abc948a83aa464cd4b09b177f14623fff3ed9472fa8705af936840457d9114","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 33 of arXiv:2609.03976, '2609.03976'] We define the Fischer pairing as follows.
