{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:12.431878+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_09c494e7ac9b0698c51a01626d97be4a52868cbc094c2906ef275c488eeb0e76","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Dfn 3. dfn: resistance metrics of arXiv:2412.08236, 'Aging and sub-aging for Bouchaud trap models on resistance metric spaces'] [{Resistance metric, [Kigami_01_Analysis]}]

  A metric $R$ on a non-empty set $F$ is called a \textit{resistance metric}
