{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:03:39.762390+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_09f7f2481fc71e2806dc86f1fd5fea632d54acb7446a3d9e19a1c64c26c9b239","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:A^(n)phi(u) of arXiv:2411.02459, 'Existence and higher regularity of statistically steady states for the stochastic Coleman-'] Suppose for $n\ge 1$, $\varphi\in C^{2n}(\mathbb{R})$ and $u\in H^{2n}$. Then,
\begin{align} 
