The same bound holds for Brownian loops and two sets at distance \(a\).
\item For \(T\geq1\),
\begin{equation}
 m_\delta\{\operatorname{dur}(\ell)>T\}
 +m_D\{\operatorname{dur}(\ell)>T\}
