Calculation: With $\kappa>4$ and $\Gamma_1$ and $\Gamma_2$ simple contours, we decompose $\Gamma_1$ (resp. $\Gamma_2$ ) into one simple contour $\Gamma_1^{\prime}$ (resp. $\Gamma_2^{\prime}$ ) with an endpoint at $x_{i-1}$ (resp. $x_{i+2}$ ) and another (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

