	is a $\P^\mu$-martingale for $\EE^F$-q.e.~$\mu\in\scr P_p$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:01:15.335211+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0a27f789ecb91f1038bf4b2eea46172c27e195f29a2c6f984888ee45575daed7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2608.30409, 'Gradient estimates and volume doubling for locally finite weighted graphs with $CD\psi(n,-'] For any $a>0,b\ge0$ and any continuous function $\gamma:[T_1,T_2]\rightarrow[0,+\infty)$, the following inequality holds
