{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:33:17.721876+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0a297485be05480e82048e5800462ed7b26042739c79f30cad724621fed33bc6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 58 (Flattening bounds for the localized wave--Klein--Gordon kernel) of arXiv:2607.10813, '2607.10813'] Let $L\sim N$, $Q\le c_{\mathrm{ap}}N$, and $M\lesssim N$.  If
