{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:47:01.660542+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0a4f4f90c87ba29c12647825b02f422bc25f72ae073494b88053c2ff73e1d364","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2604.23462, 'Invariant measures for the open KPZ equation: the Gaussian case'] We have that
