{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:26:26.775398+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0a7f3879c87321c2d9debd80452523bdf51eaf922b0280b5820c09b083e96fa3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:FP-kernel of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] The joint distribution satisfies
