{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:12:13.442525+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0acc44fb45dd585f95d6e54f4db3917775d0e8968460133859170a7eb59cf610","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 7 ({\cite[Lemma 3.1) of arXiv:2608.28234, 'A note on the positivity of $Q$-curvature via the continuity method'] {GurHangLin2016}}]

