\,=\, \sum_{r\in S_p: \mc M_p(r)\subset \mc M_{p+1}(k)}
\nu^{p}_{\mc M_{p+1}(k)}(\mc M_p(r)) \, \mu^{p}_{\mc M_p(r)}(\cdot)\,.
