{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:33:17.752227+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0b130f11980cdf1b166384b8b671c39eb7df4db16a55bffd5f237a6e0cb86a90","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 130 (First-chaos spectral bounds) of arXiv:2607.10813, '2607.10813'] For every $\eps>0$,
\begin{equation}
  \sup_{\Lambda\ge1}\sup_{t\le T}
