where $M_j=\max\{m_j,\,m_j+m_{j+1},\,\ldots,\,m_j+m_{j+1}+\ldots+m_{j+N-1}\}$, $m_{i+N}=m_{i}$ for all $i\in\mathbb{N}$, and $F_{\infty}^{(N+1)}=F_{\infty}^{(1)}$.

