{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.206984+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0b730436a818eb1e8fb6f28a83010d3dfb9898e7f546be79069d950cf332d788","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem Morph-Vertex of arXiv:2608.29013, 'Weighted Homology and Cohomology of Weighted Polyhedra'] Suppose $(K,\mu)$ and $(K',\mu')$ are two divisibly weighted simplicial complexes of the same type.  Then
