{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.715121+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0b908d848dea8bf445d6f2b5f7e2fff5dcca3218f157eec1d6d919ef8089f9c9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2608.06392, '2608.06392'] Let $g:\mathbb R_+\to\mathbb R_+$ be locally integrable, ultimately monotone,
