{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:56:14.250187+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0b9549fdae3abe6f45bb398a306181c8b91a177047af1faff213d6ee48125cb6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma familia_mu_alpha_properties of arXiv:2412.09532, 'Percolation on the stationary distributions of the voter model with stirring'] For any~$\mathsf{v} \ge 0$ the family $\{ \mu_{\alpha,\mathsf v}: \alpha \in [0,1] \}$ has the following properties:
