{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:25.982888+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0be958716b5aeb1f37b3ee09b30c39581f3664772fdf54e081047509bb2b3488","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 36 (cf.\ {\cite[Proposition 6.1) of arXiv:2507.07702, 'Observables of random spanning trees in random environment'] {MSS23}}] 
