{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.361771+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0c0ef1e8ec41b1ac2663c97b8baff33dccb45219bc18b9f703960804e3b85095","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 35 of arXiv:2606.17859, 'Full $\Gamma-$expansion for the level-two large deviation rate functionals of non-reversib'] For each  continuous function $f\in C(\bb T)$,
