{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:11:35.823823+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0c1f30467f9a7e49e720fa4c070636d7169edac060a0385095f1969e178773ec","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:recursive of arXiv:2607.22908, 'Epidemic Phase Transitions in the Zero-Range Process'] For each $k \ge 0$
