{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:28:04.866587+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0c293eeb21501e73243786f19593ed252d16c33f9095bd45d80ea61f1be0ddad","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 31 of arXiv:2512.00213, 'On strong sharp phase transition in the random connection model'] Let $v\in\BX$, $n\in\N$ and $r\ge 0$. Then  
