{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:39:11.673854+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0c563dd1ab03d22185cd89fc6652582962f5b128d933d45fba2fcf2ba0e23c7b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2608.04853, 'Minimal-Norm Extensions of Stationary Kernels on Subgroups of Locally Compact Abelian Grou'] Let $h>0$ and $A_h:[0,1/h) \to \R$ be given by  
