{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:14:57.695183+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0c6f94497b66ce377515bdd4266ed65f04608e9827de63ae63dac2176a6e0954","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma components=critical of arXiv:2605.29095, 'Asymptotics of the number of components of random polynomial lemniscates'] Let $\{\beta_j\}_{j=1}^{n-1}$ be the critical points of the random polynomial $P_n$. Then,
