{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:47:12.032720+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0ceca92f1a4426486a6aef9145a53763962aafe6ac89bf1403ee94127e84e977","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def-Markov semigroup of arXiv:2512.17727, 'Stochastic transport equation with L\'evy noise'] The  Markov semigroup $({
