{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.247727+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0d02312206f5a1d7903a5f1801b063deace3c52eaad3242188ff8769b92bd859","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 4 of arXiv:2605.22146, 'Poisson approximation of the largest gaps between zeros of a stationary Gaussian process'] Let $f$ be a $C^2$-smooth SGP with a spectral density. Then with $\zeta > 0$ as in Proposition \ref{p:per2}:
