\end{align} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:42.302722+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0ddb6443948bc375e1c73341c182f7bfdb4eb83df394c6f162149591cc8adf8b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor 30 of arXiv:2510.22155, 'Random walks in space-time random media in all spatial dimensions: the full subcritical fl'] Define functions $  {\mathpzc F},\mathpzc G_{ij}$ on $\ak$ by 
    \begin{align*}
