{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:56:00.644675+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0e198834635d1956a6eefc0c8b9de4335c810d95eb5bc1aa1425c71936d97f97","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition plouf of arXiv:2603.17861, 'Gaussian concentration, integral probability metrics, and coupling functionals\\ for infin'] Let $\mu\in\mathscr{M}_\tau^1(\Omega)$ and let $C>0$. We say that $\mu$ satisfies the
