{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:04:59.425166+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0e31b1a93cb0ebbb5717e53ed2665baf3c4dab18ffabbec4a153fd81953f512b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition thm.ergodicity of arXiv:2605.17725, 'Limit theorems for random walks with spatio-temporal drift'] Assume that 	                    the two
