{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:55:18.936979+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0e3acfa7332c8eba9f8086171dcd263ad29c01873f24b5aedc502cc9fa25aac4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary of arXiv:2602.08591, 'The Yang--Mills measure on compact surfaces as a \\ universal scaling limit of lattice gau'] \begin{enumerate}
