{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:36:31.221478+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0eade377fd9a4585aa31c42f4410dd2962682578c5be94e69f032364d596a3d1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 12 of arXiv:2609.00483, 'On Embedding Hamming Spheres with Applications to Positive Curvature'] \cite{FR, Gh}  
