{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:56:36.588426+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0eb0251cb60f0b84f0266b59c579f69f343af2d42bc9981b02aed36a7167a84b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Lemma_localized_approx of arXiv:2608.30548, 'Finite speed of propagation and waiting time phenomena for stochastic porous media equatio'] Let $\zeta\in C^2(\mathbb{T}^d)$, $p\in [1,\infty)$ and $\tau \le T$ a stopping time. Then it holds
\begin{align}\begin{split}

&
 \mathbb{E}\biggl[\biggl(
        \sup_{t\le \tau} \int_{\mathbb{T}^d} \zeta^2 u_{\kappa,l}^{\alpha+1 }\,\mathrm{d} x \,+\, \int_0^\tau \int_{\mathbb{T}^d}   \zeta^2 u_{\kappa,l}^{\alpha+m-2}|\nabla u_{\kappa,l}|^2\,\mathrm{d} x\, \mathrm{d} t \,+\,\kappa \int_0^\tau \int_{\mathbb{T}^d}\zeta^2 u_{\kappa,l}^{\alpha-1}|\nabla u_{\kappa,l}|^2 \,\mathrm{d} x\, \mathrm{d} t\biggr)^p
        \biggr]^{1/p}
        \\&\quad \lesssim_{(\alpha,m,n,p,\phi,\psi)} \,\int_{\mathbb{T}^d} \zeta^2 u_0^{\alpha+1 }\,\mathrm{d} x \,+\, \mathbb{E} \biggl[\biggl(\int_0^\tau \int_{\mathbb{T}^d} u_{\kappa,l}^{\alpha+m}|\nabla \zeta|^2 \,\mathrm{d} x\,\mathrm{d} t \,+\,
        \kappa\int_0^\tau  \int_{\mathbb{T}^d}u_{\kappa,l}^{\alpha+1}|\nabla \zeta|^2\,\mathrm{d} x\, \mathrm{d} t\biggr)^p
        \biggr]^{1/p}
        \\&\qquad +\, \mathbb{E}\biggl[\biggl(
        \int_0^\tau 
        \int_{\mathbb{T}^d} 
        u_{\kappa,l}^{\alpha+2n-1} \bigl(|\zeta \Delta  \zeta| + |\nabla \zeta|^2 +\zeta^2 \bigr)
        \,\mathrm{d} x
        \,\mathrm{d} t \biggr)^p
        \biggr]^{1/p}
        \\&\qquad +\, \frac{1}{l^{2n-2}}\mathbb{E}\biggl[\biggl(
        \int_0^\tau 
        \int_{\mathbb{T}^d} 
        u_{\kappa,l}^{\alpha+1} \bigl(|\zeta \Delta  \zeta | + |\nabla \zeta|^2 +\zeta^2  \bigr)
        \,\mathrm{d} x
        \,\mathrm{d} t \biggr)^p
        \biggr]^{1/p}
\end{split}
\end{align}
for any weak solution $   u_{\kappa,l} $ to (equation Eq_viscous_reg of the paper) in the sense of Definition (def_weak_sol of the paper) with initial value $u_0$ {satisfying (equation assumption_m_plus_one of the paper)}.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:11:57.342604+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0eb21c0466de817822333f7f4e2af7ade82a7f4274a04c08229a3da1b477e488","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 32 of arXiv:2607.23791, 'Precise cover times for branching random walks on Hamming graphs: (iterated) logarithmic c'] Fix $c,w,\lambda,\delta>0$ and choose $C_{\rm shell}$ so that
