{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:25:35.764617+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0ef39491b9c42988ab6723ed2a6198a4d2e49fa8ad99a082415e4d1deb951611","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition convergence of centered descents of arXiv:2603.09008, 'On the statistics of random-to-top shuffles'] Let $a_n\in (0,1)$ be a deterministic sequence such that $a_n\to a\in(0,1)$. Let $(U_i)_{i\geq1}^n$ be i.i.d. continuous uniform random variables on $(0,1)$. Set
