=\E_{(m,0,0)}[\tau_{S_\eps}]\,[1+o_\eps(1)]$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:40.948791+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0f06b9c414b66ae63d2c506b2729f6927a4f49608f828b4878434243690edf54","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem T:inv-reflect of arXiv:2412.03521, 'On ergodic properties of stochastic PDEs'] Let $B_t$ be the standard Brownian motion in $\mathbb{R}^3$. Let $\nu$ be the
