{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.162823+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0f0d30a582924b78ea92b8d414374c2c135cf5fa2714857105a2d8030e091e3e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop Prop_TransformToNormalForm of arXiv:2609.02848, 'The universal moduli space of non-degenerate $\Z/2\Z$~harmonic spinors'] {Donaldson2021}}]

  Let $\mathbf{Sl}$ be a slice.
