{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:47:01.661553+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0f0ea92e76126fcacb8ae6185c0c50abc75045a0ec17c24836ae8fc4fc368810","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 11 of arXiv:2604.23572, '2604.23572'] The mean system delay $\E\big[D_k^{\PR}\big]$ ($k \in \K$)
