{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:13:18.516462+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0f18b886ef40f185f5b8f6613296f3994096bd040694860b7e0526296b5bed9d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 23 of arXiv:2608.30602, '2608.30602'] Let $f$ satisfy the assumptions of Lemma~\ref{lem:Taylor-scheme-0}, and let
