{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:52:47.267603+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0f4059dc0cf326a62b6c1dda3820114783a881ef2bde223fcb5e6838434e4505","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 42 of arXiv:2609.01114, 'Unbalanced spectral Tur\'an problem for color-critical graphs with prescribed large maximu'] The following statements hold for all sufficiently large $n$.
\begin{enumerate}[label=\textnormal{(\roman*)}]
