{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:40.047992+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0f64cd59445ab5bb15bbe8c9b33f31312985891b3c938022700b1374187f0eae","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 3 of arXiv:2510.25151, '$L^{\alpha-1}$ distance between two one-dimensional stochastic differential equations with'] The function $u_{\delta,\eps}$ satisfies
