and the nondegeneracy condition
\begin{equation}
\frac{3\ell_{rr}-1}{2}<\kappa_2^2
\qquad
\text{for every }r\text{ such that }t_r=t_*.
\end{equation}
Then every partition in the structured $(1,1,4)$ and structured $(1,2,3)$ subfamilies satisfies
\begin{equation*}
\det Q_{\mathcal A}(T)<\mathfrak D^{\mathrm{rel}}_3(T)=\kappa_2^2 t_*.
