{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:24:20.972969+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0f8abe929ed88bdb2c7be965517ff0c86f19a9012a7a14f76ac915248443f880","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem6.12 of arXiv:2508.12951, '\textbf{On the central limit question for strictly stationary, reversible Markov chains}'] Suppose $h_1, h_2, h_3, \dots$ is a sequence of positive
