{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:50:30.553142+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_0f9dfbde82badc2477119c29e2ad1953a7a762a7607b3428d0dac6fafd665c10","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3 of arXiv:2605.30055, 'The Wasserstein cost of importance sampling'] The solution to the problem 
