with respect to ${\mathcal P}$ in $D([0,1])$, where on the right-hand side the process $\mathcal{Z}_{\alpha}$ is as in (equation eq:calZ of the paper) with $a_j = a_j(f)$  and assumed to be independent from ${\mathcal P}$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

