{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:22:39.688453+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1064ff0b49bb394358824ef91385fae18969d47e7c762f1166c0a2ea4a8d8ae3","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition d:11 of arXiv:2508.21658, 'Infinite-dimensional stochastic differential equations for Coulomb random point fields'] \thetag{i}
