{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:10:08.725192+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1067a4b68c06189cea6de92167e77da38d448dc34af8313dbc1658f399d57324","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition cost_subinterval of arXiv:2411.17653, 'Exclusion processes with non-reversible boundary: hydrodynamics and large deviations'] For all $\pi(t,dx)=\rho_t(x)dx$ in $ {\mathcal{D}}([0,T],\mathscr{M}_{ac})$ and $0<S<T$:
