{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:00:22.780421+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_10e0f8d5b0f1fe8462848fe5d3dedc406041e6f619647e77e4e4c9fb9ea881e3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lm Factorization Lemma of arXiv:2411.01633, 'On the Limit of the Tridiagonal Model \\for $\beta$-Dyson Brownian Motion'] Let $M(t)$ be the stationary GOE processes. Then for $k$ fixed times $t_1, \dots, t_k$ and exponents $j_1,\dots,j_k$ we have,
