If $F_{[R_1,\mathcal{C}_n]}\equiv0$ for every $n$, then
\begin{align*}
 F_{[R_1,R_2]}\equiv0.
\end{align*}
\end{enumerate}
Thus no operator algebra property of the
$\mathcal B(H^1,H)$ closure is assumed.","status":"unverified"}

