{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:10.966346+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_112dfab85e3837d9f5b6a9184bf687f7a28accf70d215cde767b6890e682d447","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 27 of arXiv:2606.12720, 'On McDiarmid's Inequality under Dependence \\ via Approximate Tensorization of Entropy'] {Maximum Cut}

