	\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.579039+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_114e02fe49b9530cd73a784144be5c53a78804f2bc87aaa596fc0db5a0727cdf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 15 of arXiv:2606.14876, 'High-Order Talagrand and Eldan--Gross Inequalities via Besov-Type Variance Functionals'] For all $f:\cube^n\to \Rbb$ and $t\geq 0$,
