{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:17.798123+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_115fca6e4accd161597b4df7f0cd25921e525675d600839b086aa6624067588e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:partition_upper_bound of arXiv:2509.23496, 'Crossing probabilities in geometric inhomogeneous random graphs'] For $u\in (0,1]$ and $2\leq r \leq R/32$,
    \begin{align}
         \theta_{r,R} & \leq \theta_{r, 2r}\theta_{8r, R} + \pi_{4r, R/2} + \pi_{r,R/2} + J_1 + J_2,\\
