            Z_d
            \end{array}\right) := \bm Z, $$
            where $Z_1\sim \Pois(\lambda_1), \ldots, Z_d \sim \Pois(\lambda_d)$ are independent. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

