{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:15:36.154425+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_11ae4d4815857aa9ca5d7eea4a2e95b79f7fc713b3db5f9066ce5559894a9c14","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 (Minimum-row slack identity) of arXiv:2609.01570, 'A Proof of Fraenkel's Conjecture'] For every \(a\in A\setminus\{s\}\),
\(d_aa\ge N\),
\begin{equation}
 1-\sum_{a\ne s}\frac1{d_a}
 =\frac{Q-\sum_{a\in A}a}{N}
 +\sum_{a\ne s}\frac{\delta_a}{d_aN},
