In particular, \(\sum_{a\ne s}d_a^{-1}\le1\).","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:49:15.475607+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_11af308f76757bc4a57b3c6a9e94b91b93be4e6d8734fc9ba10b361816f3c4da","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma restr-inj-left-Quillen of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] Let $\alpha\colon G\to G'$ be an \emph{injective} homomorphism of compact Lie groups. Then the adjunction
