{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:57:28.735046+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_11bc31242de8532c5f3c10d4a674d6e62210d2071482ee3a526e2caea901b583","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 12 of arXiv:2609.01237, ''] Let $u_\alpha$ be the solution to \eqref{eqn:alpha-prob} and $u_0$ be the solution to Problem {\hyperlink{po}{$(P_0)$}}. 
