{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.680692+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_12147ab253eb331ca91afd42da4067a6dda0e33d5562e050d6a79932a5abb4cf","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma light:bound:alpha of arXiv:2412.09235, 'A semiconcavity approach to stability of entropic plans and exponential convergence of Sin'] Assume that $c$ satisfies (equation eq:ass:hessia:bounded of the paper) and that $\rho$ satisfies (equation eq:ass:light:tails of the paper). Then for any $\alpha>0$ we have 
