{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:51:52.125840+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1222e8dbb316849b60a318752a289f1bf0e3255531796f78ab12bec661de5a56","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma L:arc-safe-region-control of arXiv:2607.15966, 'Canonical Mandelbrot Cascades on Curves Are Rajchman'] Fix an integer \(h\geq0\).  
