{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:45:38.343564+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_126172668bfbc139a89a41028139b2ea89b5b50c40c01ec9ad34701565a2a71d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2604.20617, 'Structured random perturbations of \\ tridiagonal twisted Toeplitz matrices'] For all sufficiently large $n$, for every $z\in K$ and every $k\ge1$: 
