{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.490621+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_126266e472d97e47e9397725449878f3a57ea6e0e62574d47b7eeadc94b3c3b9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 20 of arXiv:2509.09589, 'Geometry of critical discrete structures: long-range percolation on the hierarchical latti'] Consider $\alpha\in(0, d)$ and $\theta\in(\alpha, \alpha + d/3)$.
