		Furthermore, there exists a constant $\hat{K}>0$ which depends on $\alpha,C,T, \|a\|_{L^1([0,T];\mathbb{R}_+)}, \|b\|_{L^1([0,T];\mathbb{R}_+)}$ and $\|Y\|_{S_{\mathbb{F}}^\infty([0,T];\mathbb{R})}$, such that
