{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.733563+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_12de1b4bf9c4a6fd0af1ea7797f3039d5efca7fe1c222993160dbe1957571d6f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma GreenminuswN of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] If we consider $x$ as an element of both $\Z^d$ and $\Lambda$,
