{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:17.787639+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_13048d07336f1264dab9344ecd59cd711e0e2470c81270e28ab8f448d3e559a8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop density of arXiv:2509.07729, 'Permuton and local limits for the Luce model'] The permuton $\mu$ in (thm:permuton_conv of the paper) is uniquely determined by its pattern densities, defined for all $k\geq 1$ and $\pi\in\mathcal{S}_k$ by
