{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.722486+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1304c3edf82451f681797a9323097fec7070962ba06c0ff639760904a422fbbd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 (Orientation of the stationary level curve) of arXiv:2608.06523, 'On the Gardner Transition in the Ising Pure $p$-Spin Glass II'] At a point satisfying both \eqref{mt:eq:mass} and
