{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:23:05.283852+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_134c9b94634155b9d9ec7c20d58d974c9cb4ebcf59fbac007d9b1879b30f20ca","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 9 (Search--validation phase law) of arXiv:2608.21496, '2608.21496'] If $m,N\to\infty$ with $m^2/N\to\tau\in(0,\infty)$, then
