{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:30:28.832206+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_13a60016908d44beb08857fb7d16c4faeb86459d494fcc8ad66fb4b8adc6327d","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 13 of arXiv:2609.02147, '2609.02147'] Let $u \in S_\mu$, $\lambda \in \R$ and $\theta \geq 0$. 
	\begin{enumerate}
