{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:04:06.982674+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_13c0db86796f7fea01fb4a79beadea1cce05ac819d5ec3dd6fe90d1a6e253c1c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:lbstrthm2 of arXiv:2607.26551, 'An RDT based confirmation of Lehner's formula for Kronecker-Gaussian matrices'] Assume the setup of Theorem (thm:lbstrthm1 of the paper). Let $\bar{L}$ be as in ((eq:hrd9b0 of the paper)). Set 
\begin{eqnarray}

