{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:31:02.829946+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_13e4dc12977e369bbe72b02e976bbe073a4fee91872f5e5fbf89d90e1675886d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm cor:diff-eqnV of arXiv:2609.01751, 'Orthogonal polynomials which are eigenfunctions of a partial differential operator'] Let  $\mu > -\frac12$, ${\kappa}_i > -1$ for $1 \le i \le d_2$. Let ${\mathfrak D}_i$ denote the operator 
