holds with~$k:=k(x,y)$ for all distinct $x,y\in\Lambda_n$.  (Here~$k(x,y)$ is as in (equation Eq:4.3i of the paper).) (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

