{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:27:25.799474+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_14714edafaa0b8f446acacdf0c6d9414249a7d7efb5993e351b36a6da3c0b26d","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:rho of arXiv:2605.17082, 'Spectral Purification in Reversible Markov Chains: Hidden Parameters, Observable Equivalen'] The \emph{relative dissipation rate} at step $k$ is
