				&\leq \left\|\phi_0^{(N)}\right\|_{L^{p} _N}^{p}+ C \int_0^t (1+s)^{-\frac{p}{2}} ds+p C\int_0^t (1+s)^{-1}\left\|\phi^{(N)}\right\|_{L^{p} _N}^{p}ds + p dM_p^{(N)}(t),\quad {\rm{a.s.}}.
