{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:20:30.555736+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_15151e5019b599bcf14199a545fd3df8f442299ffde614e7879e05032eaeec5d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 21 of arXiv:2609.01826, 'An extension theory for fully fractional Schr\"odinger equations with memory'] Let $0<s<\min\{1,d/2\}$ and $u\in \mathscr S(\R^{d+1})$. Then
\begin{itemize}
