$\ve\to0^+$; we write this as $\mathscr J_{2s}\Le^su=u$;
\item[(ii)] if moreover $|p|^{-s}\hat u\in L^2(\R^{d+1})$ --- which holds
automatically when $0<s<\frac12$ --- then $\mathscr J_{2s}u\in\Dom(\Le^s)$ and
