{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:18:56.353970+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1528adef8c15d71b703b62aae73be319922eed3695ff200b794238252a2b01cc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Problem 35 of arXiv:2608.26628, 'Open Problems in Mathematical Logic'] Are the following true?
