{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:31:57.914848+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_152ad9de89028b6d0afa88419b6c841a72d061529e8a7efe6ba4fdc06374d692","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition of arXiv:2510.18392, 'Hyperuniformity of random measures, transport and rigidity'] Say that $ K$ is reproducing if for  $ x,y\in  \mathbb{R}^{ d},$
