{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:32:11.151719+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_15444ebf5ae1acbe6558ec03d8a62737c68f3846adaa0de8f0d0d84f0159d93d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:largedeviation of arXiv:2510.13733, 'Internal Diffusion Limited Aggregation \\ with Critical Branching Random Walks'] For any $d\geq 1$ there exist positive constants $c $ and $\lambda_0$, depending only on the dimension $d$, such that for each $ \lambda \in (0,  \lambda_0]$ 
