{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:10.965858+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_158d4a8e3bac2f59dd50092d4a02591a5301f6150a551c2ab07313cd69198e51","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21 of arXiv:2606.12720, 'On McDiarmid's Inequality under Dependence \\ via Approximate Tensorization of Entropy'] {Tight ATE for Gaussians (Lemma 3.10, \cite{ascolani:lavenant:zanella2026})}


