{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.607020+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_159c27cd6d471431402cc8b738effbb023227f561de983836061d92f491bbe87","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 1 of arXiv:2607.08242, 'Convergence of random sums in non-commutative probability'] Let $\{Y_n\}$ be iid 
