u(t,x)=\int_\mathbb R g_\rho(t,x-y) u_0(y) dy+\int{\raisebox{-.82em}{\hspace{-1.18em}\scriptsize \bf o}}\hspace{.7em}\1_{[0,t]}(\cdot) g_{\rho}(t-\cdot,x)u(\cdot,0)\xi,
