\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:56:37.667769+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_15add122b9f084ebd67fd46b564da1ffdab954617c95cf2318bd5439eb78b885","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem fourier-many-to-two of arXiv:2609.00110, 'Phase Transition and Fluctuation Results for First-Passage Percolation on Spread-Out Cycle'] Fix $k\in\mathds{Z}\setminus\{0\}$ and let $g$ be bounded and Riemann-integrable. For one proposal process, put
