{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:34:33.534964+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_15b97aee25c41230de7e8c6ae0e8149cfc9cd9d4465c06db933d98339a99223b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2603.28093, 'Random Stability of Random Variables'] Pick a distribution $Q$ on the half-line. Assume $G(Q)$ is nontrivial. Then the random variable $N_c$ with probability generating function~\eqref{eq:Bunge} with $L$ being the Laplace transform of $Y$ satisfies 
