{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:42:39.079338+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_15f62a73b2bd738514c58b5ec654810d102ad56b2cdffc4bf2ef0b5ef7b9c51a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm6.4 of arXiv:2412.08334, 'Maker-Breaker on Galton-Watson trees'] If the information carried by visible nodes is whether or not they have infinite progeny, it holds
