{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:55:42.250576+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_15f81df267ca042d01b995bbb03f28629868f2dc18e48a30000e53d99389d457","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def: loops to be inserted in STEP1 of arXiv:2411.16398, 'Large Deviations of Cover Time of Tori in Dimensions $d\geq 3$'] For any $\omega \in \mathcal{A}$ and $\boldsymbol{x}\in \mathcal{R}(\mathcal{L}_{\boldsymbol{F}}^{\beta_N}(\omega))$, we define
    \begin{equation}

