{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:55:42.188116+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_161447ab650c1b82a88d3a44162bc41571a3dc62eddbca35817c954b465a0ec0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:inhomogeneousBerryEsseensecond of arXiv:2411.16103, 'Non-commutative Stein's Method: Applications to Free Probability and Sums of Non-commutati'] Assume that the sequence $\xi^n$ has dependency graph $E_n$. Then,  under the condition  
