{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:11:35.822492+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_163aece776dc33a331c716e67a63e6210337558f7d8ce62950ce0938863cfc23","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:priority_partition of arXiv:2607.22908, 'Epidemic Phase Transitions in the Zero-Range Process'] Given an initial configuration
