{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:10.978095+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_166a7bf775a1d8cb45cd91d65ab03ecf299a73f56b1a801896060c6d3da326e7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2606.14038, 'Trivariate Hypergeometric Series Formulas\\ for Pure Partition Functions of Multiple $3$-S'] [Square Rule]
