{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:56:36.587250+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1690768c97f9e827de9d611a8a45f12cad57cb9d2d5234c1bd1a4673317a2b6f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm supercor of arXiv:2608.30518, 'Grow-up rates of inhomogeneous semilinear heat equations in the critical dimension'] There exists $\tau>0$ such that
