{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.755374+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1716ba969ac19adbe800e1845f42f122271c7a6cbd71db4c23fc3d42ae3d64c8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 2 of arXiv:2604.11691, 'Asymptotic behavior of spatio-temporal point processes of exceedances'] Let $\{\bm X_{t}, \, t \in \mathbb{Z}\}$ be a multivariate strictly stationary regularly varying time series with tail process $\{\bm Y_{t}, \, t \in \mathbb{Z}\}$ such that Condition \ref{con_1} and Condition \ref{con_2} hold. 
