{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:53.165633+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_173e7ef973bce151e3b54d2e15da98c807d68d455a47e2b791a32b629c051f34","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 26 of arXiv:2607.02777, 'Hypocoercivity for Hamiltonian Diffusions \\ with Singular Drift'] For $k=1,\ldots,d_2$, define
