{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:23:37.858309+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_17492bc97e9da58b22364820ebe5aa500c3f8e7266d713f364220fbeddcd3ccc","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 18 (Green's first identity for $\mathcal{T}_{p^n}$) of arXiv:2609.03647, 'Extension Problems for the Vladimirov--Taibleson Operator and the Hierarchical Laplacian'] Let $g,h\in\mathbb{R}^{\mathcal{T}_{p^n}}$ satisfy the following conditions:
\begin{enumerate}
    \item $\mathcal{E}[g]<+\infty$ and $\mathcal{E}[h]<+\infty$;
    \item there exist $g_{\partial},h_{\partial}\in L^2(\mathbb{Q}_p^n)$ such that
    $g_R\to g_{\partial}$ and $h_R\to h_{\partial}$ in $L^2(\mathbb{Q}_p^n)$;
    \item $p^{(R+1)s}(h_{\partial}-h_R)
    \longrightarrow\partial_{n,s}^{(p)}h
    \quad\text{in }L^2(\mathbb{Q}_p^n)$;
    \item $\displaystyle\sum_{u\in\mathcal{T}_{p^n}}|g(u)\Delta_wh(u)|<+\infty$;
\end{enumerate}
Then
\begin{align*}
\frac{1}{2}\sum_{\substack{u,v\in\mathcal{T}_{p^n}\\u\sim v}}
(g(u)-g(v))(h(u)-h(v))w_{uv}=-\sum_{u\in\mathcal{T}_{p^n}}g(u)\Delta_wh(u)
+(1-p^{-s})\int_{\mathbb{Q}_p^n}
g_{\partial}(\boldsymbol{x})\partial_{n,s}^{(p)}h(\boldsymbol{x})d\boldsymbol{x}.
\end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:22:48.867352+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_17551421b70420f396e8ba7c65aea7facacd07081f58136fee75d0bf52f7e55e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2608.29143, 'Least Variability in a Polynomial-Square Class\\ of Rational Kernels'] For every $n\geq5$,
\begin{equation}
 \ell_{n+1}<\frac{\pi}{n+1/2}\leq\ell_n.
