{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:18:19.233109+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_17e721aa5db1aff26d3ee5feb41e7cd804e9ce7b097bc05acabda3e1ddeac7c7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 64 (Section $\sigma_{Cone\ A}$) of arXiv:2608.29086, '2608.29086'] Given $Cone\ A \in CONE(H_0)$. A section $\sigma_{Cone\ A} \in \Gamma(H_0)$ is obtained by
