{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:19:56.711858+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_17ffc89eb49536a40e723e8e34cee6088faada9c08d06cf45a311fc1c7d1f1c7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21 (Energy symmetry of the fibre) of arXiv:2608.30991, 'A block-Toeplitz approach to the spectrum of the Neumann-Poincaré operator on self-similar'] For every $\theta\in[-\pi,\pi]$ the operator
	$\tau(\theta):H^{-1/2}_0(\Gamma_0)\to H^{1/2}_0(\Gamma_0)$ is symmetric for the
