{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:09:23.962625+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1854c129677323e08279dbc93236d7c8fa6282b5945125bbcfe07892b3ec74e8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 5 of arXiv:2607.22414, 'Asymptotic fluctuations in supercritical multi-type Crump--Mode--Jagers processes'] Assume that~\ref{assumpt:Malthusian alpha} holds and let $\chi$ be a centered characteristic satisfying~\ref{assumpt:dRivar}.
