{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:59:24.047732+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_18de310f250819261853162f4907e3e562203eea593202c399bb038c1ebac022","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:scalar-mass-polynomial of arXiv:2608.30779, 'Some uniform estimates for K\"ahler--Ricci Shrinkers'] There is a polynomial
