\begin{equation}
\left| \GFt(z) - \GFt(c) + (\sigmap^2/2c^2) (z-c)^2 \right| \leq C_0 |z - c|^3.
\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:48:49.853167+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_18e034352d2183173bf8547f8cc3aafeb7dad5fc6ec9fa5bffebb3c0d53587f9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:second_moment_chaos of arXiv:2509.16694, 'A central limit theorem for two-dimensional directed polymers with critical spatial correl'] We have
    \begin{align} 
&E_{x}\left[\prod_{n=s+1}^{t} \{1+\sigma_N^2 h(S_{2n})\}\right]=1+\sum_{k=1}^\infty \sigma_N^{2k} \sum_{s+1\leq n_1<\dots<n_k\leq t} E_{x}\left[\prod_{i=1}^k h(S_{2n_i})\right] \nonumber\\
    &=\sum_{k=0}^\infty \sigma_N^{2k} \sum_{s+1\leq n_1<\dots<n_k\leq t}\,\sum_{x_1,\dots,x_k\in\mathbb{Z}^2} \prod_{i=1}^k  h(x_i)p_{2(n_i-n_{i-1})}(x_i-x_{i-1})\,,
