\vspace{3mm}

\noindent 2. Suppose that $r_X+r_Y=0$. Then, as $x\rightarrow\infty$,  
\begin{align}f_{S_n}(x)\sim \frac{\mathrm{e}^{-nr_X^2/2}}{(2s)^{n/2}\Gamma(n/2)} x^{n/2-1}\exp\bigg\{-\frac{x}{s(1+\rho)}\bigg\}\sum_{k=0}^\infty d_k(r_X,\rho,n)\frac{s^k}{x^k}, 
