{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:35:19.869062+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_19184fabdc66a27d8ee1558fe374d0ea318ee433bca87f23d615f0e297986561","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm box-bounds of arXiv:2609.03856, 'Consensus time for asynchronous $\ell^p$ relaxation: graph dependence'] Fix $1<p<\infty$, put $q=p/(p-1)$, and let $d,L\ge2$ be integers,
