{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:38:23.622901+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1929210d6d4a1798094fa24a1fbbd95346b9cb95190d6d33ea471876906161f4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma EHI:l:ChernoffExpectation of arXiv:2511.08956, '\textbf{Towards a characterization of elliptic Harnack inequality for jump processes}'] If $X$ is an isotropic unimodal L\'{e}vy jump process on $\mathbb{R}^d$, then
