	for all $\eta \in C^{{\infty}}(\mathbb{T}^3)$ and  $t\in [0,T)$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:03.905743+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_193c491478704cc2ee2aad707ac768d72e33d88fe68d7659b51960663ffade33","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 15 of arXiv:2606.20948, '\textsc{Slot decomposition of\\ continuous Box-Ball Systems}'] Let $\alpha \in \mathcal A$ and $q \in \mathscr Q$ satisfy
