{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:04:06.984825+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_19d06aeb931e5dfe5853b1766d864ffc2f818ccb470655f23ab6f95e485e6981","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:perturbed_beta_corners of arXiv:2607.27810, 'Perturbed Beta Corners Process'] The \emph{perturbed Gaussian $\beta$-corners process}
	with perturbation $\mathbf{a}=(a_1,\ldots,a_N)$
	is a random interlacing array
	$\mathbf{y}^{1} \prec \mathbf{y}^{2} \prec \cdots \prec \mathbf{y}^{N-1} \prec \mathbf{y}^{N} = \mathbf{z}$,
	with joint density
	\begin{equation}

		F_{\mathbf{a}}(\mathbf{Y},\mathbf{z})\coloneqq
		f_{\mathbf{a}}(\mathbf{z})\cdot \Lambda_{\mathbf{a}}(\mathbf{Y};\mathbf{z}),
	\end{equation}
	where $f_{\mathbf{a}}$ is the perturbed G$\beta$E density (equation eq:density_perturbed_GbetaE of the paper), and
	the perturbed links are defined as
	\begin{equation}

			\Lambda_{\mathbf{a}}(\mathbf{Y};\mathbf{z})
		 \coloneqq
			\Lambda(\mathbf{Y};\mathbf{z})\cdot
		 \frac{1}{B_{\mathbf{a}}(\mathbf{z};\beta)}
		 \exp\left[a_{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}z_{i}+\sum_{k=1}^{N-1}\sum_{i=1}^{k}y^{k}_{i}(a_{k}-a_{k+1})\right].
	\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:43:45.393782+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_19d174cd21abc4c9ecb1658cb8aeec767ac3be9ece47a2bd4fda2a042d0d90d2","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 32 of arXiv:2609.04139, 'The conformally invariant metric on CLE$_4$ II:\\ existence of geodesics'] Let $\Gamma_{\BH}$ be a non-nested CLE$_4$ in $\BH$. Let $\delta > 0$. Then for each $x, y \in \BH$ with $\Im(x) \wedge \Im(y) \ge \delta$ and each $z \in \partial\BH$, 
