    \end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:56:36.586273+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_19e77888c2a32dc63ffe025c0ef6185b3e62236ad69e2a6f51c72625bb9759de","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma perturbationnormlized of arXiv:2608.30491, 'The Daugavet property in symmetric operator spaces'] Suppose that   $\{
