{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:07:35.012822+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1a2cc7557ae10515a85d68eae27f31caa06ecc615611cde98bcb601c0e93dc2d","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 54 of arXiv:2609.02850, 'Canonical-row Chern flow on Bott--Samelson towers:\\ realizable-volume models for Schubert'] For $0\le t\le c_a$, define on $Y_a$
