\item if $p< p'$ and $q+p< q'$, then $H^{p',q'}(\Sigma\setminus\{a_{2g+2}\},T^*\Sigma\otimes\mathfrak{g})$ is compactly embedded in $H^{p,q}(\Sigma\setminus\{a_{2g+2}\},T^*\Sigma\otimes\mathfrak{g})$.

