		\end{align} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:33:11.952313+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1a618a4551f9a1d4e04e3db29eb24b949c407e6493ff6c171c47ff1ab9b53abf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:orthant of arXiv:2607.14087, 'Stochastic Domination of Gaussian Maxima: A Resolution of the Weak Simplex Conjecture'] Let $R$ be an $m\times m$ correlation matrix satisfying
