{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.589905+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1a6f8f2ddc5c87954615f9731f1dedfde4005963670cf367b74829ee12ec7849","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition Prop.601 of arXiv:2411.15485, '\bf\Large Stochastic Volterra Equations for Local Times of Spectrally Positive L\'evy Proc'] Consider two functions $g,h\in L^1_{\rm loc}(\mathbb{R}_+;\mathbb{R}) $. 
