{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:38:37.419918+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1aa99d8af02ca544241d54a590c7fa4fb65c8cb4547399324d87a2e912254a26","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 30 of arXiv:2605.16560, 'Seasonal Statistics of Shannon Rate in a Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Cellular Network'] The following Laplace orderings between \textnormal{SINR} and \textnormal{STINR}, compared under their respective Palm probability spaces, hold true for both the non-tropical and tropical cases:
