{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:15.346347+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1aaabb1d52dfaf1fc227152c1e4226bac66e3e3b7957cad16d6851221f14cccc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 47 of arXiv:2506.15044, '2506.15044'] Let $X\in \mathcal{S}^\mathbb{C}$ and $H\in \mathcal{L}^\mathbb{C}(X)$.
