{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:53.164740+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1aaefe89bc60f54a46c37567616f92ed6e2bef3ad244b0cd35c10d386b4a8bc7","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 14 of arXiv:2607.02777, 'Hypocoercivity for Hamiltonian Diffusions \\ with Singular Drift'] Define $(S,\core )$ and $(A,C_c^1(\Omega))$ via
