{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:00:22.781245+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1ae38e2974a6b23855de6767a11ccdab87933633f514d37d84480f2e9ed15068","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lm of arXiv:2411.01633, 'On the Limit of the Tridiagonal Model \\for $\beta$-Dyson Brownian Motion'] For any fixed $t$, the infimum,
