{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:51:12.740951+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1ba02fd411b9037690d997b637dd67bf35fbc2df83972b29c6c8910742bf8c01","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 17 of arXiv:2605.02430, '\textbf{Scaling limit of the range of tree-valued branching random walks in random environ'] \textbf{(Invariant GW trees)} Let $\nu$ be a supercritical offspring distribution whose mean is denoted by 
