{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:47:32.864104+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1bd88eb2798aa3085fbbf75f956fd3a301b7cd7b6107f0ce8b5e79d63da2503b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2609.02426, 'Deformations of the $\osp(n|2)$-action on the superspace\\ of symbols of differential oper'] Let $\lambda,\mu\in\R$ and $k\geq1$. Then, for all $i$,
