where $\mathcal{V}_i,1\leq i\leq 6$ are the functions defined in Lemmas (lemma_xinlandu_gendif of the paper), (lemma_steinmethod_xlessthanl_gendif of the paper) and (lemma_steinmethod_xmorethanu_gendif of the paper).  
