{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.576472+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1c2af14b72b81a95b8f47b0098c9dcb49989fe55d74fb18f69597d4426f3aa3d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 of arXiv:2606.14812, 'Joint convergence in Wiener chaos via transport hierarchy and Malliavin covariances'] Let $ (X_{N}= I_{p} (f_{N}), N\geq 1)$ with $p\geq 2$ satisfying (\ref{c1}). 

