{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:17:17.074852+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1c5e0da6e5370e93c996950dec03c1557199109c5d14d4161f347ee5bf0b87b5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2608.19753, 'Uniform large deviation principles for the stochastic heat equation over unbounded sets of'] Let Assumption \ref{asm} hold. Let $N>0$ and $q\in[1,\infty)$. 
