{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:29:35.082744+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1cd2f2a30a0a8d5a3db4bb0d0dcac3cbeda70fe063c69ededb5e8bae48b44128","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 18 of arXiv:2609.03803, 'List-distance consistent vertices in trees are confined to a path'] Let $G=SP(w;\ell_1,\dots,\ell_k)$ with $k\ge3$. Then
