{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:40:21.319975+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1cd5a45924df7bcdc0f9e24c86662a4ec33459c02b619befcea0dc1e8534a3cd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 25 of arXiv:2604.09933, 'Explicit cutoff profiles for colored top-\texorpdfstring{$m$}{m}-to-random shuffles'] With \(r=p\lambda\), the unique integer \(w^*\) satisfying \eqref{eq:wstar} is
