\end{align}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:57:49.853477+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1cdd92ee03f3ac22d051cdec02ce99dab2a62df74846d38f32cc71c0f73abe6a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:HypercontractiveAntiConcentration of arXiv:2410.23915, 'Asymptotic Bounds and Online Algorithms for Average-Case Matrix Discrepancy'] If $X$ is a $\kappa$-hypercontractive random variable, then for $0 < t < 1$ holds
