{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:15:54.905318+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1ce6ff3124a8ff5a0e149c5634f9b8e4f3283eca151eb4773e1027c852438f35","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:d-dbox-derivations of arXiv:2608.29708, 'Intuitionistic and Constructive Modal Logics for Classical Modal Logicians'] (1) $\textbf{WKD} \vdash \textsf{D}_\Box$.
  (2) $\textbf{KI} + \textsf{D}_\Box \vdash \textsf{D}$.
