{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:38:23.539523+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1ce9504f6f83f50c3012d1abc11a60925c0a69b090947d02ee68928d19642bb0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma LvarF of arXiv:2510.22701, 'Gaussian fluctuations in Mean Field Stable matchings'] With $\kappa_n\geqslant \log^{4} n$, there is a constant $C>0$ such that 
