{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:57:51.738325+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1cff599ba866e2118bbb6c719c74280e04326db099bb5ca53cc621dbbdc53d12","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2608.30089, 'On the Coefficients of Hurwitz-Type Matrix Polynomials'] Let \(A_0,\ldots,A_n\) be the coefficients of the HTM polynomial
\(\mathbf f_n\) defined by \eqref{hup01}, and suppose that
