{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:19.950171+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1d204c61324e51310fc31480ffb59f699ebaf57bbb8e9c4d5e242a37be19ba00","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 32 of arXiv:2608.02927, 'Thinning Operation via the Poisson-F\"ollmer Process'] Let $X$ have density $f$ with respect to $\pi_{T}$ and set 
