{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:10:08.788789+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1d2262669b065c787d8af6bef80d3753e694235d296ac4b597cc136f20fa5f9f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lT2 of arXiv:2411.18374, 'Drawdowns of diffusions'] For $y>x\vee(\delta+l)$

