{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:36.894385+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1d2421955f114a09258fdfe96b119f908da1e2724b43900f1aeeb45ca3b1de5b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma bilinearestforkdv of arXiv:2606.31155, 'The well-posedness of stochastic Korteweg--de Vries equations revisited'] Let $1/4< a, b < 1/2$, $a+2b\geq 5/4$, and $0<T<1$. We have
		\begin{equation*}
			\begin{aligned}
