{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:19:47.249563+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1d48f5a02afb05c5b7b2b5305d5fb9becaae7a0666443807c7cf9399df25585b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma_martingale_zeta of arXiv:2512.21159, '\textsc{From multitype branching Brownian motions\\ to branching Markov additive processes'] For $t\ge 0$, define
