{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:33:17.713212+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1df773f6d9c316ccb92370141c9efe271110d62798e4dcd3f713482f833f49f6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 39 (Kernel-to-shell Schur estimate) of arXiv:2607.10813, '2607.10813'] Let $T$ be a Fourier integral operator
