{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:00:46.840921+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1e221d50bea23d14f806d8c8dd537a1c8ccd18127670034d53655ebfec049d0d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 13 of arXiv:2608.13374, 'Nearly Sharp Comparison Results for sliced and max-sliced Wasserstein distances'] Let $d \geq 2$, and let $\mu, \nu$ be as above. Then:
