{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:16.149129+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1e2bbd76a6ca202186406be950fcf1a0400258575172720d73a1cca54af96b91","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 16 of arXiv:2604.13387, 'Multiradial Schramm-Loewner evolution: \\ Infinite-time large deviations and transience'] For any $t \geq 0$, we have
