{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.203375+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1e6fda10343848b610b05f49e2b866d29719925c8bf87235c0e4f3bd7c99d657","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma LemExactKL of arXiv:2608.28949, 'The information geometry of product-reference discrete diffusion: Interaction growth compl'] For any pair $0 < a < b < 1$, the one-step KL
divergence~(equation EqnDefnExactKL of the paper) has the exact representation
\begin{subequations}
  \begin{align}

