{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:09:43.679254+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1e7310c214d8c8cf041dcd2baa6f441d51fe335244e555fbf30fd446a90a1f83","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn d.moment-function of arXiv:2605.28430, 'Limit theory for Lipschitz-localized statistics in random geometric models'] \ 
