{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:16:53.617332+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1e78c67f993e891730df1746bfe2d13e620d8553d2d7201132ffd1a9d4e7f231","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:E of arXiv:2412.05491, 'Near-critical and finite-size scaling for \\ high-dimensional lattice trees and animals'] Let $d > 8$, $L \ge L_3$, and $m(p) L$ be sufficiently small.
