{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:53:10.157007+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1e96e2d6e9b8782c80237f3006a9a8938e2271968c816a6e487030e4b94de35c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop equiv-thom-from-global of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] The square
    \begin{equation}
        \begin{tikzcd}
            \ul\Spc^\otimes_{{\vphantom{\textup{t}}\smash{\textup{Orb}}}\triangleright\textup{Glo}/\ul\textup{VRep}^{\oplus}}\arrow[d,"L"']\arrow[r,"\ul{\textup{Th}}^\otimes"] &[.5em] {\mathpalette\ulhelper{\mathfrak S\kern-.5pt\mathfrak p}}\hbox{\rule[-2pt]{0pt}{0pt}}^\otimes\arrow[d,hook]\\
            \ul\Spc_{\textup{Glo}/\ul\textup{VRep}^{\oplus}}^\otimes\arrow[r,"\ul{\textup{Th}}_\textup{gl}^\otimes"'] & {\mathpalette\ulhelper{\mathfrak S\kern-.5pt\mathfrak p}}\hbox{\rule[-2pt]{0pt}{0pt}}_\textup{gl}^\otimes
