{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:38:37.418846+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1f091d592f8fae6d5c8548a0e872206e203a309c2fdfd6264d6bac9b36933723","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 16 (Laplace transform order $\leq_{\textnormal{L}}$) of arXiv:2605.16560, 'Seasonal Statistics of Shannon Rate in a Dynamical Poisson-Voronoi Cellular Network'] We say that two non-negative random variables $X,Y$ satisfy {\em Laplace order} 

