{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:04:59.420020+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1f22a2f36d8adb5d6dd5c8511b4d23bfd53f0eb984b1fd259aff7e27f702bd5d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:variance-edge-identity of arXiv:2605.17513, 'Nonconcentration of hitting times for random walks on graphs'] For every \(x,y\in V\),
