{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.057350+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1f2841ac43f54651afc418cc5934bfc7d105a036f51976bb8e5ea2067baf4f06","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:occupation-current-geometry of arXiv:2608.16119, 'Fully nonlinear parabolic equations under a fixed reference diffusion: weighted \texorpdfs'] Under Assumptions~(ass:reference-diffusion of the paper) and
