{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:26:47.167456+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1f4ab1e2855f00244a4d1164ced5bb7001586b831b9ca3f4224d7df51422cf5c","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Dfn 56 (measure classes) of arXiv:2608.29416, 'Algorithmic threshold for high-dimensional projection pursuit I: general theory'] Recall the definition of the endpoint measure $\mu(q_*,b,\sigma,p,\zeta)$ from \eqref{e:control.problems.endpoint.measures}.
