{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:18.054812+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1f5ae1dfc507435f761b65b7387eccc53e204011aca20adaac70fbdd40d5794d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 4 (Convexity of $\psi$) of arXiv:2606.16636, 'Free energy of non-convex multi-species spin glasses with centered Ising spins'] For every $q_0,q_1 \in \mcl Q_1^\sS$ and \(\lambda\in[0,1]\), we have
\begin{equation*}
