        \mylim_{\varepsilon\to0}\mathbb{E}\left[\mysup_{t\in[0, T]}\left(\int_0^t\mathscr{Y}_s\left({\Phi'(\bar\rho_\theta)}\iota_\varepsilon^j\right)\de s\right)^2\right] = 0.
