{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.360864+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_1f8581e3429b834dd8d24e6f20c2b74136275372b006cda0db0136508f139078","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 42 of arXiv:2511.09517, 'From Cannings model to Brownian motion conditioned on local time profile'] For any $\delta>0$, we have uniformly for $h_*+\frac{n}{(\log n)^{1+\frac{\varepsilon}{8}}}\le s \le h^*$,
