{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.255457+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2001a1571f010c0e425aad5831a1a5b51a6cef40d67b286b552ca9938c422237","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 36 ({\cite[Lemma 4.2) of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] {Cr18}}]\quad\par
  \begin{itemize}
