{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:20:55.583993+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_203fd09b059b86dfe2fe03e9e62e9ccf0ac84d56a85021a8acd9234d195fe876","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:G-bounds of arXiv:2411.07680, 'Energy solutions of singular SPDEs on Hilbert spaces with applications to domains with bou'] Let $\rho: H \rightarrow V$ be a bounded operator.
