{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:22:20.954118+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_207f9f5fb26cc0035925493543e7842e6bac8b070e0bec38adf54e87bfce662c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Knowntheorem 2 (\cite{Burk84, BW95}) of arXiv:2604.09365, 'Cotlar martingale transforms and related singular integrals'] Suppose $M$ and $N$ are two martingales as above.    
