where $\Gamma$ is defined in \eqref{eq.mombd-a}. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:50:44.858050+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2090b9d0dc98cb5c5563a90e3023ca0b3014b8e86ab77362b4018c6b998447ed","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 24 of arXiv:2607.16479, 'The Site Frequency Spectrum in an Exponentially-Growing Population with Selection'] We obtain the following bound on $S_{j}(t)$ on the event $B=\{\inf_{t>0} Z_0(t)e^{-\lambda_0 t}>x\}$ for $x>0$, $k$, and $\delta\in (0,1)$:
