\mathcal Z(\zeta)=2a\sqrt{a^2+1}+\frac{1}{2\pi\i}\int_{\gamma_\zeta}f(z)g(z)\d z, \quad \text{and} \quad \vartheta(\zeta)=\frac{1}{2\pi\i}\int_{\gamma_\zeta}f(z)\bar g(z)\d z,
