where~$f$ and~$g$ are given in Corollary~\ref{cor:goulomb_gauge} and~$\bar g(z)=\overline{g(\bar z)}$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:51:11.635522+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_209807826d5b2b295696028f485e1921f67e77b821802c71765283ce01dc6b42","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 29 of arXiv:2605.31088, 'On couplings for kinetic Langevin diffusions'] For all $a>0$ and $t\geq0$ we have
