{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:02:11.357097+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_209a319dfb8636b15c36b26b444ad17a7bcc2061e100ff5f7638b9ec747939a7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prob prob-sets of arXiv:2510.26123, 'Directed distances in bipolar-oriented triangulations:\\ exact exponents and scaling limit'] Compute the scaling exponents for the sizes of various special sets associated with longest and shortest directed paths on uniform bipolar-oriented triangulations, e.g. the following. 
