{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:47:12.039827+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_209b55850ed582b9cdc3286a2569ff9d8c07fb52b9d9a12bd7b63b3e0d0a2136","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem-Sob-space-comp of arXiv:2512.17727, 'Stochastic transport equation with L\'evy noise'] Assume the assumptions of  Theorem (d32 of the paper).
