{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:54:15.661344+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_209cc3161493c4deb5ac69c8c519c3a510ed4add7374363ae57e1925c9c1106c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 19 of arXiv:2608.09700, 'A general paracontrolled ansatz for singular SPDEs'] For any symbol $\tau\in \mcB \sqcup \mcB^+$, the distribution $Y_\tau$ is in $C^{|\tau|}$, and furthermore we have the continuity estimate
