{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:49:15.474380+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_20abbfa96b774bf16be16fda4388d6d974be26b55a31bb19e94d1b022b650748","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma h-cof-compute-po-unbased of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] Let $G$ be a compact Lie group, and let
    \begin{equation}
       \begin{tikzcd}
