{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:52:23.587147+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_20b5f33765119d15dd5aba7cff86a53f22361b3d5be7787fa29c3f9641323f12","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:poisson_summation_hyperuniform of arXiv:2602.19773, 'Regularization of a stationary point process by a stationary increments perturbation'] There exists a positive finite Borel measure $\mu$ supported on $\mathbb{R}_{+}$ such that 
