where $Z, \{Z_\lambda\}_{\lambda\in\mathrm{Spec}^-(\triangle_{W})}$ are i.i.d. $N(0,\,1)$ and 
\begin{equation}
    \tau_W^2 : =\frac{1}{2} \int_{[0, 1]^2} W(x,\,y)W(y,\,x)(t_W( 
