{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:32:29.005673+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2127d8e91f334a47e4e4c7c90f2e2c316e5a9495aafda5fa7740e22d56b08abc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem typP 1 suc of arXiv:2608.25471, 'Exact Hausdorff measures and fine geometry of collisions of independent Markov processes'] Suppressing $n$,
