\qquad
\norm{\widehat\theta-\theta}
=O_{\mathbb P}\!\left(
\frac{\log(M/\delta)}{N}
\right)^{\alpha/(2\alpha+3)}.

\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:35:57.166256+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_21348df4a87bff8e2a58fcc7b92cb8a3251b26f43d9515e8b9369640e44fb695","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Conjecture conj:fluctuations of arXiv:2604.08154, '\small Hydrodynamic limit of the directed exclusion process'] The field $(\ensuremath{\mathcal Y}_t^\varepsilon)_{t\ge 0}$ given, for all test functions $f:\mathbb{R}\to \mathbb{R}$ and $t\ge 0$, by
