{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:04.988444+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_218b850e4fb5db9e3ae220040bd64af80f49ca0ee9e20b19a401e262d85cbf31","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 9 of arXiv:2604.00742, 'Delayed Logistic equation as a limit\\ of long memory Markov chains'] The entire initial condition converges uniformly on the interval $[-\tau,0]$, i.e, 
