{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:59:58.428243+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2216680be71c2f81e329fdc1628f6a87955a7695ccbc66147dda252a8979de7a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:2 of arXiv:2604.20094, 'Persistence and local extinction for superprocesses in random environments'] Let $d\geqslant 1$. Suppose that   $a>0 $ and
