{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.096010+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2226c8642e4e7706b6d31cf7b63b1c3be7269eb443d24f3e7ba7c128c5d7d538","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lem144 of arXiv:2609.02795, 'Global smooth behavior in Kuznetsov and Westervelt type\\ viscous wave equations:\\ A unif'] Assume ((h of the paper)), ((f0 of the paper)) and ((f1 of the paper)) with some $\lambda>1$, let $p\ge 2$ be such that $p>n$, 
