{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:51:11.643953+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_222a86ecc3eb081682abe0ebe2ec43ed0a30f8eeffcbb7faa27c36d6ddd584f1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 22 of arXiv:2605.31471, 'Convergence Rates of Continuous-Time Random Walks to Time-Fractional Diffusions with Unbou'] Let Assumption~\ref{asm:classical} hold. Let $L$ be the generator of the diffusion
        corresponding to \eqref{eq:SDE-flow}, acting on $f\in D_2$ by
