{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:17.759546+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_222f0d91bf2db5d2b86d5e0e032e46690ee07af9c017f8b79c87fbba436ef52b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 29 of arXiv:2511.05386, 'CLT for $\beta$-ensembles with Freud weights, application to the KLS conjecture in Schatte'] Let $p>2$.
