{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:32:20.691385+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_225527ab9625b1c637856039b13d590adc87f6d1206c8dabbcd1c831216489a8","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 45 of arXiv:2609.00245, 'Higher-order Gaussian bounds for maximally subelliptic boundary value problems'] Let \(\sI\) be an index set, and for \(\iota \in \sI\) let \(X_1^\iota,\ldots, X_{q_\iota}^\iota\in \CbinftySpace[U][\Rn]\)
