{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:15:34.487084+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2265d8532aede76b06b6c698fce3a1c7e572e2cbd27e5ffd296baa6b23d620f6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 7 of arXiv:2609.03332, 'Singularity Models of Finite-Time K\"ahler-Ricci Flows'] For the submersion $\widehat{\pi}' : \widehat{M} \to N'$, we have:

