{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:35:10.789750+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_226d581ae3a75c1827176806ddcc928f4611b116d5029eb2eaa8a8e370128cde","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 35 of arXiv:2604.00630, 'The contact process on a bipartite spatial network'] If~$(\gamma_1,\gamma_2,a) \in \mathcal S \times (0,\infty)$ with~$\gamma_2 > 1/2$, then
