{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:28:33.706401+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_227e4dc7bdfefbb6ad35bc47e9a6c81e2bbd30c20969197016def563554d9d0a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor cA3 of arXiv:2504.07255, 'A Tail-Respecting Splitting Numerical Scheme\\ for L\'evy-Driven SDEs With Superlinear Dri'] For any $q\in (0,p)$
\begin{equation}\begin{aligned}
\sup_{t\in[t_k, t_{k+1})} \mathbf{E}^{(N)}_{t_1,\dots,t_N}\Big[\|\Delta_t^n\|^q\Big|\mathcal{F}_{t_k}\Big]
\leq_C \|\Delta_{t_k}^n\|^q
& + h_n^{(\frac{p-q}{\chi}\wedge q) + (1\wedge\frac{q}{2})}(1+\|X_{t_k}^{(n)}\|^p)
+ h_n^{\frac{p-q}{\chi}\wedge q}(1+\|X_{t_k}^n\|^{p})\\
&+ h_n^{1\wedge\frac{q}{2}}  (U_{t_k}^n)^q
+h_n^{(\frac{p-q}{\chi }\wedge q)   +(1\wedge\frac{q}{2})} (U_{t_k}^n)^{(p-q)\wedge (q\chi)}
+h_n^{1\wedge\frac{q}{2}}
\end{aligned}\end{equation}
for $n$ large enough uniformly over
$N\in\mathbb{N}_0$, partitions $\{t_1,\dots, t_N\}$,  and $k=0, \dots, N$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:23.371250+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_227e77add1db07b28261d45230836fe46ee167ad87b4c12da71306e837fb2714","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2512.08595, 'Small time asymptotics of spectral heat content of isotropic processes'] Suppose that $f\in C^{1,\kappa}(\R^d)$ with $|\nabla f(x)-\nabla f(y)|\le L|x-y|^\kappa$ for all $x,y\in\R^d$, and $t>0$. Then,
