{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:46:00.367357+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_229648ff886d4102f4b5fdea82e3df03d9117cfb01694ca454a1f7d9ca7e129d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:v of arXiv:2607.20956, 'Sharp moduli of continuity for Gaussian fields and stochastic PDEs via correlation bounds'] Fix $0<t_1<t_2$.
