{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:58:09.905689+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2296d9759a3d520e0c8759ced49a048fd72c64b01726532f811fa277be737ac7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary of arXiv:2607.19583, 'Density-Dependent McKean--Vlasov Diffusions: Subgaussian Occupancy Bounds and Polynomial P'] Under the hypotheses of [BelomestnyMorozova], in particular the stated assumptions on the initial density and on $\Xi$, equation (2.3) gives the small-time gradient estimate:
