{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:34.002286+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_229b075722d9e93d4ad7333e2c7abcd6e85fa118ec5a28a7008f6b34099b1c7e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 61 of arXiv:2609.03403, 'Hyperpositive functions, sector bounded functions and a trace formula'] Let $0\le T\le I_m$, and let $F$ be a $\mathbb C^{m\times m}$-valued function analytic in $\mathbb C_r$. The kernel
