{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:56:37.653257+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_22c649810e44b1ab65a06cd34eb744f0e2020e61b98b01b695713a8b5bd3a8fc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:kernel of arXiv:2608.24830, 'Motion helps the contact process: survival below\\ the percolation threshold on Poisson Br'] There are constants $c,C$ depending only on $d$ such that, for all $\Delta>0$ and all
