{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:27:11.219662+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_22e340271a965d791c0fd1efb80fe98bdce05f9d797660c6529a7c5b24f7b42e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:equivalent of arXiv:2605.19894, 'Sharp Spectral Thresholds for Multi-View Spiked Wigner Models'] For any fixed $\epsilon>0$, uniformly over $z\in \cU_{\Gamma}(\epsilon)$ and deterministic matrices $A\in\CC^{nL\times nL}$, the following holds
