{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:38:57.142489+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2333653813577bebea5a02eb1c556cd9dc219e2e365a34d44132fb65f88b649e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 12 of arXiv:2604.05910, '\textbf{Well-posedness and Hurst parameter estimation for fluid equations driven by fracti'] Let $x:\left[ 0,t\right] \rightarrow \mathbb{R}$ be a $\gamma $-H\"older
