{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:45:17.698199+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2363ad6c46470d1cf8d5af26b25dcb27e4943720be728c3e4f0e026ef7fcbfec","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition eq:cond.tau of arXiv:2604.08505, '\LARGE{On $d$-stochastic measures with fractal support and uniform $(d-1)$-marginals, and '] We say that $\tau \in \mathcal{T}_d^\mathbf{m}$ with $d\geq 3$ fulfills the uniformity condition w.r.t. coordinate $j_0 \in \{1,\ldots,d\}$, if 
