  \end{eqnarray}
  for all $p>n\cdot\max\{\lambda,2\}$ fulfilling $p\ge 2\cdot\max\{\lambda,2\}$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:19:42.643542+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_236adb3664d291eb130aa016f4ad82469410ea75f5c8a8665efe3079b3b1d57f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 26 ({\cite{DorflingGoddardHenning2006}}) of arXiv:2609.03512, ''] Let $G$ be a planar graph with $\operatorname{diam}(G)=3$. Then the following hold:
