{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:24:34.415379+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_24199253f190b1bdf0a0cce9ddf1041dd31d7bbd0d0adced7c061d46547ebeba","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 (Expansions) of arXiv:2608.31099, '\bf On (fake) Stationarity in Stochastic Volterra Equations with Affine Drift and Regular '] We have the following inequalities:
