{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:48:45.322179+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2421477308730cd5b343476d34ca0e0e37c0af8d9bbc4c7c12c1f190c68f67b9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary c:BSCStronglyLocal of arXiv:2411.14936, 'Massive Particle Systems,\\Wasserstein Brownian Motions,\\ and the Dean--Kawasaki Equation'] In the setting of Theorem~(t:BendikovSaloffCoste of the paper) and under assumptions~(i:t:BendikovSaloffCoste:a of the paper)--(i:t:BendikovSaloffCoste:f of the paper) there, further define the following assumptions:
