{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:10:07.474884+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_24553b00ba47f1f52a1728e66f4d5249a2a1209d9e235a58a3de737eff9f494a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:joint-K-subg of arXiv:2607.27613, 'Regularized Bulk Universality versus Bounded-Disorder Nonuniversality\\for Annealed Comple'] \label[lemma]{lem:remainder-tight}
