{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:36:16.065604+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_24824e08b42a528852007008f0373afb8d7bc4065f50b12cf23326bf1dad26f6","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def_function_spaces of arXiv:2606.28575, 'Global smooth solutions by high mode Lie-Transport noise for Logarithmically Hyperdissipat'] For $s\in \mathbb{R}$ we denote by 
