        H^{s}_g=\Big\{h\in \mathscr{S}'(\mathbb{T}^3;\mathbb{R}^3):\operatorname{div}h=0,\int_{\mathbb{T}^3}h \mathrm{d}x=0, \sum_{k=(m,j)\in I} \lvert m\rvert^{2s}g(|m|)^{s+1}\langle h,e_{k}\rangle^2<+\infty\Big\}
