{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.706822+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_24d619e57fe8ae57a5e5d3f7f7a43f4fff052f0dc6cc3f55f8c440e3e2c22380","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 2 of arXiv:2608.06232, 'The mean absolute deviation of the classical discrete distributions:\\ collapse identities'] Let $\alpha$ range over a compact subset of $(0,\infty)$ and $h$ over a compact subset of
