where $\mu_{x_1,x_2}^\mathrm{Bub}$ is defined in~(equation eq:bubble-two-pinned of the paper).
Recall that $\mathcal{U}(A)$ denotes the unbounded connected component of $\mathbbm{H}\setminus A$ for a compact subset $A\subset\ol\mathbbm{H}$.","status":"unverified"}

