{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:27:25.799233+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2553363ac5792a1a67c41a75263155f18f41f080a834e02e10142ecac1b280cc","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:exact-dissipation of arXiv:2605.17082, 'Spectral Purification in Reversible Markov Chains: Hidden Parameters, Observable Equivalen'] For every reversible Markov chain and every centered initial condition $g_0 \perp \mathbf{1}$,
