{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:32:34.745747+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_255f7320b7d57b0b31f4a541e9fd3d5a928df9aad70864dd9d15318577153fe2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma phi_bound of arXiv:2411.07878, 'Bernstein-type and Bennett-type inequalities for unbounded matrix martingales'] Fix $\lambda, \alpha > 0$. Let $y > 0$ satisfy
