{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:44:17.357494+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_25f3e40a88332f325183b26496c5db9c75d5cf6db3ad655753891fa35643945f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:revealability-scale-identification of arXiv:2608.23860, 'Revelation Control'] Under Equation~(equation eq:location-scale-refinement of the paper),
\begin{equation}
