{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:17.753338+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_26b04133b83c2c5d3a57191182ca7e58c0c767c7612b573f8128051f4893f8ab","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 10 of arXiv:2511.02763, 'The Cayley-Moser problem with Poissonian arrival of offers'] Assume 
$M<\infty$, where $M$ is given by \eqref{def_M}.
