{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:35:05.802301+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_26b1db2ae013eb7a25e2f68a3bfc85b9bab92eef3e085b2efca33f5925a25702","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition P:vidotto of arXiv:2606.23865, 'Uniform-in-time Gaussian fluctuations for multiscale nonlinear stochastic systems via Mall'] [vido_2020]
