{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:36:23.133963+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_26b368df7cdef6e6ebb854603f849295bbdcb4e43ae979f4ca3b181da018783a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem ComLem of arXiv:2506.18207, 'Cartan's Path Development, the Logarithmic Signature and a Conjecture of Lyons-Sidorova'] Let $0\leqslant s\leqslant R$ be given fixed and
