		\big|\phi_{\Lambda, \beta}^0[\mathcal{A}] - \phi_{\Lambda, \beta'}^0[\mathcal{A}]\big| \leq C |\beta - \beta'| \sqrt{\Triangle_{\Lambda}(\beta_c)\max\{\phi_{\Lambda, \beta}^0[\mathcal{A}], \phi_{\Lambda, \beta'}^0[\mathcal{A}]\}\phi_{\Lambda, \beta'}^0\big[|\mathcal C(0)|\big]}. 
