{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:44:39.706936+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_27965e618e16140d3017997a080a64b2a5bede015db3029975fd9fbb0ec85f23","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 (Entropy inequality and \(L^1\) bound) of arXiv:2608.29726, '\LARGE A Priori Estimates for Singular Fractional Stochastic Burgers Equations'] There exists \(c_\Psi>0\), depending only on \(\gamma\) and the uniform
