{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:47:32.879073+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_27db84972d18c683ac0210b8b0ea36323c6337c68adb87211a8d1e543f4ecfed","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 2 of arXiv:2609.02478, 'Improved Weyl bounds on short intervals'] Let $p>d$ be prime, let $P\in\mathbb F_p[X]$ have degree $d\ge3$, and let
