{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:33:43.755496+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_27f94245f2e880736de6c00e9cde1843881db81d1f8c9d36d8b0baccc5b617ae","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem_YK_Gam of arXiv:2609.02136, 'Gamma approximation and Poisson--Gaussian invariance principle on Poisson chaos'] Let $Y_K$ be as in (equation def_YK of the paper).
As $K\to\infty$,
\noindent
\begin{align}
 Y_K\xrightarrow{\mathrm d}Z_\nu,

