{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:27:11.219529+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2829cd436c282ab7f13cfe73e90e814bf708bd20e9754e6eba9ed35a5de6e922","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:partial_trace_equivalent of arXiv:2605.19894, 'Sharp Spectral Thresholds for Multi-View Spiked Wigner Models'] Recall the domain $\cU_{\Gamma}(\epsilon)$ in~(equation eq:domain for unfirom convergence of the paper). Uniformly over $z\in \cU_{\Gamma}(\epsilon)$, we have
