\inf_{\alpha\in\mathcal{A}}\underline{J}(K,\alpha) = \liminf_{\rho\downarrow0}\inf_{\alpha\in\mathcal{A}}J^{K_\rho}(\xi,\alpha) =\lambda_*(K) \, ,\quad
\inf_{\alpha\in\mathcal{A}}\overline{J}(K,\alpha) = \limsup_{\rho\downarrow0}\inf_{\alpha\in\mathcal{A}}J^{K_\rho}(\xi,\alpha) =\lambda^*(K) \,. 

