{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:28:34.972215+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_28f74cab7d7c1e41f62fd7238540f7f0da0b27266d0259f983aaa4d5ba90fcbb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop q_coproduct_coefs of arXiv:2412.05999, 'Non-Archimedean GUE corners and Hecke modules'] Let $m,n \in \mathbb{N}$ and $\lambda,\nu \in \Sig_n$. Then
