{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:10:43.822152+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_294678be461feb5a9db791d00a32bc369a565825e2ab49bf6e193f3124eef0df","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition of arXiv:2412.04334, 'Fractional counting process at L\'{e}vy times and its applications'] The mgf of the TCFCP $Z(t,\lambda _{\theta }),\;t\geq 0$,
