{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:41.028009+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_294a9a944a3a6b255db936995743e4f1f27ee05f9c574c4ffd54f128d1d79189","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 2-l02 of arXiv:2412.04015, 'Linear fluctuation of interfaces in Glauber-Kawasaki dynamics'] With the notation of Lemma (l2 of the paper),
\begin{equation*}
