where $\mu_k^{(0)}$ is as in ((Eq: muk0 of the paper)) and $ D_t^{(\alpha)} $ satisfies ((eq:order-Dt of the paper)). (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:26:02.556502+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_29516cec37ba40a1b1efb848bc1477f1886ef84b9b8b12e0c36a3043cd4d1869","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition isotdec of arXiv:2608.30747, 'Compact homogeneous complex manifolds'] \hspace{1cm} 
