{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:25:49.875266+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2952f0d2b9f5c5d26e2602ef3937f243465a1924c87454080f58887ebf2fc2cb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 24 of arXiv:2609.02064, 'Coalescence and fluctuations of O'Connell--Yor polymers\\ via the free-energy correlation '] For every compact $K\subset\R$,
