{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:51:15.032807+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_29530bd2dd3e8b7ec04e4721c57252e99b9ea84b72b223b08913a7b721f6aa7a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6tmod4 of arXiv:2609.03926, 'Overcolored Partition $k$-tuples Restricted by Parity of the Parts'] We have
