            -\circ F\colon{\textup{Hom}}_{\CAT_T^\textup{$S$-cc}}({\mathcal{D}},{\mathcal{E}})\to{\textup{Hom}}_{\CAT_T^\textup{$S$-cc}}({\mathcal{C}},{\mathcal{E}})
