Then the family $\{Y^\epsilon_y: \epsilon>0,\ y\in\mathfrak{E}_0\}$ satisfies the Freidlin-Wentzell uniform LDP in $\mathfrak{E}$ uniformly on $\mathfrak{E}_0$ with good rate functions $\mathcal{I}_y:\mathfrak{E}
