{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.578817+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2a01e021c8cc35d89fc348d24153c3cc374559a860bb72e41ecf6b634dc540fc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 12 (Bonami--Beckner \cite{Bonami1970Fourier,Beckner1975inequalities}) of arXiv:2606.14876, 'High-Order Talagrand and Eldan--Gross Inequalities via Besov-Type Variance Functionals'] For $f:\cube^n\to \Rbb$, $t\geq 0$ and $p \geq 1+\upe^{-2t}$,
