    where we also used Remark~(r: f_r formulas of the paper). Now the assertion follows from Theorem~(t:asymptotic variance test function of the paper) since we assumed that $\Psi_q$ is (beyond) $(p-2q)$-uniform for $q\in\{0,...,n\}$.

