{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:25:49.871452+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2a5c1677d7d195ab866b0b58035ba048550029f971d5062f294d85257659b726","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 7 (\textsf{Zero-temperature BLPP identity}) of arXiv:2609.02064, 'Coalescence and fluctuations of O'Connell--Yor polymers\\ via the free-energy correlation '] Fix $n\in\Z_{>0}$, $\al\in\R$, and $x,\wt x\in\R$ with
