{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:42.309653+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2a88f9d77fd1fafa82215c4fb77a2fcca0e815158aad2a35ab6405f9211873ea","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn 102 of arXiv:2510.22155, 'Random walks in space-time random media in all spatial dimensions: the full subcritical fl'] Let $k,d\in\mathbb N$. Suppose that $\br\in \Ekk$, and define 
