	\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:04:30.568289+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2af47d30e426a1873db9a8b6818a67b4cd98cd7365f526584a99367c86c0aaa5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:Global law for A of arXiv:2411.10311, 'Planar Novikov-Shubin invariant for adjacency matrices of structured directed dense random'] Let $A $ be the adjacency matrix of the directed stochastic block model as defined above. Then 
