{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:27:14.927599+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2bf147ed107b2ea1f0e9ab19c330e40b886b960b8dd4c46d6d1e319c1e717097","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 (Expression for the directional derivative) of arXiv:2608.24294, 'Existence of densities and atoms for the running maximum of time-inhomogeneous jump diffus'] Under Assumptions~\ref{ass:Levy} and~\ref{ass:jump}, with $\Theta=(0,v)$ as above,
