{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:51:15.033808+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2bf6268e34561f8f340e19105e470ba304cb2344b554e5ba753d17bb2e5d8100","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6tmod3.2 of arXiv:2609.03926, 'Overcolored Partition $k$-tuples Restricted by Parity of the Parts'] For all $n,r,s,k\ge 0$, $0\le t\le 2$, $0\le u\le 2$, we have
