{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:22:46.470403+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2bfcc88014820b2062c624a24640ceb69a21019b525f0c3ca48a9116dfdc78a4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 88 of arXiv:2609.03101, 'The emergence of the Cauchy horizon from the crease for $3D$ compressible Euler flow'] \cite[Simple commutator identities; Lemma 8.5]{LukSpeck2024stability}

