{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:25.278803+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2bfe9dc0c13e95bd86cea5c6d4ef379a05cf1386022a1bfbc4117dd0cb9e668e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 21 of arXiv:2606.21433, 'Central limit theorem for\\ the averaged Adam optimizer'] Assume the setting of \cref{thm-1} and let $(\bar \Pi[m,n])_{1\le m\le n}$ be as in~\cref{def:bar_Pi}.
