{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:45:05.524571+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2c34f3fba5ad48f1ac95befba1626362117117966a11b94c86dff702546182b4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 17 of arXiv:2608.05185, '\large\bf ON THE HEAT FLOW CONJECTURE FOR RANDOM MATRICES'] For every deterministic \(z\in\C\),
