{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:50:48.843539+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2c6ce1ba97dafac4212ecc10079d24e1b36176afc90d8c45f43ef1175bb824b0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:eta.dym of arXiv:2607.07598, 'Universal Central Limit Theorem for non-exchangeable interacting diffusions'] Let $f\in C_b^2({\mathbb{R}}^d)$. For $t \in [0,T]$,
			\begin{align}
				\begin{split}
