{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:54:15.624437+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2c88b842532e2497dcd8142a6426e1ae121d135398337f432eff9b72f4649874","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 87 (Replicable grade-one saturation source) of arXiv:2608.08756, 'Infinite-Dimensional L\'evy Area and Spectral Ancestry'] Fix $\beta\in(1/3,1/2)$.  A sequence of one-cell random critical geometries
