{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:58:44.402141+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2d303cbdb3ac2884b625e54c4af4b73695d36869d2338d5b16cae8c75962234e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 23 (Ky Fan Domination Principle \cite{MR45952}) of arXiv:2609.02837, '2609.02837'] For $A,B \in \M_n$, the following are equivalent.
