{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.728558+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2d3eebd6444200a5e8b1cde7dd09eac140d1d0ab31f089c26c4518104a4df3dc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:spectralfracpw of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] [MR3772040] 
