{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:57:20.590969+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2d7f1a1ff315fa6d8cf10648a3f672c5d5d2ba3992ebad4b320aada5056fb186","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary YA of arXiv:2411.09976, 'Occupation times on the legs of a diffusion spider'] For  $r\in\{1,2,\dotsc, R\}$ and $z_i>0,\, i=1,2,\dotsc,r,$ 
