{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:25.932941+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2dac72fedf6c2e699605ec1802993e0a32d30f411e8fa273cd8791b2585ab15b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 38 (Following the paths leading to the two marked leaves) of arXiv:2506.19123, 'The longest increasing subsequence of Brownian separable permutons'] The following properties hold:
\begin{enumerate}
