{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:38:11.878451+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2dbe90541e343b7922a28698fced8c5690de71cdb4cb157ee3b1b5fee5a1fad7","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition eqn:AEinclusion of arXiv:2504.08935, 'Higher-Order Derivatives of First-Passage Percolation with Respect to the Environment'] For every $j\in W$, the events $E_j$, $\hat E_j$, $A_j$, and $\hat A_j$ satisfy 
