{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:01:39.510829+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2de611942b27c3a87affafa80b02c69664588e8fbce6fc03875f98b6af1ff149","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:calcul var cond of arXiv:2607.23381, '\textbf{Non-Gaussianity of the Stagnation Law \\ in Particle Swarm Optimization}\\[0.35em]'] For any noise distribution with variance $\sigma_\phi^2$, the conditional variance $\text{Var}(X_{t+1} \mid X_t = x)$ is strictly quadratic in $x$:
