{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:00.613580+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2def85b401556c7da2d8c0cfab2d2fd1c415551ee728d06d348111323b5a48b7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 9 ({\cite[Lemma 2.4) of arXiv:2510.27589, 'Geodesic switches and exceptional times in dynamical Brownian last passage percolation'] {BBBK25}}]

