{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:58:09.902755+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2e039d4a3c13d64b8ef8801b86408e9f842de5010acd1392bc504373b668bcc7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm gubintegral of arXiv:2607.19037, 'Semiclassical analysis for Yang--Mills \\ random connections on compact surfaces'] Let \(Y\in \mathcal{D}^{2\alpha}_{\mathbf{W}}\) be controlled by a driving rough path \(\mathbf{W}\in \mathcal{C}^\alpha\). Define
