{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:28.465117+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2e042e7ab76ff3f76775418f2ab02545f33af56cf8620c180e51a69262413ad3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2606.29131, '2606.29131'] Let $\Gamma_\e^1(f,\phi)(x,y)$  be defined by \eqref{e1-6}.
