{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:13.641126+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2e06d0f7830340017893af9b86fa73390965b976e93b138ca79d22fc5b8a5069","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 24 of arXiv:2609.00690, 'Boundary behavior and optimal pointwise H\"older exponent of the total local time of $(1+\'] Assume that $0<\xi_0<1+2/\beta$ satisfies
