{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:59:24.054353+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2e1d384982f3edf55dba1138a5220b0eacb0ff87b14867e08dc701a24580e6c1","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:strong-local-minimizer of arXiv:2608.30904, 'Entire monotone solutions of the anisotropic Allen--Cahn equation in dimension 5'] A function $u\in W^{1,2}_{\mathrm{loc}}(\mathbb R^4)$ is an
