{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.727583+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2e322561abc6df8bad6c437668ea35eac8289eadebcac38a03ac440be7e673a0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma ANox of arXiv:2511.06321, 'Torus scaling limits and the plateau of the critical weakly coupled $|\varphi|^4$ model in'] Assuming (equation asmp:obsRG of the paper),
