{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:54:18.237549+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2e3e3e60b6528aeca4cce0fd841bb5aa2e7c1369a6e22a59002554cc90f4bafb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem-CM-e of arXiv:2608.29147, 'The crossing matrix and the Burau matrix of pure braids'] For the hook generator $A_{ij} \in P_m$ ($1 \leq i<j \leq m$), we have 
