{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:43:45.381336+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2e5edd17474baa5ea69d172df9918cdffa673877e3fecb422dc04bca9d1ef63c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 30 of arXiv:2609.04033, 'From configuration spaces to graph complexes via $\mathbf{FA}$-modules'] There is an isomorphism of graded $S_n$-representations $$H^\ast_c(F(S^1\vee S^1,n))\tensor_{\mathbb{Z}_2\times S_3}( Id\boxtimes V_{2,1})\cong\bigoplus_\lambda \Sigma^{|\lambda|} q_\lambda\Phi[n,\lambda^\ast]$$ where

$$
q_{\lambda} = \begin{cases}
