{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:36.093841+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2ec2cee4eb0d829d663aa49f05e6c03eaab8988eb6278b11f09ba96f5bb88131","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:main of arXiv:2609.02710, 'Asymptotic Mean Value Laplacian\\ on equiregular sub-Riemannian manifolds'] Let $(M,\mathcal D,g)$ be a smooth equiregular sub-Riemannian manifold of step
