:= \left[\frac{(2\pi)^{1-\alpha}}{c_\alpha}\right]^{1/\alpha}
= \left[\frac{(2\pi)^{1-\alpha}\,\sqrt{\pi}\,
\Gamma\!\left(\frac{\alpha}{2}+1\right)}
{\Gamma\!\left(\frac{\alpha+1}{2}\right)}\right]^{1/\alpha},
\end{equation}
consistent with the normalization of $\widetilde{M}_\alpha$ in Definition~(def:complex-SaS of the paper).","status":"unverified"}

