{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:17:42.310440+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2ee6106ebe0caeca465fd08f09c199e98ef580105ccc5bea3fdf5b018ad9e9e9","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6 (Malliavin Differentiability: verification for CIR-Hermite) of arXiv:2607.23548, '\textbf{A CIR-Type Diffusion Driven by Hermite Processes:\\ Well-Posedness, Positivity and'] Under Assumptions~\ref{ass:A1}--\ref{ass:A4}, for every
