{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:12:19.483449+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2f1e245e1bf9f726d77e53bd2564e4c9948d736d6c2826558e6e31e255e1e8ff","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 (Subsampling) of arXiv:2608.17927, 'Near-unit-root persistence of symmetric stable \\ autoregressive sequences'] Fix $m \in \NN$ and put $Y_{j} = X_{jm}$. Then
