	A_{\delta} = \{ \omega \colon \forall x \in \Omega_{\delta},\, |\omega_x| < a_{\delta} V_{\delta} \}\,, \quad \text{with} \quad a_{\delta} := (\hat{\beta}_{\delta})^{4/(\gamma-1)} \,.
