{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:20:55.583525+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2f3a84eeb63ed11e44d3c3bebc58491480e17a8d2f0dfcfa559eaa4516d5b766","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:L0-bounds of arXiv:2411.07680, 'Energy solutions of singular SPDEs on Hilbert spaces with applications to domains with bou'] The operator $\mathcal L_0$ satisfies the following upper and lower bounds on cylinder functions:
