  \item $h \in \operatorname{Ran}(\gamma_t)$ a.s., $\mathbb{E}[\norm{\gamma_t^{\dagger}h}_H^q] < \infty$, and $\sup_n \mathbb{E}[\norm{(\gamma_t^{(n)})^{\dagger}h}_H^q] < \infty$, for the same $q > 2$.
