{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:26:52.661377+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2fd8c17537e847a359a15005b3b0ee53a97a44074a35c1d539c25f226649595c","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 7 (positive-type coordinate and threshold graph) of arXiv:2609.03736, '2609.03736'] Choose a unitary $\mathsf G$-module $V$ with a unit
