{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:59:53.388874+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2fda24a467c3dfcbb5e92ca44b385996affc1c9ed15729af3284f2ca1dc4900d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:Afbound of arXiv:2608.29657, 'Hypocoercivity of Tempered Bouncy Particle Samplers for Heavy-Tailed Targets'] Let~(ass:wpi of the paper), (ass:sigmabounds of the paper),~(ass:curvature of the paper) hold.
