{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:52.204246+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_2ffa08e34a3f15d3d4cfcaae50a1a9094be06cda0682577f1d2c7213e93c3753","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2512.08745, 'Variance strikes back: sub-game--perfect Nash equilibria in time‑inconsistent $N$‑player g'] There are constants---defined explicitly in the proof---such that for $\P\text{\rm--a.e.} \; \omega\in\Omega$
