{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:53:54.821523+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_300422b1a346b4c12cf50116e0e387c089a6482a929c697cbff8c7d51caaa8bf","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 5 (Laws at ascension) of arXiv:2607.16833, 'Dynamical Equations for Poisson Galton--Watson Trees and Component Densities of Sparse Inh'] For $\lambda\geq1$,
