{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:52.417673+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_30294ae3da81585c8407fc0c731fa88a6f7f7664dd26c703001ed2145708cedc","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 107 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] Suppose that $B_2 \leq {A}_1\leq {B}_1 \leq {A}_2$ and consider the measure \eqref{zwdiscretemd} on the state space \eqref{eq_ZW_model_state_space} with weight
