{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:38:37.405740+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3048c89f4b81a271bb699752110260846af9e37feadac89eedf84738bd552e90","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 3 (\cite{Li}) of arXiv:2605.15781, 'Mean-Field Backward Stochastic Differential Equations with Nonlinear Resistance and Double'] Suppose that $(l^i,r^i)$ satisfy Assumption $\ref{asslr}$, $i=1,2$.
