{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.302708+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_30652486a6d9c609d81b363bea88e9b3624b5456d8382881834e4a1b3b43b2b1","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 4 (\(p\)-adic log-fractional stable motion) of arXiv:2606.24056, 'Decorated stable $p$-adic self-similar processes with stationary increments'] Let \(0<\alpha\le2\), and let \(M_\alpha\) be a real symmetric \(S\alpha S\)
