{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:55.644566+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_307e79ce86839db71a5f77947868ba672534a5d9f501544935a7059f0d0e856a","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 21 (Ollivier curvature) of arXiv:2605.24445, 'Matrix concentration inequalities for time-inhomogeneous Markov chains'] \label[definition]{def:curvature}
