{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:38.638676+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3084ed23b93798e51bbb90ed79528910df87b53718806e13250164256c0a509c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 10 of arXiv:2506.17979, '\large\bf A remark on subharmonicity for symmetric Dirichlet forms'] Let ${\sf d}$ be a distance function consistent with the given topology on 
