{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:55:56.997147+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_309d679a3bc8466d083e88b7dfd6930e84d3a911942f6704fdc732ccb4becbc5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2609.02785, 'Characterization of Stanley-Reisner varieties by their automorphism group'] For $i\in[n]$ the following are equivalent:
