{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:37:51.456211+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_30db140979ab1ab816c2c3ef7bad097f70148f2ded07bbc1b33fd7dff6fd8b44","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 14 of arXiv:2604.03777, 'Equilibrium fluctuations for a multi-species particle system with long jumps'] Let $H \in \mathcal{S}(\mathbb{R})$, $s \in [0,T]$ and $n \in \mathbb{N}_+$. Then
