{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.597055+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_30f5021f7170a6170ccb13587860dc1ddc6c742451de1cd7c418c00beb090534","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 10 of arXiv:2607.07283, 'Multi-time Markov renewal chains and stratified renewal theorems'] For non-negative kernel sequences $A$ and $B$,

