{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:35:19.868320+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_30fa90a23b408859bda2cb0d37ec8830e6f76387379464552872b0ea9bdd4c13","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop symmetric-tree-geometry of arXiv:2609.03856, 'Consensus time for asynchronous $\ell^p$ relaxation: graph dependence'] Assume $d_0\ge2$.  Then $o$ minimizes $T_G(r)$.  If
