where $\xi_x$, $x\in\mu$, are independent and $\BP(\xi_x\in\cdot)=\BP(\xi^x\in\cdot)$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:28:53.687536+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3117e7528c4c2d883d7c706dd029b41ac69cdea651e7e3cbc16bdb7bb771dbd6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 25 (minorisation on interior) of arXiv:2605.13648, 'Sticky CIR process with potential: invariant measure and exact sampling'] \label[lemma]{lem:scheme-density}
  Let $I,[a,b]\subset(0,\infty)$ be compact and let $T_\star>0$; assume \eqref{eq:nonconvex-hyp}. There
