{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:21:06.884519+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_311a47d57fb809dbf320da54af77f5c9ea934c15f1c732d2e489ad254f5545a8","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 9 (Algorithmic guarantee for the mixture objective) of arXiv:2608.21466, 'Spectral partitioning for $k$-block averaging kernels of finite Markov chains'] Let $k\in\llbracket 2,n-1\rrbracket$.
