{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.359259+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_312c873421fe73774ee351c60c392d3c57fae59466e1c9ee03dd60109cc480d0","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 of arXiv:2511.09517, 'From Cannings model to Brownian motion conditioned on local time profile'] For any $n\ge 1$ and $1 \le s < h(q_n)$,
