{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:15:15.554559+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3134d40e0bbf64355bebfdfe19fd6e640adb086a7816c49a2ea6de2fe5d65ce8","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary Zm-singlecross of arXiv:2507.01406, '{\Large On Iterated Lorenz Curves with Applications: The Multivariate Case }'] The map $Z_{m}^{i}:[0,1]\rightarrow \lbrack 0,1]$ is
