{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:00:22.774109+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_31511473a35a3aca24d5f60079d7343cf565ddd942abe05ab95b9c3172f1da66","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:order-bounded-equivalent of arXiv:2411.01364, 'Global Dynamics of Granular Media Equations via Stochastic Order'] Let $M$ be a subset of $\mathcal P_2(\mathbb R)$.
