{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:05:57.797059+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_315403dba5d61905637fd66bc9169a5344f6e737c7e83974ec7f774407c3705b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 68 of arXiv:2608.30549, '\vspace{-1cm}Maximally Spread Out Measures and Implications\\{} for Phase Transitions in A'] Let $\emptyset \ne \Omega \subset \RR^d$ be an arbitrary bounded domain.
