{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.561617+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3182ec3061b89a4e71bd6c361294fa26a1e626ec808346cb3d1fd6c012dac781","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma L:error:bd of arXiv:2604.08129, 'Polarity of points for Gaussian random fields in critical dimension'] [X96]
