{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:15:15.496762+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_31ce0e92ac82cd0c6952ca4c0098664f03ada6289201f7d48fb05d4481da2060","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary subseq-c of arXiv:2507.01406, '{\Large On Iterated Lorenz Curves with Applications: The Multivariate Case }'] Let $\{n_{k}\}_{k=0}^{\infty }$ be a strictly increasing
