is a pre-Dirichlet form in $L^2(\scr P_2,G\circ\Psi_\lam^{-1})$, i.e.~it has the Markov property and is closable.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:58:40.871776+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_31d24b7c728df08feab372e8a6bd193465a379de8955ebf90e60b44103964a86","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:smallset of arXiv:2605.10491, 'Zero-couplings of infinite measures with cyclically monotone support and multivariate regu'] Let $\psi$ and $\phi$ be convex functions on $\mathbb{R}^d$. For every $t \in \mathbb{R}$, the set
