{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:09:23.971095+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_31d29d76804cb4967dce8173d88e96ae6051e85a748295daa6e1bf13775c1005","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2607.22438, 'A deterministic scalar reduction for the phase transition in two interacting urns'] The zeros of \(\Phi_p\) in \((1/2,3/4)\) are in one-to-one correspondence with the equilibria in \(\Omega_+\). The correspondence is
