{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.272442+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_31f22e5bcab5c63c37a1f24a9f8cc8de164b6e4245a781ba9654d425a1694af5","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn StochasticZeta of arXiv:2602.08739, '\large \bf MOMENTS OF C$\beta$E FIELD PARTITION FUNCTION, $\mathsf{Sine}_{\beta}$ CORRELAT'] Let $\beta>0, \delta>0$. Define the following random entire function
