{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:56:36.582057+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_32087b040636faba1c7d99127a538f4c56440f6ed03e02752f509ad5e745bbf7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: Slopes at P_3 of arXiv:2608.30443, 'On smooth holosphere solutions to compressible Euler equation'] Let $$\ell<d, \ \ r=r_+(d,\ell)=1+\frac{d-1}{(1+\sqrt{\ell})^2},$$ then at $P_3$:
