{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:34.001945+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_320a16862a5de311e92bca6eff98f28c28e79ab916e4a83defbbfc5d50558193","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Problem 57 of arXiv:2609.03403, 'Hyperpositive functions, sector bounded functions and a trace formula'] In the notation of Problem \ref{CF1>0}, find all $\mathbb C^{m\times m}$-valued functions $S$ analytic and strictly contractive in $\mathbb C_r$ and such that
