{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:53:30.574584+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_32754aba582b9660ede0a7e609d37d8df2839b9e20ac0e1c35bb441624e5c2cd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem-Step 3 of arXiv:2505.24043, 'Weak solutions of Navier-Stokes Equation with purely discontinuous L\'evy Noise'] Let $C$ be the set defined in  (equation eqn-C_set of the paper). Let  $\overline{N}_{a_k}=\left( \overline{N}_{a_k}(t): t\geq 0\right)$ be the $\mathbb{R}$-valued process defined by
