{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:44:27.969436+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3286fd81837ed08f7de2caadc7e7dc7d75d3569d859fb58f85d155c7642c62da","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 of arXiv:2607.13273, 'Asymptotics of transition densities for L\'evy processes with stochastic resetting'] Let $\alpha\in (0,2)$ and $Y_t$ be an isotropic $\alpha$--stable process in $\Rd$, i.e., 
