{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:21:10.899541+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_32a7d6d548ff758e1a48140fb3c20499567cf1b6ba6527c2e3a5624c1162d2fd","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 25 of arXiv:2601.16377, '2601.16377'] We introduce a further decomposition of holomorphic functions in $\amsmathbb{M}_h$
