{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:28:04.853938+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_32d5f792e633b4b9492f5644c0e598e5771064473ae03e98104ff3c130d3583f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 70 of arXiv:2511.20322, 'Dissertation'] Let $J\in \bar \N$. Suppose we are given a sequence of $J$-permutons $(\nu_n)_{n\in \N}$ and a $J$-permuton $\nu$. Then $\nu_n \to \nu$ weakly if and only if
