{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:43:19.119447+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_32d7fccf75bbd5a9f2481f19654ce7758da49132d2270af57c448be2cfedf85d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma2.8 of arXiv:2609.02607, 'Spatial inhomogeneity for a three-dimensional doubly degenerate nutrient system with indir'] For all $p\geq2$ and each $T>0$, there exists $C(p,T)>0$ such that
