{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:38:36.893855+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_32e2e12f31f285b3176809e5e965bab189eaebbdb98291936be08dcc688d1750","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma notDn of arXiv:2606.30475, 'Ancestries in random $d$-DAGs'] As $n\to\infty$, we have for $M>0$ fixed
