{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:52:05.646072+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_32eaa59a58e3cf30edf4c28e6f6acfd1c8670fa69694451a9974a903f20a0699","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop TVS-unique of arXiv:2602.06011, 'Excursion decomposition of the XOR-Ising model'] Let $(\phi,A)$ be a local set such that almost surely
