{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:32:28.956219+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_32f787d8c6c40672295038893b3d5e15c957ef9cbd1088e83d7df0ab7f689bed","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:W-one-point of arXiv:2608.23135, 'Graph distance and effective resistance of the random walk trace in four and five dimensio'] There exists $C<\infty$ such that for every $1\le i\le N_\varepsilon-1$,
