{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:29:27.958293+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_33024c3d495e70edafa7b0874e09500b2d86c6d6d16baa75bed8e44d2b78a800","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 9 of arXiv:2608.24675, 'Towards Liouville Quantum Gravity on fractals'] For any $i=1,2,3$ it holds that
