{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:23:05.304883+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3303adb5fbe30fa983fc51d93706669cdd79e13e96a93fe5788c4930ae3deccc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2608.21905, '\bf Ruin theory incorporating MIPP-type jumps'] For each fixed $n\geq 2$, assume the net profit condition $c>\lambda^nm$ holds in our model (\ref{one1}). Also assume $\mathcal{L}_{\xi}(\theta)$ is finite. Then the following equation 
