{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:09:15.293453+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_332c04a8950f78afd409d7e75b92041b182b0e421d0c9763f2dea30d1340d2ea","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition fractional_type of arXiv:2411.05235, 'A comparative study of three mathematical approaches applied to the reversal of AMR'] \textbf{Equilibrium Point of a Fractional Differential Equation.}\\
   Consider the fractional differential equation:
