Then $\supp\mu_n\to\supp\mu$ in the Hausdorff metric on the space
$\mathcal K(\R^d)$ of nonempty compact subsets of $\R^d$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:10:08.779312+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_33991141044a554013a2704ed4f27562e347e85158e4cabf0103fbd4f85bc088","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma propminbd of arXiv:2411.18359, 'Large systems of symmetrized trapped Brownian Bridges and Schr\"odinger processes'] The unique minimizer of (equation minIq of the paper) is given by 
