{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:58:40.874148+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_33b6e9bf921c49063ef302433221ae209850749c242edcfab20e9dc5cebdc512","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition defzeta of arXiv:2605.10617, 'Logarithmic scaling of selective sweep curves:\\ from tents to houses'] We put 
