{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:40.352973+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_33b9d7e5b230a7add5863d35ff46f8c2d17e16892aa3e659df9158aeb7c8086c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 28 (Theorem 3.1 of \cite{ks}, with $k=1$) of arXiv:2511.07350, 'Decoupling of clusters in independent sets in a percolated hypercube'] For $p \in (0,1)$, 
