{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:00:15.219434+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_340e65302966b069e3ed5355ce9de9f83fb7d785639a3313298839b25267eae5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 (Conditionally independent subtrees) of arXiv:2607.18201, 'Finding Adam in noisy trees'] Conditionally on the event \begin{align*}
