{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:32:34.769158+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_347d93b74bd9aa0dfaf66ca782d0eeca87d5d12897edd65f5bd5139723d9990c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem_oszac_calka_z_p^D_po_D of arXiv:2411.08220, 'Nonlocal operators with Neumann conditions'] For $\alpha\in (0,2)$, $t>0$, $x>0$, and $y<0$, 
