    \end{enumerate}
    In particular, part (equation it:deg2-subgaussianity-mmt of the paper) implies $\|\la \sigma \sigma^\top \ra_2\|_{\op} \le C$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

