{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:23:25.629971+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_34a829a52568934780d24589b8dc19da282103225de4c3f68f9d7396e1430d68","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:shift of arXiv:2609.01311, 'One-Layer Transformer Provably Learns Multiclass\\ One-Nearest Neighbor in Context'] Let \(P^{\mathrm{test}}\) be any distribution over instances
