{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:45:17.706782+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_34f1b939234254af56ba8f760893ec396c78f7534dcbd2469c501294864b4434","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:CFRRZ of arXiv:2604.10214, 'Large deviations for maximum local time of simple random walk in dimensions \texorpdfstrin'] Let
\(
