{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:32:18.841713+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_351270934fe7b6bf644d3d1755872211d46e9903dbcbdd4a9c40924854a8cfdb","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 19 of arXiv:2609.03831, 'On flows generated by square-integrable vector fields'] Let $\v\in\boldsymbol{L}^2_{loc}(\R^d)$ be a divergence-free vector field
