{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:41:28.184301+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_35279aaa82b2402743d737a4e477c939dafd294427691c7f05f598c62b960c4b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:CompareMeanFieldToRestricted of arXiv:2511.10630, 'Cutoff for generalised Bernoulli--Laplace urn models'] For all functions $f \colon \mathrm{Centre}(C) \to \mathbb{R}$ and $n \geqslant n_0(C, d, m)$, we have
