{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:51:30.070666+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_359ae0dad91244e75a301b7263d619b8f28e8d29e5f8b8d6a5d707e1fe850938","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 of arXiv:2606.01832, 'MA(1) processes with uniform innovations conditioned to stay positive in the non-expanding'] Assume that
  $$p_n^{a,x}(\theta)\sim c(\theta,a)h(x)\lambda^{n+1}$$
