{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:51:52.054303+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_35a5adff46262690f0400b7b8ecb26234c2c9ab49fd7c504fe93ccc12d991278","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lema_q of arXiv:2607.13302, 'Extending an Order-Statistic Characterization of the Exponential Distribution'] Let $F$ be a distribution function that belongs to $ \mathcal{F}$. If for all natural $q$ holds
