{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.789889+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_35e6454a4319cdb878fa56ac11806d380d83a0964ff201c15d08e2c5de06efe5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2609.03061, '2609.03061'] Let $R,S : [a,b] \rightarrow Sp(2n,\mathbb{R})$ be smooth mappings,
then
$$ \begin{array}{l}
Trace( J \ (R(t)\cdot  S(t))' \cdot (R(t) \cdot S(t))^{-1})\\
