{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:59:58.439753+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_360c0b751051f7f03a3e8bc25f0fa1c0d602083a61d8230081619eb114b0c57d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem theoremGinibreineq of arXiv:2604.24743, 'The impact of disorder and non-convex interactions on delocalisation of height functions'] One has the following inequalities:
