 \left\|\sum_{\nu}h_{\nu}A_{\nu}\right\|_{L^r(\Omega;\Sch_r)}
 \lesssim\sqrt r\left[
 \left\|\left(\sum_{\nu}A_{\nu}A_{\nu}^*\right)^{1/2}\right\|_{\Sch_r}
