{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.728490+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_363eb84e39ba11c58c9c380d0c2c10cc254d5d605ea22c10a86b647b8a84ed07","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma malakas of arXiv:2412.09290, 'Asymptotics of Harish-Chandra transform and infinitesimal freeness'] Let $n \geq 2$ and a function $f$ smooth in a neighborhood of $0$. Then
