{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:25:40.277069+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_36413ade42455198a83a889c3341f0276abce2bd31bce23a96c055c0c9494300","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:master-generating of arXiv:2609.02544, 'A finiteness theorem for geodesic Leech wheels'] A geodesic Leech labeling satisfies the following identity.
