{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:11:44.404980+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_366f66b04fbabcafff64ae60e5f066b1f8ad602309e4432bfc5141905d30f82e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 3 of arXiv:2609.03187, 'Duality for a Martingale Transport Problem with Moment Constraints'] For every $\lambda\in\mathbb R^N$, the function $H_\lambda(u)$ has the following properties:
