{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:33:17.722971+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_369e3e33f0b61c5ee193bea2aab9815bea3203c06d86fa6d43f6a3c92df99f2c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 67 (Simultaneous dyadic realization and full cutoff convergence) of arXiv:2607.10813, '2607.10813'] Fix the physical localizers and the four index triples
