	\]","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:58:38.148641+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_36acaeb2651980e5b59b27d7ba6762b3af677f0141021f2a70f857875867490b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:JordanLowerBound of arXiv:2606.24465, 'History estimation in random recursive trees:\\Pointwise approach via iterated Jordan cent'] Consider the Jordan ordering $\widehat{\sigma}_J$. 
