{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:25:55.317022+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_36cb70a001ead85044ded9a0bdad56e37739e193e9232025b0826daf7d08ec13","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2607.27786, 'Gaussian free field in annulus: \\BPZ equations and crossing probabilities for level lines'] We have the asymptotic as $z\to 0$: 
