{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:15:34.385210+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_36fb365674da954a40111c56b15ba32fc7a83531383344845f028cde7a013771","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 21 of arXiv:2609.03248, 'Connections between colored restricted $b$-ary and ordinary partitions'] Let $b\geq 2$ be an integer. Then the sequence 
