{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:46.767408+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3713ac1d73fd93547cf06d82805c90edfba9ecb4fdd11336b757761a4a0473ca","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2603.24616, 'Pinning in non-critical half-space geometric last passage percolation'] Fix $k \in \mathbb{N}$, $\vec{x}, \vec{y} \in \weylc_k$, and $a,b \in \mathbb{R}$ with $a < b$. 
