{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T23:07:56.654051+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3718260a9a8d7d94cfb26bd8492f4b91406a35e5d8d0a1c64d0985665bc8955b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Reversedmartingaledifferences of arXiv:2411.04603, 'The nonexplosive solution of explosive autoregressions'] Let $\left(X_k\right)_{k\geq1}$ be a square-inte\-grable ${\mathbb R}^d$-valued reverse martingale difference sequence w.r.t. 
