{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:48:43.519636+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3736f39dd99ce34ca94480e334a2f793733bd8edefa5cd10f74dc62b4b03dd88","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 (Local maximum at equal
radii) of arXiv:2608.06591, 'Random Triangles on Concentric Circles'] \protect\hypertarget{prp-local}{}

