{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:09:23.971558+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_37e0353a658df54dc808c8009bcd39634bbc61d415bcaf26d07f9d790cd8da30","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 of arXiv:2607.22438, 'A deterministic scalar reduction for the phase transition in two interacting urns'] Let \(z_0\in(1/2,3/4)\) be a zero of \(\Phi_p\), and set
