{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:37:25.951336+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_37ee5ee37fd687f3f0e9130e9ef9e80ee9502d9ca51ec09862863813a0135b20","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 65 (Sharp denominator growth) of arXiv:2608.29585, '2608.29585'] For every $d\ge0$, the polynomials
