If $\ttb \ino (1, \infty)$ is such that $\sum_{k\in \bbN} k^{\ttb} \nu (k) \leko \infty$ and if $\bT$ is an invariant GW($\nu$)-tree, then $\bE[\Phi_\ttb (\overline{X}_n) ]\eqo \bE [ \Phi_\ttb (\overline{X}_0) ] \leko \infty$.  
In the specific case where $\ttb\eqo 2$, then
