{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:31:57.825967+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3875dd5a36d578125df9b4a80a9c9b5358da153de29225a32467f1dd4a44ec06","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm main result of arXiv:2509.19809, 'Exact Limsup Growth of Rarely Visited Sites for One-Dimensional Simple Random Walk'] With probability $1$,
