    \end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.588386+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_387a33288a42a323cad93bf6a20f868f5ded3f508eb38b6cc6e4b72994fde246","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eqn.9001 of arXiv:2411.15485, '\bf\Large Stochastic Volterra Equations for Local Times of Spectrally Positive L\'evy Proc'] The $(\mathscr{F}_t)$-continuous semimartingale $Z_x$ admits the following decomposition
