\end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:13:31.950638+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_38955e45246336da298dccda92a98cfde0b502d05170d3232fdb0d3c52eec87f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop expanding_critical_equations of arXiv:2506.12171, 'The multinomial dimer model'] Suppose $q$ is a $C^2$ function on $R$. For $u\in B\cap R_n$, we have the expansion
