{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:27:14.807098+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_38bb1ec97402a90f339f87a2b06b5df26a0fc2a014577a73be3be1268539946b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 10 of arXiv:2608.23301, 'On a Telegraph Process with Generalized Mittag-Leffler Waiting times and Velocity Driven b'] Conditional on the initial velocity $v_1$, the expected velocity associated with $\{\mathbb{X}_{\alpha}(t)\}_{t\geq0}$  is
