\item[(2)] An increasing sequence of closed subsets $\{F_n:n\geq 1\}$ of $E$ is an ${\mathscr E}$-nest if and only if 
\begin{equation}
		\mathbb{P}_x\left(\lim_{n\rightarrow \infty}T_{E\setminus F_n}<\zeta\right)=0
