{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:27:36.718446+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_38c9814a720c51cad36286577843d92d1c76eb8caed599b8e44712072733db73","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 8 of arXiv:2511.13404, 'Asymptotic stability and mean ergodicity of Feller processes on Polish spaces'] Let $\mathcal{L}$ be the generator of Feller process $\Phi$. If there exists a function $V:\X\to\R_+$ with  $\lim\limits_{\rho(x,x_0)\to\infty}V(x)=\infty$ for some $x_0\in\X$ and
