{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:25:39.083461+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_38f29101075c4be6b28205ad180a93c4bd0e4189f2b2fed781f30834176c8c55","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:Tlowerbdd of arXiv:2606.11677, 'Feynman--Kac formula for the heat equation with a one-center point interaction in $d=3$.'] For any $x\in {\mathbb{R}}^3$ and $t\geq 0$, we have \begin{align*}
