{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:45:17.650625+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_390dfb55a70663e4b1f96df353ff23a179807d42de5ea2880e16288a13ed6fe5","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition eqn: XiDdef of arXiv:2604.08462, 'Convergence of $k$-point functions in\\ high dimensional percolation'] For an arbitrary deterministic set $\mathcal{D} \subseteq \mathbb{Z}^d$, we define
