{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:43:43.412678+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3944060f977216e7e0e6d73a0ecc35c592f927bb766885b7c869131f31496beb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop p.hilsp of arXiv:2507.16056, 'Conditional GMC within the stochastic heat flow'] Conditioned on a realization of the $O_{I_1\ldots I_k}$s (or on $\mathscr{F}$), there exists a separable Hilbert space $\mathcal{H}$ equipped with isometric embeddings 
