{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:28:49.117020+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3962d061e4c73628a0f371b17ac357ed1ea7c5990126b192e331fa9923d2defe","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem FPE of arXiv:2608.16946, 'A diffusion model for time-dependent compositional data'] Assume the coefficients $\mu$ and $\sigma$ are independent of time $t$, smooth enough to make desired
