{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:25:06.145536+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_398079aed58f84cbecaf747e4735ec5b48875d768c371c002e0201c1cdbf28ab","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 5 of arXiv:2608.22534, 'Entropy power inequalities in compact groups'] For a locally compact group $G$ the following are equivalent: 
