{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:15.345820+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_398814e25fca7bd2c44cb6abd7c4b6f330e41cda7ea2132667d8c477f0cf27eb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 40 of arXiv:2506.15044, '2506.15044'] Let $X,\; Y\in \mathcal{S}^\mathbb{B}$.
