{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:43:18.738700+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_398d98417ff16c80c28a9fe908b10b078225fc023cd532473786eadcb519adf3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor products of arXiv:2609.02346, 'Regularised double shuffle relations for planar \AZVs{}'] With notations of theorem~(thm:comb of the paper), dendriform products of definition~(defi:shuffle_trees of the paper) are:
