where $C$ is a universal constant and $\gamma = \sum_{q=1}^{N}{\mathbf E}\left[\abs{\Sigma^{-1/2}Y_q}_2^3\right]$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

