{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:58:38.147025+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_39eb688987846dba3567200cbd08960114746c3e6eddd7d291aa4e3ed32e6ca5","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:new method of arXiv:2606.24465, 'History estimation in random recursive trees:\\Pointwise approach via iterated Jordan cent'] For each $\alpha>0$, 
