{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:38.641005+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3a18cfb9ce1b518357f12411e4384e4fac7b1143efdba3852ad269411120bfdd","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 37 of arXiv:2506.17979, '\large\bf A remark on subharmonicity for symmetric Dirichlet forms'] RelativisticStable} 
Let $u$ be a Borel function satisfying $\Psi(m^{\frac{1}{\alpha}}|\cdot|)\left(1\land \frac{1}{|\,\cdot\,|^{d+\alpha}} \right)|u|^q\in L^1(\R^d)$ with $q\in]0,+\infty[$. 
