{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:37:51.456908+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3a268b5672f37c13b8e62f3e99986de6c47c77ef463a124bae801f1b08a76ead","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 22 of arXiv:2604.03777, 'Equilibrium fluctuations for a multi-species particle system with long jumps'] Let $\gamma >0$, $0 \leq s \leq t \leq T$ and $n \in \mathbb{N}_+$. Then
