{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:10:08.747549+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3a414efee7aeb72dc8ce7664ac564f132aaac9a08a5552f1e93dbb76de614562","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def_weak_sol_eq_linear_prob of arXiv:2411.17653, 'Exclusion processes with non-reversible boundary: hydrodynamics and large deviations'] We say that $v$ is a weak solution of (equation PDE_problem_linear of the paper) if the following two conditions are satisfied:
