{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:33:06.555187+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3a41a84da678de6b216724b4e373217e14038e686aa3d0bc8c725d889c722d6a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2608.26038, 'Rotated semicircle laws for permanental roots of Gaussian random matrices'] For \(\alpha>-1\) and \(|t|<1/2\),
