{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:43:43.191099+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3a8222c4e638344e8433f7d48f20ae67e73ff8b86be45d4972cd74d66feadf4b","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition eqdef: limiting ren var prob of arXiv:2506.21466, 'The Markov property for $\varphi^4_3$ on the cylinder'] For every $f \in C^\infty(\mathbb T^2)$, define $\mathcal Z^0_\infty(f)$ by the variational formula 
