{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:53.157057+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3ad1b5ad74976931be0016b84b5a2d6ae50545284cbcbdfe19c471fd94870d04","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 11 (Cumulants) of arXiv:2607.02108, 'A Two-Color Lift of the Shifted \texorpdfstring{$t$}{t}-Schur Measure'] The $m$th cumulants of $B$ and $R$ are
