{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:52:23.571452+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3b1af3db17f05c0aadb16d6ce9fe6455663ebfe74b4ca0e5ef8bac0fb00a71dd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:B of arXiv:2602.05317, 'Strong local nondeterminism for stochastic time-fractional\\ slow and fast diffusion equat'] Let
