{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:30:36.801856+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3b33b544a163b7acd4392c76177b63b855743db112b8c62e2df182e10a4a7a42","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 58 of arXiv:2607.10486, 'Weak martingale solutions to stochastic Navier-Stokes-Cahn-Hilliard system with transport '] Let us consider, for $R>0$, a function $\widetilde{\tau}_R$ defined by 
