{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:49:06.321562+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3b4519b8be89f3dec4fe8fd3ba2e0a73a07c2ec7bf5c0a82d2601eab32457c4c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:infinite of arXiv:2601.10624, 'Source localisation in simple random walks'] Let $d \geqslant 5$. Then there is an estimator $\Gamma$ such that
