{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:33:17.751434+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3b882956e34a0b1b505a74120957a9d017a5537268fcf53fb6bb4fdf01f060ac","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 127 (Two-sided time increments of the integrated kernel) of arXiv:2607.10813, '2607.10813'] Let $0\le t<t'\le T$, put $h=t'-t$, and let
