{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:48:49.897427+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3b8a3f5c8630f767fb28531b372ef3f851c75c46308c74bc3fbd0194637f44b0","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop uniconv of arXiv:2510.23430, 'On the Martin boundary for discrete TASEP'] Let $n\geq 0$, $r\in (0,1)$. Then the series
