{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:52:17.589164+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3b9dca2fab9b629aa9802c12e1bc60787ce4f1e8b0fb420ec112ad778eac8b58","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition BDG of arXiv:2411.15485, '\bf\Large Stochastic Volterra Equations for Local Times of Spectrally Positive L\'evy Proc'] For two constants $p\geq 1$ and $T>0$, assume that
