{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:33:23.332892+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3ba264a5b9873325d7b7d044dce5c2342f49735c0d2d993c9f786308b4feb896","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 7 of arXiv:2506.22085, '2506.22085'] Fix $T>0$ and a divergence free vector field $\bar J \in L^2(\bb
  T^d;\bb R^d)$
  \begin{itemize}
  \item[(HSPC)]The \emph{hydrodynamic Schr\"odinger problem with
