{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:57:28.220502+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3ba8f3e5d411e8018a2547e9d577de863115d481a397e39b51c47936b898c00f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 7 (Scaling and the gamma limit) of arXiv:2607.17630, 'Higher-Order Hankel Obstructions to Free Infinite Divisibility\ for Beta Distributions'] Let $c\mu$ denote the pushforward of $\mu$ under $x\mapsto cx$.  Then
