{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.256970+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3baae16ba3995ae44e6f99d2415edec7fc05261c9611708f84b9e77d2c730e2a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 57 of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] For any bounded measurable function $f:M\to\R,\;t>0$ and $x\in F_n$, define $\varphi:[0,t]\to\R$ by setting
