\end{equation}
The adapted $2$-Wasserstein distance between laws $\mu, \nu\in \cP_2(\bR^{Nd})$ is defined by
\begin{equation} 
\AW_2(\mu, \nu) := \AW_2(\bX^{\mu}, \bX^{\nu}),
\end{equation}
