{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:43:16.151191+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3bcaf478f8d4dbea0993db2d734a3f31e541799d89187638e765ad9d48e1970f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2604.13454, 'Invariant and periodic measures in classical spin systems on infinite lattices with highly'] Let $P$ and $Q$ be two probability measures on $\Omega_{Spin}$ and let $\mathcal{C}$ be the class of the finite-dimensional closed sets, that is to say, the sets of the form
