{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:13:18.513955+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3bd5e807a34b6de6239b2438a30a737f3a0f85a4682e81466e7af385417a4f35","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 of arXiv:2608.30602, '2608.30602'] Let $\lambda_0>0$ and $b\in \R$ be fixed, and assume that 
