{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:31.002894+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3bde9efdb1f6dbdd33b3139cee870112a8e719d74d31ddffc283d79c57c60077","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 64 (All-degree feedback at fixed input weight) of arXiv:2608.12492, 'Weak Limits of Wiener Chaos: Primitive--Fock Classification and Hilbert--Stein Extraction'] Assume that the split is grade-wise orthogonal,
\begin{equation}
 A_{a,p}=P_{M_p}x_{a,p},
