{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.285736+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3be55ff67f3929bc8aa8813f57d7a2221c954e5342be83fd1185e32cd6d5ea0a","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn CJbetaEdef of arXiv:2602.08739, '\large \bf MOMENTS OF C$\beta$E FIELD PARTITION FUNCTION, $\mathsf{Sine}_{\beta}$ CORRELAT'] Define, for $\beta,\delta>0$, the circular Jacobi beta ensemble $\mathcal{CJ}_{N,\beta,\delta}$ to be the probability measure on $\mathbb{T}^N$ given by
