{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:56:00.633379+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3be7cf3d4d67712ff317869f8b8add3eba67069691cece52ea96708c609e0db6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem t3.8 of arXiv:2603.14447, '\Large \bf Backward doubly stochastic differential equations with and without reflection u'] \sl
