{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:27:11.263872+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3c413bf3fe4f6f7072f36687b10aaa0dfefd6ba147d74680d23715bb8a2201e8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma strict-hessian-interior of arXiv:2605.19894, 'Sharp Spectral Thresholds for Multi-View Spiked Wigner Models'] Let $\sigma\ge1$ and let $\chi_\ast\in(-1,0)^L$ be a local minimizer of $\cR(\cdot,\sigma)$. If
