{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:23:25.622592+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3c89ee9e48d49a119a7a3eb515d997ce246510754472dc3b970bf91890354411","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem.DiskAnnulus of arXiv:2609.01189, 'The lower mean curvature bound in Gromov's mean-of-the-mean-curvature conjecture'] For the metric $h$ with constant curvature $K_h\equiv-c^2$, we have
