{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:04:39.207274+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3caf6fbbe527ea41c0fefee64eaf63a8363d50361438f7be1875a47d82c11d0d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 3 (Coarse MLSI at all positive temperatures) of arXiv:2608.13677, 'Asymptotically complete free-energy dissipation: \\ a coarse MLSI holds at any positive te'] \label[theorem]{theorem:coarse_MLSI}
