{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:03:35.850899+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3cb003f000d00d64ba273c33ffca7ccec3144fa6b36dffbafdcdb6a80f3861b3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:continuous-corrected-potential of arXiv:2608.25182, 'Minimax Alternating Regret \\for the Experts Problem and Online Convex Optimization'] Define $h_t\triangleq f_{t-1}+f_t$ for $t\in[T+1]$. Then, for every $t\in[T+1]$,
