{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:57:28.733979+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3cb273cedc546991fdb34e819420b1c5ada0b8c5aafb3f1f1559ad1d82b017bd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 6 of arXiv:2609.01237, ''] The energy functional $\cE_\alpha$ has a unique minimizer $u_\alpha \in H^1(\Omega)$ and it satisfies Problem~\eqref{eqn:alpha-prob}. Moreover, $u_\alpha \in \cH$ and  
