{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:59:58.432123+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3ce2cd0549d81c274474badf0c98df3a57a1509d64ffa3ee8b2dcc2c0a90e25a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem proofKTsitegeneral of arXiv:2604.24743, 'The impact of disorder and non-convex interactions on delocalisation of height functions'] For the Villain model in a random environment given by a Bernoulli edge percolation of parameter $p$, the following hold:
