{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.596063+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3cee3bbd27084f3f9dc6e2ea8d0bb01ced2605184d1f6ac6d1ac1c4e3f33c6c5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2607.07022, 'Coordinate-wise Elephant Random Walk'] For every $T>0,$ the jump size $\Delta \calM^{(f,n)} (t)$ of the c\`adl\`ag martingale satisfies  
