{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:13.267468+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3cffa2d205bcc93e5253a91db04a6ce39e8f2abe094297349c7326dee44afead","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma qstabilitywedge of arXiv:2507.10545, 'KPZ equation from a class of nonlinear SPDEs in infinite volume'] \fsp Suppose {\small$\wt{\mathbf{Q}}^{N}:[0,\infty)\times\Z\to\R$} satisfies the following \abbr{SDE}, where {\small$\mathscr{T}_{N}$} is from Proposition (prop:s-sde of the paper):

\begin{align}
