{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.494681+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3d5611221e3d465d624d259d68eac868f5fd256ac4a08cf853f7f5f0d355ba2d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 3 of arXiv:2605.28766, 'Convex order and faster transmission in first contact percolation'] The models mentioned above have the following relations with respect to convex ordering as in Definition~\ref{def:convexordering}.
