\end{enumerate} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:45:17.701826+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3d6248884444d49b5c41895ecb8cdc7ed2b13b55fbc00e35f451b50f3b2c7240","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:expected_number_lineages of arXiv:2604.09509, 'An Improved Bipartition Cover Bound for the Multispecies Coalescent Model'] For any $i \in N$ and $T > 0$

