{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:15:16.646617+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3d745963ddc9cfdf8ad45ebf839bc7bc4dd78ab8f6074bab48c3715e8fc5135f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 (Pointwise comparison-image lower bound) of arXiv:2608.30722, 'Intermediate Singular Values of Random Matrices\\ under Second-Moment and Anti-Concentrati'] For every deterministic choice of \(S\subseteq[m_l]\) with \(|S|=l\) and every
