 a^\dagger H_{n-1} = H_n\;, 
 \qquad 
 a H_n = n H_{n-1}
 \qquad 
 \forall n\geqs 1\;.
\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:01:56.351734+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3d8cdeb9f1928237c8d220f2833e7dbed164d030a74d630ff491ca05590cb96c","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition NA1-NA2-Y-reflexive of arXiv:2609.00794, 'On operators whose adjoints or second adjoints attain their norms'] Let $X$ and $Y$ be Banach spaces. Then 
