{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:10:43.822571+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3e2061686a5f3dd37b7297bc07f5c3e0f735ead121a95000674060e804200f88","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem of arXiv:2412.04334, 'Fractional counting process at L\'{e}vy times and its applications'] The first passage time distribution of the TCFCP $Z(t,\lambda _{\theta }),\;t\geq 0$ denoted by $\mathcal{T}_w$ for $t\geq0,\; w\in \mathbb{N}$ is given as
