whenever~$\min\{k,n-k\}\ge k_0$. Here~$\{\fraktura d_j\}_{j\ge0}$ is the sequence from Assumption~(ass-1 of the paper) (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

