{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.606615+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3e53b312a17c24b623b40e8803cf17de9f93dc150fef0be4326a42b40290ba76","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2607.08129, '2607.08129'] Let $\alpha>1$, $n_m=\lfloor e^{m^\alpha}\rfloor$, and
