    \end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:19:47.271889+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3e5a628af4606e89ea40ae3236211df58641a8889bffc2041cb5a03461e23ed5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2512.21159, '\textsc{From multitype branching Brownian motions\\ to branching Markov additive processes'] $W_{\theta}(t)$ is the projection of $\zeta_t$ onto $\mathcal{F}_t$, that is,
