where $C_{1},C_{2}$ are certain positive constants that do not depend on $m$ or $\eta$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.455621+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3e832560be21ddf88fd078d4e5db2814e6f194b795912396951ceb3e0ebf79c8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 7 (A frequency-localized profile) of arXiv:2609.02523, '\bf Strong Ill-Posedness in critical and subcritical regimes for the Hunter--Saxton equati'] Let $b \in (1/2,1)$ be fixed. 
