{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:19:46.233796+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3e88f7230f1fc7a1890f9ece0f60377d16c805cd3bcaf02b638c9e2941b71270","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 64 of arXiv:2507.08909, 'Annealed almost periodic entropy'] Fix a positive integer $k$ and a map $\phi\in\B(\A,\rmM_k)_+$.
