	where $\mathscr{K} \subset \mathscr{G}$ and $\mu$ is an arbitrary $\mathscr{MNC.}$ Also $ F : \mathbb{R}_{+} \rightarrow \mathbb{R}_{+}$ is non-decreasing continuous mapping.
