{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:55:57.000998+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3fd3076e80d38c6290e61835a0769acc39a4bd40267b4b4ce2289f8b1a864aeb","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 9 (Parity-weighted inner comparison) of arXiv:2609.02788, '\textbf{Quantized Einstein Metrics on \(S^7\) with \(SU(3)\)-Symmetry}'] At the overlap $t=\delta_b=b^{1/2}$,
\begin{equation}
 |V_{\PE}(s_b)-V_{\RF}(s_b)|
 \le C\delta_b^2\,|V_{\RF}(s_b)|,
