{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:44:39.706606+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3fd449bda6476a8beefe9fe7f0c67c12dc5f5ff0bc974654abc399c5072384a8","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 9 (Coercivity of the transformed fractional diffusion operator) of arXiv:2608.29726, '\LARGE A Priori Estimates for Singular Fractional Stochastic Burgers Equations'] Let \(1<\gamma<2\), \(0<\beta<1\), and let
