{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:17.752640+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3ff7e725466c2194c0460d0c9340d14bd0c6d4287d4bed9517378363ff380ef3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 1 of arXiv:2511.02763, 'The Cayley-Moser problem with Poissonian arrival of offers'] The optimal policy $\mu(t)$ is given by the solution of the initial value problem
