{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:11:02.363191+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3ff80769a75810d779728d714d3968d6c6d2b90786dd70d885f9abe1735074e0","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm-existence of arXiv:2507.09922, 'A scaling limit for Vlasov equations with electrostatic fluctuations'] Assume that the initial condition $f_0\in (L^1\cap L^3)(\mathbb{T}^3\times \mathbb{R}^3,\mathbb{R}_+)$ has finite kinetic energy
