{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:25:39.082535+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_3ffc6c46a1ccb0a5b0ff02f630b2e2e3ffa8a61146933bd16404c145ae3c50f6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:convC of arXiv:2606.11677, 'Feynman--Kac formula for the heat equation with a one-center point interaction in $d=3$.'] $C_n\to C$ in $\mathcal{C}$ if and only if the following conditions hold:
