{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:53:53.185917+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_402fa55811e5494247fa666696cf4def471cf947d3388a6d775afe449224dba5","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 26 of arXiv:2606.11758, '2606.11758'] For \(d\in\mathfrak D_\xi\), recall that
