{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:57:49.847141+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_407981c0d45881f975a47a661e6a2a958af9eae0b17c8a74dcb32eaf24f0fb6b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:SmallNormProbability of arXiv:2410.23915, 'Asymptotic Bounds and Online Algorithms for Average-Case Matrix Discrepancy'] Let $X \sim \mathrm{GOE}(m)$. For $\delta = o(\sqrt{m})$, we have
