{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:38:17.796438+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_407ac7e5c74a471efc0bad5d33e8578a28206b70f71a90f2e4b0caf2918b9cc9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:one_delta=1/gamma of arXiv:2509.23496, 'Crossing probabilities in geometric inhomogeneous random graphs'] The one-edge crossing probabilities satisfy, for $|x|=R$,
