		\right\}
		\le O_L (1) \tilde{\chi}_j \Big( \frac{\ell_{\varnothing,j}}{\kh_{\varnothing,j}} \Big)^6 \norm{V}_{\cV_j (\ell)} \norm{V'}_{\cV_j (\ell)}
		\nonumber
\end{align}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:50:44.858368+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_40e4ad14aa8ef7e38365e537df6f00e9e0faf429679d05ce1f7bbfb58756c296","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 29 (Simple Poisson Tail Bounds) of arXiv:2607.16479, 'The Site Frequency Spectrum in an Exponentially-Growing Population with Selection'] Let $(P_n)_n$ be a sequence of Poisson random variables with rates $(\lambda_n)_n$. Then for any $k$:
