{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:36:12.200049+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_40e51e0144e01c44437cd2a154b365187d54c47647ce427547c9f5eff7e7bb34","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2609.03951, 'Generalized Semi-Riemannian Submersions and Foliations'] Let $\pi:M\to B$ be a submersion. The following are equivalent:
