{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:34:45.738412+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_40ff568ef8d7ff39cba4585d8f25e56bc18a1e67559affc024dbeb7d0470c9f7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary eq:satinv of arXiv:2609.01990, 'Jacquet-Zagier treatment of the beyond endoscopy trace formula for \(\GL_2\)'] For $\text{GL}_2$, the Satake inverse $\mathfrak{S}^{-1}$ takes the following form
