{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:45:01.898109+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4116cd8f69792381888e5ff845891a2a6a859eb1a3e784fc291639af85f2e2e1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition uniqueness of arXiv:2512.19897, 'On the convoy of the ASEP speed process'] Let $|q|<1$ and $x=\cos\theta \in \left(-1,1\right)$.  
