{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.360336+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_414b29bf1dde1a08d14655117ebcf90b905dbe0cc58932c068583b9bc3928135","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 17 of arXiv:2606.17859, 'Full $\Gamma-$expansion for the level-two large deviation rate functionals of non-reversib'] For every $1\leq p \leq \widehat{\mf q}$, $\lambda>0$, and
