{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:05:52.441356+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_415186c2582540ca10f15080adf6b029428c4cfa01b250ab95f5b769aa83b7a5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2504.15992, 'Repeated singular values of a random symmetric matrix and decoupled singular value estimat'] ([campos2024least], Lemma VI.7)
