{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:51:33.321228+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_415e9bc334c7f4fbdaed685251e98cbce5496cfc69591f7b21997fc651dea45f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma res-pted-Quillen of arXiv:2608.28504, 'Global $\bm\infty$-categories and global Thom spectra'] Let $\alpha\colon G\to G'$ be a homomorphism of compact Lie groups. Then
