{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:40:22.423300+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_417f83c838e7fa14a9fa9f79d87c7ad32b66578089e4d66702dda610b739d267","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn def-critical of arXiv:2506.18827, 'Random walk reflected off of infinity, with applications to uniform spanning forests and s'] For an admissible weight sequence $\bf q$, define 
