{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.761549+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_41ce05ee8754eb0652b4bf99f9c011dd27ffdd092754a366413edca4bd56d62d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 16 of arXiv:2604.12233, 'An upper bound on the smallest singular value of dense random combinatorial matrices'] \cite[Proposition 2.2]{rudelson2008least}
