{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:32:20.720559+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_41e03c75e06818262964becf93113b33196ecd95daf83781d728573e8f8dba81","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 21 of arXiv:2609.00285, 'Multicrossing complex of knot and secant classes'] Let $A$ be an abelian group. Then
