{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:46:00.335961+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_41ee338f6d85ae0771f09baf9e1d64e4bb51e423b65cdd322b30c745dfcdd076","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:endpoint-deconvolution of arXiv:2607.18070, 'The Brownian loop-catcher'] Fix \(E\subset V\) and nonempty \(S\subset E\), and put
