{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:41:29.036526+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_41f38b72d151f38dafb178ee1df779112bfbe3a3466c11fcecedca5be72b8d65","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 2 (Target of the guided filter) of arXiv:2608.26585, 'GRAS: Guided Reduced-Variance Proposals\\ and Adaptive Selection for Training-Free\\ Rewar'] Assume the reward is bounded, $\|r\|_\infty<\infty$, and the filter resamples by an unbiased scheme
