{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:57:16.059682+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_421a5a8af163b0c58d8d2d137b703cd31cb5d8c8a1652700f6d971f761e48738","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem lemma:a_priori_estimates_1 of arXiv:2506.10623, 'Polynomial slowdown in an angle-dependent 2d branching Brownian motion'] Let $\alpha > 0$, $\varrho \geq 1$, $\xi\in\mathbb{R}$ and $T\in (0,1)$.
