{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:25:44.594614+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_421c53c6218224f34797e2a88bc71fc1df2291d93f533aba7b9e7de6a0a964d6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Conj bounds eigenvalues crit reg of arXiv:2509.15790, 'Covariance matrices of volume power functionals of random simplicial complexes -- an asymp'] Let $\Sigma_n$ be as in ((Eq: Kov.matrix Laengen Potenz Funktional of the paper)) in the critical regime such that the matrices $A_{m}^{>1}$ for $m \in \{0, \ldots, k_n\}$ according to ((Eq: Am<1 of the paper)) fulfill Requirement (Asum 1 of the paper). Moreover, let $S_m$ be the bound from ((Eq: bound S of the paper)). Then, the eigenvalues $\lambda_1^ {\Sigma_n}\leq \ldots \leq \lambda_n^ {\Sigma_n}$ of $\Sigma_n$ are bounded by
