{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:30:50.734831+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_421cf26a12a2e29e2734d708858a6cee6a32e7d60ff45353f852d7c6107973c9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem theo_graph_sec_graph of arXiv:2503.24372, 'A criterion on the free energy for log-Sobolev inequalities in mean-field particle systems'] Let $G_N$ satisfy Assumption~(ass_graph of the paper) and $V$ satisfy Assumption~(ass_doublewell of the paper). 
