{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:33.746232+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4279cbe5223312be7ec739f031beec8756bd5b861aa53fe38fe6ca6b52b1626a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2606.11994, 'Sample Path Properties of the\\ Fractional Wiener--Weierstrass Bridge II'] As $n\to\infty$,
