{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:02:34.834079+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_42aa6c24a552b98dfd4e849b9d7bcae66c28c67851b9fbb8e7e5be71f4d510e1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 16 (Gaussian perturbation comparison) of arXiv:2607.20329, '2607.20329'] Let $Z\in\mathbb K^{n\times n}$ be an arbitrary random matrix independent
