{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:28.468360+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_42c9732a284f4c3571ae86edf5eae237f321cf7f349895cdc9c4b30c9eb45933","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 (Log-convexity of the Schatten completion norms) of arXiv:2606.29292, 'Intrinsic Gaussian Tensor Geometry and Random Operator Spectra'] Let $2\le r_0<r_1<\infty$, let $0<\theta<1$, and define $r_\theta$ by
