{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:32:18.836717+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_42dc3404d18857625bbfcf1a7f8d48cd67ef2f2f67990f23bc0ce2cc310147cd","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 22 of arXiv:2609.03830, 'Parabolic Poincar\'e inequalities and maximal function estimates for systems of partial di'] Let $1< p <\infty$ and $\max\{1,p-1\}<q<\infty$.
