{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:27:14.948996+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_42e3d7eb13eccf7c6470db18feb3c11417b3bf78fed3ad2a7bef49e98c2ab64e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 4 of arXiv:2608.24352, 'Second moments associated with finite free multiplicative convolution'] \cite[Proposition 2.3, point 2]{collins2006integration}
