{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:34.001357+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_42ecae84b995fd681ae4708ddea91f4fb1668510adecece43ff8a964863f0d21","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 50 of arXiv:2609.03403, 'Hyperpositive functions, sector bounded functions and a trace formula'] $F\in\mathcal{SB}_T$ if and only if there exists a $\mathbb C^{m\times m}$-valued bounded function $S$ such that
