{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:42:16.241857+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_42f8261cd1dd4384dc6cc02a0e16b8cf6b5986cb48d8d624a82c6973db1af49b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma encadre of arXiv:2607.00753, 'Threatening excursions in large population\\ quasi-stationary birth and death systems.\\ O'] We have
$$
\eta_{{\scriptscriptstyle K}}(A)\le e^{K\,(V_{*}(A)+o(1))}\;,
