{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:43:55.610648+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_435c4099960dd0729d38cf3170f16c2ee555ea1f16ff60fb92de913b219a8097","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: X^p space of arXiv:2604.05941, 'Banach spaces of continuous paths with finite $p$-th variation'] [Dyadic case of Theorem 4.3 of [das-kim2024]]    
