{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:01:48.648147+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4360c0fb300f8579cf18bfaa1916afcd019055ec67c2ea31256f31bee77111dc","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm_main_dim of arXiv:2607.04002, 'Collisions of random walks in unimodular random graphs: applications to the random geometr'] Let~$G \in \{ \mathcal G_\mathrm{SGil},\mathcal G_\mathrm{Del}, \mathcal G_\mathrm{Gab} \}$. Then,
