{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.495529+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_43ac2f36dceed4a7955e334fcbab7404c5a8e5c01c522fde3fc9ab6d7a60a957","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Problem 32 of arXiv:2512.02538, 'On the spectral geometry of Liouville quantum gravity'] Show that Courant's bound holds in LQG:
