{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:59:58.440255+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_43c857355f1db50b366fbe7ef8e3788232208fd5f190383fad0f83d9dead2417","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition XY and XY/Villain models on a site percolation configuration of arXiv:2604.24743, 'The impact of disorder and non-convex interactions on delocalisation of height functions'] We fix an integer $L \in \ensuremath{\mathbb{N}}$, an integer $n \geq 2$, a pair of inverse temperatures $\beta_1 , \beta_2 > 0$, a percolation configuration $r \in \{0,1\}^{\Lambda_L}$, and introduce:
