{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:04:41.018449+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_43e05cac8bb2fdd81a6fce887473b9a23ee5fb23f61b328f2fe71536271c47c6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem hydrodynamics of arXiv:2412.04015, 'Linear fluctuation of interfaces in Glauber-Kawasaki dynamics'] Fix a measurable function $\rho \colon {\mathbb T}^d\to[0,1]$.  Let $\nu_N$
