{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:07:15.727561+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_44083ee3b5aa5461980c9be46b4f4668d2d45bbc12726641572080a129705f44","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma5.1 of arXiv:2608.01279, 'Stochastic heat equation with nondegenerate Hölder diffusion coefficient: uniqueness below'] For the specified $q,s,p$, 
