{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:19:46.238336+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_442e40f054ac97c27dcfeb4fb024db38a398cb87eeddf51355a94a6eb698fabc","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 119 of arXiv:2507.08909, 'Annealed almost periodic entropy'] Let $\pi$ be a separable representation of $\G$.
\begin{enumerate}
