{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:48:45.324871+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_44738691b87ee9eef165aa7dd9586613dcd0d2c4d66cb9a57d26955f8a3f9d15","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma l:Nest of arXiv:2411.14936, 'Massive Particle Systems,\\Wasserstein Brownian Motions,\\ and the Dean--Kawasaki Equation'] Fix~$\mbfs\in\mbfT$.
