    \end{cases}
\end{equation}
and let~$r_0$ be as in the item~(\ref{i:pi-well-def}) of Lemma~\ref{l:facts-on-boundaries} and~$\Gamma_{r_0}$ be as in~\eqref{e:Gamma-r0-def}.
Then, 
