with \(c_M:=\int_{A_M} e^{-K(V(x)-v_\star)}\,dx\left(\int_{\R^d} e^{-\kappa(V(x)-v_\star)}\,dx\right)^{-1}\in(0,1)\). (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

