{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:05:28.220292+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_45929c6315135c04dc04c8268eacac17e3d4f52a2d328c6664705678474a598c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm: Lp estimates for discrete chaos of arXiv:2602.04429, 'Disordered systems and (subcritical) polynomial chaos\\ with heavy-tail disorder'] {}
	Assume that \(\omega\) is centered and verifies~(equation eq: definition of a general heavy-tailed random variable of the paper) with \(\gamma \in (1,2)\).  
