{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:25:39.121192+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_45b385ec124cbb072e2ee46c767492878cf90f37edb7ab89296217e96e044307","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:cancellation-of-excellent-clusters in cle of arXiv:2606.13147, 'Scaling limits of the single-curve interface and outermost loops in the planar random fiel'] For any boundary condition $\xi\in\hat\Sigma_i$, we have
