{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:30:07.791655+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_45c690c0422bce85d9681ebea7cefc3411b50383a03f95f9562dae2c13741906","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm_var_formula of arXiv:2608.09105, 'Longest convex chains with i.i.d.\ points'] Assume (equation p_cont of the paper).
