    (4) One can easily derive $\textsf{T}_\Diamond$ from $\textsf{B}_\Diamond$ and $\textsf{T}_\Box$ by syllogism,
    so it suffices to show $\textbf{CKB4D} \vdash \textsf{T}_\Box$.
    The following derivation proves it:
