			\left( \frac{1}{\omega(B_{\rho})} \int_{B_{\rho}}  \left(\frac{|v-v_{B_{\rho}}|}{\rho}\right) ^{q\theta} \omega \, \mathrm{d}x \right)^{\frac{1}{\theta}}  \leq    \frac{c}{\omega(B_{\rho})}  \int_{B_{\rho}}  |Dv|^{q}   \omega \, \mathrm{d}x
