{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:13:18.515883+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_45d12d735a0d664b1a50d67320d708485987417abb60112a56a929ad49bf33b3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2608.30602, '2608.30602'] Let $|v(x)|\lesssim\langle x\rangle^{-3-}$. Then we have
