\end{equation}
\end{enumerate}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:58:38.059268+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_462197b110106a160dafd463caded665ae77be23540f9ec257d755d7001b6715","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:Main2 of arXiv:2606.19313, 'Stability of Khintchine-type inequalities via log-monotonicity'] Let $X$ be a symmetric random variable and $r_k=r_k(X)$. 

