	for all $\varphi, \psi \in C_b(\mathbbm{R}_+^3)$ and all $t \geq 0$.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:03:35.764569+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_462ebd2efb497a016bb36b0c1e70e794e355a57c536b3062bf446b463ee305b4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma eq:sup_L2_diff of arXiv:2609.03607, 'Scaling limit for the pinning model in correlated Gaussian environment beyond the $L^2$-re'] Let $\widehat{Z}_N^{(K)}$ and $\widehat{Z}_{N,n}^{(K)}$ be defined as above. Then for any fixed $K>0$,
