{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:42:39.095910+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_464d52c7c3c8b33e9a05e2bc417fc3d2e5ab3b00faa373201386a2e872c1a10a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm John-Nirenberg inequality of arXiv:2412.08497, 'Time discretization of Quadratic Forward-Backward SDEs with singular drift'] Given $V$ a $\operatorname{BMO}\text{-process}$ and let $r$ be a fixed number in $[0,\tau]$. Then, for every integer $p\geq 1$
