{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:52:51.763604+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_465ff90b291cf8097faec8fbf917de14eadd32ab5af48ff3fe219085a91b166d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:multisite_solution of arXiv:2605.00657, 'Spectral Duality and Reset-Neutral Distributions\\ in Random Walks with Multi-Site Geometr'] The ruin probability under multi-site geometric resetting is
