{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:48:30.906600+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_46a24dcd77e4f1999769d079c0dfa7f44b0a041142d4d15b2989ccf1c0a10e4c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 22 (Odd-sector Casimir reduction) of arXiv:2609.00922, 'The Morse Index, Nullity and Jacobi Fields of Constant-Curvature 2-Spheres in Complex Proj'] The involution $\mathscr P_\ell$ commutes with $T_\ell$, and the
