{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:45:10.068873+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_46b9e3061ad71dd5d9ddb2278106e474637014d1b863f9cac70f8400bb1333bf","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition riesz kernel of arXiv:2504.14457, 'Abstract'] We call the Riesz kernel with exponent $\alpha$ the function given by
