{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:43:43.162876+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_47154124a71616a5913c6dd5e1459d8ec2020d93289b9d536ddc592af8a1e0d3","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem markov of arXiv:2506.21466, 'The Markov property for $\varphi^4_3$ on the cylinder'] For every $f: S'(M) \rightarrow \mathbb R$ bounded and $M_\ell$-measurable,  
