{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:54:18.237148+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4715cdbe75bfd265258ed245baaebb7dd8e2551bf2d325ab6321e4594c9011be","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem-Aii of arXiv:2608.29147, 'The crossing matrix and the Burau matrix of pure braids'] For the hook generator $A_{i \ i+1}= \sigma_i^2 \in P_m$ ($1 \leq i \leq m-1$), we have 
