{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:18:27.583499+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_473c4c475130d158587da3740e343de1d163ea5570e2baa3aeee5aef7f5d570e","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 17 of arXiv:2603.00353, 'Aldous-type Spectral Gaps in Unitary Groups'] \cite[Thm.~2.12]{benkart1994tensor}  Let $k,m\in\mathbb{Z}_{\ge0}$. For all $n\ge k+m$, 
