{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:58:01.570569+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_474e1f158b9d2a928a8b2840ff62451bd43ab9197a3fcc88cf6a1ab62cf8dc16","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 10 of arXiv:2608.27307, '2608.27307'] Under Assumption~\ref{ass:basic}, the measure $\bnu$ admits the decomposition
