    &+ 2\Bigg(1 - \Phi\bigg(\frac{\ell}{\sqrt{t}}\bigg)\Bigg) \delta_{(0,0)}(dp,dq) \,.
\end{align*}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:11:35.812653+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_476d6d39a8afe94e08624f05a342feddc21a61ac07eb09adbf1041dd27012e42","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:1 of arXiv:2607.18505, 'A Vector Space Approach to Heavy Tailed Analysis'] Let $X\in \mathbb{V}_b$ satisfy $b(s)P(|X|>sx)\rightarrow \kappa_X x^{-\alpha}$ for normalizing function $b$ and each $x>0$. Let $c_{x}(s)$ be an eventually positive function satisfying $c_{x}(s)\rightarrow x$. Then 
