{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:58:40.869938+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_477c8f89df9fb759abbf910c314794077066caecde5319ee8a957af82381f4bf","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition Sufficient condition for proper zero-couplings of arXiv:2605.10491, 'Zero-couplings of infinite measures with cyclically monotone support and multivariate regu'] \am{Following Johan's comments, I've put this result in (cor:cdtn-proper-zcoup of the paper).}
