{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:10:44.010087+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_47963b41be51782b4f54b96932c31843b638fa07e1481ac9395a5c37531961fb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:moment of arXiv:2412.04579, 'Solvable Families of Random Block Tridiagonal Matrices'] With $\boldsymbol{Q}$ Haar distributed ${\mathbb{F}}$-unitary matrix, we have
