{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:45:10.055602+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_479f809ca82a04b6cd4ff0f9db5ecbbe3e0243cb3bc146f515c7edcbb964240c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma J of arXiv:2504.14457, 'Abstract'] If $m=0$, we have
