{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:22:08.520968+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_47a6ff4c81280b5c292305f48222b4336deb4e19a15e390891b4b3d0c2524202","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:LBJ-scalar of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] The one-point Fredholm determinant
