{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:28.477164+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_47c6ef351f548cb98541fc51456f0664e4f9abda1b02a561c4290696682fc0c5","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 87 (Dyadic convergence of alternating It\^o iterates) of arXiv:2606.29292, 'Intrinsic Gaussian Tensor Geometry and Random Operator Spectra'] Let $\pi_m$ be the uniform dyadic subdivision of $[s,t]$, and let
