{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:09:34.445659+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_48305419734d725adcc576b5a8219cc1d62224fa44034b0f5e5094b8cdd7e7bd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Martingale M_n general FCLT of arXiv:2505.05921, 'Limit Theorems for step reinforced random walks\\ with regularly varying memory'] {}
