{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:34:20.727314+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_48456aaf6ff05a8117a0c6ad8de5d188ca5d19113f3213add8dd0fd547020109","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 9 of arXiv:2609.02197, '2609.02197'] For all $j \in \mathbb{N},$ let
