{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:44:12.655684+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4892ac5273f71dc9e94bf188b8071a79b642ab30aba6a920e60f5e2642e95d2a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Beta limits of arXiv:2512.05896, 'T\'oth's buses and the ``detachment process'''] \begin{enumerate} Let $m_k,M_k$ and $R_k$ be as in the previous paragraph.
