{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:15.486148+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_48930d4f38aa0202984b6bcf3488c5c256d26d1b72b7dea121216dacf09f98be","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 76 of arXiv:2509.01797, 'Relation between Wick powers and excursion clusters of the 2D GFF'] Let $n\geq 1$. A.s., the Wick power $:\Phi^{n}:$ can be decomposed
\begin{equation}

:\Phi^{n}:~=\psi^{\rm gen}_{n,0}
+
\sum_{0\leq k <\lfloor n/2\rfloor}
(-1)^{k}\dfrac{n!}{2^{k} k! (n-2k)!}
V_{A^{\rm gen, +}_{0}}^{k}
\,
:\Phi_{D\setminus A^{\rm gen, +}_{0}}^{n-2k}:\,.
\end{equation}
Fix $\eta>0$. 
Then a.s.,
\begin{multline*}
\E\big[\Vert :\Phi^{n}:\Vert^{2}_{H^{-\eta}(\C)}\big\vert \mathcal{F}_{0}^{\rm gen, +}\big]
=
\Vert \psi^{\rm gen}_{n,0}\Vert^{2}_{H^{-\eta}(\C)}
\\+
\E\Big[
\Big\Vert
\sum_{0\leq k <\lfloor n/2\rfloor}
(-1)^{k}\dfrac{n!}{2^{k} k! (n-2k)!}
V_{ A^{\rm gen, +}_{0}}^{k}:\Phi_{D\setminus A^{\rm gen, +}_{0}}^{n-2k}:
\Big\Vert^{2}_{H^{-\eta}(\C)}
\Big\vert \mathcal{F}_{0}^{\rm gen, +}
\Big] .
\end{multline*}
In particular,
\begin{multline*}
\E\big[\Vert :\Phi^{n}:\Vert^{2}_{H^{-\eta}(\C)}\big]
=
\E\big[\Vert \psi^{\rm gen}_{n,0}\Vert^{2}_{H^{-\eta}(\C)}\big]
\\
+
\E\Big[
\Big\Vert
\sum_{0\leq k <\lfloor n/2\rfloor}
(-1)^{k}\dfrac{n!}{2^{k} k! (n-2k)!}
V_{ A^{\rm gen, +}_{0}}^{k}:\Phi_{D\setminus A^{\rm gen, +}_{0}}^{n-2k}:
\Big\Vert^{2}_{H^{-\eta}(\C)}
\Big].
\end{multline*} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:01:39.422970+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_48971cc75662b96448a407890ca9a161148e2e77236f65632281f70a503af4aa","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:shift-cumulants of arXiv:2607.22156, 'A random matrix approach to lamplighter groups'] Let $\epsilon_1,\ldots,\epsilon_n\in\{1,-1\}$ and $b_1,\ldots,b_n\in\mathcal{B}_0$. Put $p_j=\epsilon_1+\cdots+\epsilon_j$. Then
