{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:25.038369+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_489db327a0d6bf580589de1fd6e3d00d666a4993d8be8e12b1c509733fa30139","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2606.31528, 'Well-posedness and stationary distribution of free stochastic differential equations'] \cite{bianeStochasticCalculusRespect1998}
