{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:17:33.997169+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_48b943439f2f233a3b4ed2523e522e32e485b5bce38464ee3872b00762da9696","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 11 of arXiv:2609.03403, 'Hyperpositive functions, sector bounded functions and a trace formula'] Let $G$ be a $\mathbb C^{m\times m}$-valued function defined in the open right half-plane. Then it is analytic and contractive in $\mathbb C_r$ if and
