{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:54:34.578743+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_48e5f4037d4976774ee6006f955086330848573de4d06527a687c7b9bad9c979","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2606.14876, 'High-Order Talagrand and Eldan--Gross Inequalities via Besov-Type Variance Functionals'] For all $J\subseteq [n]$, $f:\cube^n\to \Rbb$ and $t\geq 0$,
