{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:33:21.472345+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4929ac9935a33e2216a9ac554c8253e7f2f6543b840733534ec961dc11b3a99a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:exact-width-polytope of arXiv:2606.19763, 'Optimal Sparsification of Gaussian Processes'] Let $r\geq1$ and $0<\eps<1/2$.
