{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:57:07.308853+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4940f694520d4b6704090eae3c262de45f1940522843535a2d7a2d62b7fdcf75","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6 of arXiv:2606.24323, 'Conditioning of incoherent sub-dictionaries sampled from a coherent dictionary'] Let $H$ be a real $K\times K$ matrix with zero diagonal, $M$ a symmetric $K\times K$ matrix with zero diagonal and entries in $\{0,1\}$ and $p\in (0,1)^K$. 
