{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:44:17.189312+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4947bd44e436d238b5e3e848d18e6e02ffb72292b31a9353d05d693081800a7d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 5 (\textit{Birkhoff Ergodic Theorem}\cite{finet2006transfer}) of arXiv:2604.19200, 'Stochastic $\Sigma$-convergence in Orlicz setting and Applications'] Let $T$ be a dynamical system acting on the probability space $
