{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:19:06.745434+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_495cb2e557f7b8bfbed4451b026fa26d3b83055d8fb7e5f81b72834053b4f89a","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:vector-energy-parameter of arXiv:2606.08683, 'Exact Fourier dimensions of dyadic Mandelbrot cascades under minimal integrability'] For \(q>0\), define the vector moment profile by
