{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:56:36.581329+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4981149953ed7a21dfd11c5b7776157710aa54d3b35f39e390ab0ed8e1eb3be8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemmabilinear of arXiv:2608.30443, 'On smooth holosphere solutions to compressible Euler equation'] Let $$F=\sum_{k=0}^{K-1}f_ku^k+r_F, \ \ G=\sum_{k=0}^{K-1}g_ku^k+r_G.$$ 
