{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:41:19.331196+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_498a9426799958db622e71ae173115a485aca2db54271958085fa56b4419d0e7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:fract_perimeter of arXiv:2609.04045, 'Heat content and spectrum for subordinated sub-Laplacians'] For any $0<\alpha<1$ and a measurable set $\Omega\subset \mathbb G$,
