{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:41:29.026183+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_498d2fd9c1d9f45a4e088963717f79e3696d5de4db0c24932b3f60280e6f58b4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 4 of arXiv:2608.26509, '2608.26509'] Let \(A\geq0\) be self-adjoint on a real or complex Hilbert space \(H\).
