{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:47:32.863638+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_49e62815c22234b34a676775e2290518d37d4abe42137048d0150a31948fd72d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 8 of arXiv:2609.02426, 'Deformations of the $\osp(n|2)$-action on the superspace\\ of symbols of differential oper'] Let $n\geq3$ and $\Sc^n_d$ as in \eqref{eq:8}.
