{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:04:07.027131+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4a1d24402c005145bb710e4b49cab88ec3ebf7de756af29124c06ea7d26f9acb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem them existence of arXiv:2607.28167, 'Temporal properties of the stochastic fractional heat equation with rough dependence in sp'] [LM2022]
 Under Condition (cond A of the paper), for any $p\geq p_0$, there exists a solution $u$ to (equation SFHE of the paper)  satisfying the following moment bounds:
    \begin{equation}
