{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:52:23.586432+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4a2fdc5b6fa99e2dbba3d00b0d6924d9f644ccf3353baca43445c5375d9ebe91","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:fBm peturbed lattice of arXiv:2602.19773, 'Regularization of a stationary point process by a stationary increments perturbation'] Let $\xi$ be a stationary point process with intensity $1$ and finite second moment, \textit{i.e.}
