{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:50:30.568774+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4a470ff46106c0c9c38afe60743e739cbe6233920068b1b8da7f71a8446162bd","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 9 (G\texorpdfstring{\(\beta\)}{beta}E with rank-one critical deformation) of arXiv:2605.30779, '2605.30779'] Let \(H_N^{(\beta)}\) be the tridiagonal random matrix of dimension \(N\) defined in \eqref{eq:defn_H^beta}. Fix \(\beta>0\) and \(\theta\in\mathbb R\). Let
