{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:57:49.858145+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4a6816d4e437d0031aebb377537db0c8b5c7dcd43ffef0c99dcf148216d91fdc","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma ch6-l1 of arXiv:2410.23995, 'Sample path properties of parabolic SPDEs with non constant coefficients'] Suppose that assumptions $({\bf \bar{H}}_\Gamma)(1)$-$(2)$ hold. Then: 
