{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:22:21.883127+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4a7c73b877d046fc249885764e2b8068a4a150d234f3573b960cc2058f3fb564","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:esolisATvol of arXiv:2411.11345, 'Real Gaussian exponential sums via a real moment map'] Let $\mathcal{X}$ be a non degenerate admissible scalar GRF and let $U\subset M$ be an open set. If we endow $M$ with the AT metric induced by $\mathcal{X}$, we obtain
