{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:31:45.219309+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4ab52b0e07bd79f905ffd0d3eabd434f1f6bf2b02f5e8c55425f070f076b313a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Thm2 of arXiv:2412.06086, 'Zeros of conditional Gaussian analytic functions, random sub-unitary matrices and q-series'] \begin{align}
