\end{align}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:57:59.893606+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4acb51630efc8678e3425d9007217856c5a4c2f4e1825d00eecd10e28560e3cb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Yauconjecture yauconj of arXiv:2607.09946, 'Statistics on Yau's conjecture: Variance asymptotics'] On any compact Riemannian manifold $(M,g)$ with $\partial M=\emptyset$,
