{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:04:59.434431+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4adc11ba5a2b14e2fac438d7199ac84f26ae2b54314fb01834d6062b69f8553b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem Theorem of strongly cases of arXiv:2605.20800, 'On the maximal displacement of subcritical branching random walk in random environment'] Under (subcritical of the paper) and (Jump Assumption of the paper), assume $\alpha>1$ and $\varTheta(1)<0$, which implies that $\Lambda_e(1)<0$ and 
