{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:16:53.588706+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4ae66f31fbd6ec2d5855cf2125f04994f7060ba2778518fb52470965344bb982","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:bl of arXiv:2412.04607, 'Asymptotics of the partial \(n\)-fold dimer model'] If \(L\geq1\) is odd, then 
