{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:22:20.956266+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4ae8d10ae28c4f55fcb256f9431cb6a658be3085dc3a1e30d31d4ddd1367b6f9","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 33 (Martingale transform norm) of arXiv:2604.09365, 'Cotlar martingale transforms and related singular integrals'] Let $A$ be a real $m\times n$ matrix. For $1<p<\infty$, define the operator norm
