{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:57:28.224307+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4b4144fd970ead578c9414afef33c1c22739ce100fc9bce9ff268ede04bce52a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 15 of arXiv:2607.17943, 'Coadjoint averaging and cross-scale fluxes in a fast-slow stochastic Euler-Arnold system o'] For any $t>0$, we have
