{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:09.856513+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4ba7b3e55b1c3be2ff9accb6d13f8b700c61818be90c368cd94fe60ecd4383f5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 17 of arXiv:2605.20115, 'Moment bounds on correctors for the degenerate random conductance model'] Let $B=B_r(0)$ and let $F:\ZZ^d\to\RR$ be a non-negative function.
