{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:46:26.258126+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4bb4f7f90174e1f67d3428a778ab5286d5dcd55e83b31554363004a0b8a8e8f1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 74 of arXiv:2605.23308, 'Convergence rate estimates for semigroups and heat kernels associated with resistance form'] Take $x,y\in K$ and $x_n,y_n\in V_n$ satisfying $R(y,y_n),R(x,x_n)\lesssim R_H(K,V_n)\lesssim (3/5)^n$ 
