{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:39:12.215286+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4bd41d6a5faaf3434f146cf5b0443714c74d93de491691c450550f1904bfc3b8","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:kaczmarz of arXiv:2412.07643, 'Ballistic Convergence in Hit-and-Run Monte Carlo and a Coordinate-free Randomized Kaczmarz'] Let $x^\ast\in\mathbb R^m$ be the solution to (equation eq:linsystem of the paper).
