{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:25.988278+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4be5964275b6b51b068b52f22ca481910ef1645421e919202bde1fc9b0b68680","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 64 (cf.\ {\cite[Lemma 3.6 and Corollary 3.7) of arXiv:2507.07702, 'Observables of random spanning trees in random environment'] {Mak24}}] 
