  n^{-\frac{d-1}{d}} \sum_{i=1}^n \sum_{j=1}^{n-i} q_n(i,j) \prod_{k=1}^{j-1} \left[1-\bigg(\frac{i}{n-k}\bigg)^d\,\right]\\
