{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:30.960879+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4c236b52d09b3a6134300fc48c2ca2a0058c1a37eb23c86e484c01672c648a80","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 7 (Transformation of the $p$-th variation tensor) of arXiv:2608.12225, 'Higher-order variation and\\ pathwise It\^o calculus on manifolds'] Let $p\geq2$, 
