{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:33:17.722257+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4c9cf6e6072a22872cec2785ee381d82022ad4b8bb8366d3b4f54d2b3360b1be","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 61 (Principal centered dyadic estimate) of arXiv:2607.10813, '2607.10813'] Let $R\sim_{\mathrm{tr}}N$, $Q\le c_{\mathrm{ap}}N$, and
