	while, when $m\ge 2$, there exist $\eta^1,\ldots,\eta^\ell \in \Omega_{k,m}$ satisfying
	\begin{equation}
{\bf r}_{\hat \alpha,k}^\ensuremath{\mathcal M}(\eta,\eta^1)\tonde{	\prod_{h=1}^{\ell-1}	{\bf r}_{\hat \alpha,k}^\ensuremath{\mathcal M}(\eta^h,\eta^{h+1})} {\bf r}_{\hat \alpha,k}^\ensuremath{\mathcal M}(\eta^\ell,\xi)>0\; \text{,}\;\;\quad \text{for some}\  \xi\in \Omega_{k,m'}, \ m'<m\; \text{.}
