{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:15:34.383407+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4cc581a163764ac09567365fc4098e65b6d05335c214c303e8f1b91a62fb7d43","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2609.03243, 'Weighted Ces\`aro type operators on the weighted Bergman spaces in the unit ball'] For $k\geq 1$, let $E_k=\{u\in\mathbb{D}: \delta_{k+1}<|1-u|\leq \delta_k\}$. Then 
