{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:22:48.891223+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4cd0921c6727a804f97d3f854265243001a83d04b5c504d3d9068bc702879798","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 35 of arXiv:2608.29157, 'Dilator-based analysis of $\KP$'] Suppose that $\pi$ is a $\rmbeta$-preproof of the form
