    Here $(\diamondsuit)$ indicates that we enumerate $g$ for every possible $g\colon \ttX_s\to \alpha$ such that $g\supseteq f$, and $\ttX_s$ and $s$ respect to $(\heartsuit)$.","status":"unverified"}

