{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:33:11.989555+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4d14f4a62cb38a5c2df3d229b7163fa9d0c4996f80e25ce0701ec54e6d5a6c4c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:growth of arXiv:2609.02820, 'Sharpness and critical scaling of parking'] Under the assumptions of Theorem~(thm:master of the paper),
