{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:02:11.269166+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4d69c563bc20f146d943b07032f86bb8d2b3ebb30ddabe493299c3314c5f7723","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:submartingale-occupation of arXiv:2509.08430, 'One-dimensional particle clouds with elastic collisions'] Let $X = (X_n)_{n \in {\mathbb Z}_+}$ be an ${\mathbb R}_+$-valued process, adapted to
