\text{ and } \Exp {\mathcal L}^X_n (n^{\gamma}) \leq n^{\frac{1}{2} + \gamma + 4\varepsilon} . \] (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

