{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:01:25.574133+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4dbd989438203ad659c6ce298cedcc6e236538291ea00377c849ed84f806fba2","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem THm-eps-nocut of arXiv:2605.15742, 'Turbulent stretching of FENE dumbbell polymer model via special stochastic scaling and sin'] (Removing of the cut-off)
