		\end{align*}
		As a result,
		\begin{equation}
			Z_e(\mathbf{a}) \leqslant 2\left \langle \nabla v_m(\mathbf{a}), (\mathbf{a}^e-\mathbf{a})\nabla v_m(\mathbf{a})\right \rangle_{{\scaleobj{1}{\square}}_m}.
		\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:58:24.505096+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4de7259c9c5e1324855d2869cb87281d565272dc0c752d0041f419c2367b35a9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lm:randomalphamNbounded of arXiv:2601.09537, 'Gene genealogies in haploid populations evolving according to sweepstakes reproduction'] Under the conditions of Theorem~(thm:haplrandomalpha of the paper),      if
