{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:01:48.649058+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4e24834af2c3f94c438e0cb62abcf19b41374f50657d138f77dcf2682c6aca75","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma_fin_deg_to_unim of arXiv:2607.04002, 'Collisions of random walks in unimodular random graphs: applications to the random geometr'] Fix~$d \ge 2$. For~$G \in \{ \mathcal{G}_\mathrm{SGil}, \mathcal{G}_\mathrm{Del}, \mathcal G_\mathrm{Gab}$\} we have that
