{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T12:40:22.352275+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4e48968d2c3220e5d187d7c85835fa3a6539531445104521e957b9143cc46604","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition def:cm of arXiv:2506.03999, 'Large deviations for scaled families of Schr\"odinger bridges with reflection'] A subset $\Gamma \subseteq \calX \times \calY$ is called \textit{$c$-cyclically monotone} if
