W_1\left(\mathcal{N}_{L_{a,N}}^{LS},\mathcal{N}_{Ai}\right)\le\frac{g(s,\Theta_1,\Theta_2)e^{-s}}{N^{\frac{2}{3}}}
    \end{equation}
 where $g$ is nonincreasing with respect to $s$ for any fixed $\Theta_1$ and $\Theta_2$. (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

