{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:59:24.053926+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4ea60b764ff94048f4e259b140e36400ad53619f80873e1fc1077f5c898ee34c","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:radial-Bregman of arXiv:2608.30904, 'Entire monotone solutions of the anisotropic Allen--Cahn equation in dimension 5'] Let $F(n)=1$, $b=DF(n)$, and $\alpha\ge0$. For every
