{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:38:58.706423+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4eb4a070663edc132dbf2ec0e2bade8e79eff72b7a4996fe67cf4c88cd6f5cc6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:lacoin of arXiv:2510.24424, 'On the Fourier Coefficients of Critical Gaussian Multiplicative Chaos'] Let $(X_t)_{t\geq 0}$ be defined as in Equation (equation eq:*scale of the paper) and 
