{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:51:00.245842+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4ef07628d4d5000e91c3559fde0bf7dfa2522f88d776e1666203c5eeec958569","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defi Pnk and its convolution of arXiv:2604.23890, 'The Cutoff Profile for Random Transpositions on Repeated Cards in the Full Range of Parame'] Let $P_n$ be the random permutation given by
