{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:54:15.622666+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4ef1aa7e28af37987fbb350cd24a64290c48f7db21d8828e2a8ba33982ec6537","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 67 (Finite logarithmic addition) of arXiv:2608.08756, 'Infinite-Dimensional L\'evy Area and Spectral Ancestry'] For \(r\geq1\), \(m\geq2\), and compact operators \(T_1,\ldots,T_m\),

