    in probability.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:59:25.021961+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4f543aed5368309b430392da03483d4b321c9c6b896595ba61c116d504e7dcf7","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 10 of arXiv:2606.31500, 'Non-Uniqueness for Nonlinear Fokker--Planck Equations and Their Associated Distribution-De'] Under Assumption~\ref{def:ass}, it holds that
