 \int_{s}^{t} \ddual{V^\prime }{ B_n \bigl( {\overline{u}}_{n} (\sigma )  \bigr) }{ \psi }{V}{}  \, \mathrm{d}\sigma
= \int_{s}^{t} \ddual{V^\prime }{ B\bigl( \overline{u} (\sigma ) \bigr) }{\psi }{V}{}  \, \mathrm{d}\sigma .
