{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:30.992668+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4fe5f831dd73366179094df690704aa50bcbb9ffcf7a201694c6c30be7126616","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 29 (Positive feedback projection) of arXiv:2608.12492, 'Weak Limits of Wiener Chaos: Primitive--Fock Classification and Hilbert--Stein Extraction'] Let $K\ge0$ be a nonzero bounded operator on a Hilbert space and let
