{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:38:37.404895+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_4feb9a8ec330523a53a6d4a75167c5af014f5e14b0a944f5446db24bc837eb75","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 20 of arXiv:2605.15501, 'Well-posedness of the obstacle problem for generalized Dean--Kawasaki equation\thanks{ The'] (Existence of solutions to the obstacle problem for \eqref{eq:main})
