{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:57:30.977563+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5002dc653f989922fe71c1c2bd93118a953b60099ebd9829829b19c3c94b3af1","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 18 (\textsf{Four-moment-influence bound on Rademacher chaos}) of arXiv:2608.12451, '2608.12451'] Let $F\in L^4(\PP)$ belong to the $d$-th Rademacher chaos
