{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:11:57.304691+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50317a22e9d576a862eccfaecd24dc28264462d74ca9c6b5c918d663e908fb52","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 13 of arXiv:2607.22878, 'Clustering of large deviations in heavy-tailed moving averages: the catastrophe principle '] Let $(Z_i)$  be i.i.d.  zero mean one-dimensional random variables that are 
