{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:11:44.358503+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_505b4ff6281763cc05d0a7f466d4c438179cdc0e4e680e007664d31f6bb4a06a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 19 of arXiv:2609.03098, 'Standing waves for Schr\"odinger equations with Kato class potentials and $L^\infty$-bound'] The mapping $G$ is continuous and there exist constants $M_G>0$ and $L_G>0$ such that
