  \end{equation} (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:02:34.815757+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_506706250b73490b44d03122f3eddfe86148be824ccd0a35820cd29406c62203","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 3 of arXiv:2607.19549, 'The Generalized Friendship Paradox for Eigenvectors'] As $n \to \infty$, for \textbf{Model A} we have 
