{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:32:15.336688+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50901e362d46acd8fcd097e0ef2772b6464c8dfd69c1f47253fa55aa3b5ff469","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition 1 (Semi-martingale measures) of arXiv:2506.15037, '2BSDE with uncertain horizon and application to stochastic control in erratic environments'] We define $\mathcal P_{t}^W$ as the set of all semi-martingale measures
