{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:32:28.955583+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50971e78d6a1c0829b26aa0468b9c783a5962268832e3908610e10855ec353d2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:weak-overlap-sum of arXiv:2608.23135, 'Graph distance and effective resistance of the random walk trace in four and five dimensio'] For each fixed $R\ge2$, as $n\to \infty$, 
