{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:22:08.537506+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50ae4c3d38d279952a2c65a70c9be16acc62b5e69b382ba24fe1a295113e87c1","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:LGJ-seed-linear of arXiv:2608.02772, 'Non-Abelian Hirota-Miwa Equations for the KPZ Universality Class'] Let $H = \ell^2(\mathbb{Z})$.  The seed functions
