{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:02:38.597785+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50b00a7fb544cbeb5c8015c13c2ddf60193c6e77ba97f2fd8a2437468d5b33c5","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 20 of arXiv:2607.07283, 'Multi-time Markov renewal chains and stratified renewal theorems'] For $x\in C$, $A\in\calX$ and $k\in\N^d$,

