{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.472040+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50b5b238ff1e42b0a1ed5ed414cd963551c0f97b6282eef5f907079722d006c1","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn 37 of arXiv:2609.02561, 'NON-NEF LOCI IN MIXED CHARACTERISTIC'] With notation as above, let $D$ be an $f$-big $\Q$-Cartier $\Q$-divisor on $X$.
