{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:10.192135+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50d23b865495fd6832d3f8baaeb345ea795f57957c27978f349fac180892fcf6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 10 of arXiv:2605.03528, '\bf Kolmogorov-Smirnov distance and discrepancies {\em versus} Wasserstein distances'] Let $q>p$ and $\mu$, $\nu$ two probability measures with finite $q$-moments. 
