{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:58:10.027266+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50d3b521993866846bcdc0d3689eda4efe8f768401377c1332fcb672efbded52","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem marked-progeny-tail of arXiv:2607.21428, 'Subcritical percolation and network archaeology on random recursive tree substrate network'] Assume that, for some \(\bar\nu<1\),
		\[
