If $\eta_2>\eta_1$, then also
\begin{equation}
    F(\widehat S)-\eta_1
    \leq
    \frac{\eta_{n-1}-\eta_1}{\eta_2-\eta_1}
    (F_2^*-\eta_1).

\end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

