{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:26:02.532802+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_50ffdf2821c087e1195acfbc4b504f5bf65f5946234e145c8a30e3e4c0aaf637","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop special_ziggurats of arXiv:2608.30031, 'Ziggurats, taut foliations, and contact structures'] Assume that $\mathcal{Z}(\Phi) \neq \varnothing$.
