{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:25:06.134762+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_51012345d875f5ee8a38722771a327892de3011ec11689c32b0fc5a942e28e1f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 30 (Gamma limit) of arXiv:2608.22342, 'Completely Positive Entropy and Fourier Central Limit Theorems for Stationary Random Measu'] For every $\xi\in E_\eta$,
