{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:15:36.159376+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_511efd9cb3e6c9eecb052d5519b144ded47c67ca7a2856bd60af4ef7afccac7a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 20 (Difference estimate) of arXiv:2609.01589, 'Uniform stability of expanding simple waves for Euler--Poisson--Boltzmann: a singular comp'] Let two solutions remain in the bootstrap set and have the same composite
