{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:09:43.668228+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_513de55895a3e93f69c3e6a682c14676651ae8cf3fe30986c28df040df139f8d","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma_exp_decay_rate_homogeneous_case of arXiv:2605.26804, '\Large Large Deviation Principle for the Empirical Measures of Simple Random Walks on $\ov'] For each $\sigma \in \{-,+\}$,
