{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T05:50:44.875194+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_513f5ce3d03923388d715baa39a9783a6c06dd93373d232ce687ffba15e932f4","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 48 (Fusion cuts as incidence degrees) of arXiv:2607.16724, 'Algebraic Transfer for Operator-Valued Gaussian Chaoses: Oriented Schatten Profiles and Si'] For $1\le r<\infty$, the three nontrivial fusion linearizations of
