{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:47:21.634253+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_519f42517749d7f288ea82f350798c3f744414d26903fe4752b1b107ff256f77","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma prop:integral of arXiv:2412.09145, 'Asymptotic expansions for normal deviations of random walks conditioned to stay positive'] For integer $b\ge 0$ it holds
