{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:12:46.901820+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_51afbeac701b22e50ae33eb882114dff32e120df3f975fb11ddb2b8758e2ff2c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem recallTzero of arXiv:2608.09856, '\bf Mass erasure on measured $\bbR$-trees,\\ applications to L\'evy forests'] Let $\texttt Q_0 \! \in \!  \mathcal M_1( \mathbb{T}^0_{\! c})$ be such that 
