{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:56:36.579359+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_51b075b1fc0ef6836b7dad91271fc6fbc41a53688ee0601945a5d42ed07f6c0a","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem: Solution from P_1 of arXiv:2608.30443, 'On smooth holosphere solutions to compressible Euler equation'] Assume (equation eq: Parameters of the paper), $r_+(d,\ell)-r\ll 1$ and recall from (equation eq: Delta_2 Roots of the paper) the definition of $w_e$.
\begin{enumerate}
