\end{equation}
\item Original variables: The curve corresponds to a spherically symmetric solution of (equation eq: Autonomous System of the paper) defined on the interval $|Z|\in [Z_1,Z_3]$. This solution belongs to 
$C^\infty(Z_1<|Z|< Z_3)$.\\
