for all \(\beta\in(2,3)\).","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:13:21.324293+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_521b31d93aa7ffd00c22b2cc07fbfc7fd11d1e107a597ffef35f2ad5d4d8e418","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 2 ($L^1$-exponential contractivity of $Y_t$) of arXiv:2609.01520, 'A stable limit theorem for SDEs driven by multiplicative $\alpha$-stable processes'] Let  Assumptions $\ref{dis}$--$\ref{gro-bou}$ hold,    
