{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.453202+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_529118d36461b7c7aa88ab4c267d1486504e2ebc9d6b34c61b1598fce426502f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem : Topology/RegPD/HW_simple_ptys of arXiv:2412.03320, 'Large deviation principle at speed $n$ for the random metric in first-passage percolation'] We adopt the same notations as in Definition~(def : Topology/RegPD/HW of the paper). 
