{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:38:04.526244+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_52b5609e618ed57ce790dfce4b9eb94bc740a780e5eef8670beb27d7fc9d39a3","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma of arXiv:2607.18011, 'From local giants to locality in long-range percolation'] \thlabel{prop:renormalised_graph}
