{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:12.198707+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_52e75faaff9c42fbc72f90801322578013f432c4c8126fd1355c1bd314aec4a8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 50 of arXiv:2510.22783, 'Universality of Cutoff for Riffle Shuffling'] Consider all $\overline{N}\times K$ matrices with elements in $[k]_0$ such that: 
