{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:23:27.787898+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5379da0fc59f33a9a6d6be6e26cb26d0de6c41beb08ffc620983ced0a90d64eb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm clt:Zagreb of arXiv:2606.09228, 'On topological indices of random caterpillar graphs'] For  $m \ge 2$, as $n\to\infty$, we have
