{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:36:04.990292+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_53ee3b7585caf9a210c559a597cf833e932624653992dcd67a9dbb810f71f068","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 12 (\cite{OT2017}) of arXiv:2604.00882, 'On some extensions of generalized counting processes'] {The density $\ell_\nu(x,t)$ of the process $\mathcal{L}^\nu(t)$, $t > 0$, solves the time-fractional boundary-initial problem}
