			\sum_{j=1}^N \,\mu_j\,\mathbb{D}_t^{\nu_j} \, \ell_\nu(x,t) = -\frac{\partial}{\partial x} \ell_\nu(x,t), \quad x > 0,\,\, t > 0,\,\, \mu_j>0,\,\,\nu_j \in (0,1), \\
