{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:10:08.765604+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_53f4cf06d7814271b3a5b55d149e5cb869c8c80720210607922245b1076cc41e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Satz thm:necessity-bernoulli-functions of arXiv:2411.18155, 'Besov regularity of random wavelet series'] Let $d,k\in\mathds{N}$, $s,\alpha,\beta,\gamma \in\mathds{R}$, $p,q\in (0,\infty]$, and $\mu,\nu \in [-d,0]$.
