{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:07:48.543599+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5413d4fb1f5745432a09ada8f2586b9c99a5dfc7217c980f4d0f4dc734dbbbf6","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 98 of arXiv:2609.01389, 'K-stability and birational rigidity of Fano 3-fold weighted complete intersections'] We have $H|_S = \Gamma + \Delta$, where $\Gamma$ and $\Delta$ are irreducible and reduced curves satisfying the following properties.
\begin{enumerate}
