{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:19:42.686804+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5416bb2ea5f721dad0d538477aa1dd238609234da2fb76164be4897ab24772e2","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 31 of arXiv:2609.03556, 'An Effective SPDE Model for a Schr\"odinger Equation with a Fluctuating Magnetic Potential'] For each $\chi\in C^{\infty}_c((0,T)\times \R^d)$ it holds
