{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:49:17.494221+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_541853568fbc24379cbfaa02694606487023efa32785fbab932f4968177659bb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 44 (Sobolev) of arXiv:2605.28677, 'Weak universality for stochastic reaction-diffusion models\\ with long-range correlated no'] Let $u$ be a random smooth function, and let $1<q<2$, $\p>2$, $k>(1+d)/\p$. 
