{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:23:58.628478+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_548252263bb6053e118561d96b82a638b54d10417e975fda9c6bca86a5bc30ba","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 221 (Estimates for the error integrals generated by the multiplier vectorfield) of arXiv:2609.03101, 'The emergence of the Cauchy horizon from the crease for $3D$ compressible Euler flow'] Assume that $1 \leq N \leq \Ntop$,
