{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:52:45.027736+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_551ed5e02c16ec2d54dcc841b1bafd26e6d01377de94c1318fac23e7e5a7fa3f","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 8 of arXiv:2606.06859, 'The rectangular finite free heat flow'] For $r_1 > \dots > r_d > 0$, we have
