{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:18:19.426880+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_55271bdd6af79fdf02015fabf5aec4e5be70fb8b0fae4e8f4a2ae5f2d2d86d89","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:invardist of arXiv:2508.03577, 'Phase Transitions in a Particle Model\\ for the Self-Adaptive Response to Cancer Dynamics'] Let $\alpha$ the rate at which we add ones to the system, i.e.,  for $k\in \left\{0, \ldots,M\right\}$
