{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T20:09:43.673788+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_559937db95cf6278b522c2fabdf3f384341656ef3ca7bc0952efab61d42026ce","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm:restriction of arXiv:2605.28106, 'Gaussian Processes with Sample Paths in Reproducing Kernel Banach Spaces'] Let \( S \subseteq T \) be a non-empty subset.
