{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:01:22.581253+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_55be9a4f09df431d0aa6ae77f4f489ee48a4d18d871a7133bb5b701ee7e40d0b","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition Proposition-(q u) of arXiv:2605.16963, 'Stochastic Euler Equations with Pseudo-differential Noise: Continuous and Discontinuous Pe'] Let $d \geq 2$. 
