after forgetting the log structures.","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:28:31.999498+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_55c18fef3a7f346f0b0623c695a2a382374414f248303da104bfe617f078db0b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2512.02661, 'Worst-case mixing estimates for Brownian motion with semipermeable barriers'] Suppose that $X_0 \sim \Unif(D)$.
