{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:16:18.650377+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_55c1f05548171f9ede4c6fd76d6068cbd2f461e3e2692deba3b402a39de083f9","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 6 of arXiv:2607.24170, '\large\bf ON NON-MONOTONICITY OF LOGARITHMIC ENERGY\\ FOR RANDOM MATRICES'] Let $\mu$ be a probability measure on $\C$ with $m_2(\mu)\leq C$.
