{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:37:25.906865+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_55c7a951563e40a27465d52cd2183f388a2388269ad160e0f20c29dc46d3c118","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 15 of arXiv:2608.29585, '2608.29585'] The ring $\cO_d$ is a DVR with uniformizer $\pi_d$.  Its completion is a
complete DVR with residue field $\Q(\zeta_d)$.  The maps
