{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:44:17.164125+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_55da5bc33c60484cccbc861e68dcc6aa97f36412d807d29bc51b219a785a04bb","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 10 of arXiv:2604.17526, '2604.17526'] Let~$U$ be a double well potential that satisfies Assumptions~\ref{a:criticalpts}--\ref{a:massRatioBound}, and let~$\epsilon_1 \in (\epsilon_{\min}, \epsilon_{\max}]$.
