{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:06:21.764328+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_55e9093e3d6f5b8222e6a78e72d9c07ddd25e280e51a477a0377311eca491416","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 54 of arXiv:2607.21374, 'Local structure at the maximum and sharp persistence asymptotics of rough fractional Brown'] Fix \(K<\infty\).  There is \(C_K<\infty\) with the following property.
