{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:47:22.244073+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5619ee0824049f38137ebb75def1caf44a2b1e043f11aea313f5e125cb303e9e","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 12 (Jacobian master identity) of arXiv:2605.26107, 'Radial Extremality for LRU Caching and the Fill--Holst Conjecture'] Let $N\ge2$, $1\le C<N$, and let $q\in\Delta_N^\circ$ be nonuniform.  Put
