{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:06:39.297520+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_562bd063fa1bc45a1dc400403fe48ac90eaf2bfbc666dac7bb46599a54bbaae6","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:reflection_equations2 of arXiv:2607.13748, 'Load Balancing with Individually Heterogeneous Servers'] Consider the set of equations
