{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:15:16.656157+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5685f1fbac1f6ce781949fafea2b95c555e905780e5a5894a98eb2fe6afaecdd","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 7 of arXiv:2608.30763, 'Ultracontractivity of heat semigroups with non-local Robin boundary conditions via two-sid'] Let $p \geq 2$ and $0 \leq \phi \in D( L(A,-C) )$ satisfy $L(A,-C)\phi = \mu \phi$. Assume in addition that  
