{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:54:57.452700+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_568851a1e2ca48c1de64d67efffb26ef5e0e62b98a1e45ea145c8dda61e0adab","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm : Intro/FdTmon of arXiv:2412.03320, 'Large deviation principle at speed $n$ for the random metric in first-passage percolation'] Assume~(equation ass : Intro/main_thm/SubcriticalAtom of the paper) and~(equation ass : Intro/main_thm/ShapeThmStrong of the paper). For all $D\in \RegPD$,
