{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:55:42.274087+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_56b29be4a0e0cde4f2eae846a7cd8d5a61484cdbd247e860a166fcb73d258f43","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemma_RN_time of arXiv:2411.16452, 'Interface scaling limit for the critical planar Ising model perturbed by a magnetic field'] Let $t \in (0,\infty)$ and let $(\delta_m)_m$ be as Lemma (lemma_thinness_gamma_time of the paper). Then, almost surely, 
