{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:05:52.396793+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_56bd154c4fd6770e32888a0ee4250d345f02096d9709e817258f483b57573633","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma operatorbound of arXiv:2504.15992, 'Repeated singular values of a random symmetric matrix and decoupled singular value estimat'] Given $B>0$, $\zeta\in\Gamma_B$ and $A_n\sim\operatorname{Sym}_n(\xi)$. 
