and constants independent of \(n,q\).","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:05:52.376802+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_56c43114024dcac2d374d0c8eb45d0c6fcd113586f817dd5fff9e688e6c01fbe","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop for tightness of arXiv:2504.06238, 'Infinite Boundary Friction Limit for Weak Solutions of the Stochastic Navier-Stokes Equati'] For any $R > 1$,
    \begin{equation} 
