{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:00:46.841540+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_56d5cb34aefe2cde7cb2db551cc9e1eed77ed457b4cca43f392f2c4f4ccae2ff","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2608.13631, 'The classical discrete laws near the mode:\\ complete local expansions for the negative bi'] As $r\to\infty$, uniformly for $p$ in compact subsets of $(0,1)$ and $t\in H$ with
