{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:44:12.655397+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_56d78e9cc7b51998f3f676f7bb7c5cef6e44d282bb647694be3fb38c75836f77","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem thm: conc of arXiv:2512.05896, 'T\'oth's buses and the ``detachment process'''] Let $n\to\infty.$ Then

