{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:20:30.612229+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5727c6f736966e179886ddd378a7cb893124168bc2b138d0aa3ec05e5dfab38b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 25 (Bigraded cell enumerator) of arXiv:2609.01882, '\textbf{Coxeter Descents and Parabolic Homotopy Colimits}\\[2mm] \large A Hochster-type de'] Let
