{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:25.934354+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_573ff07a8da4f02c6fa5cfae51e076f655e6cc852d1ffe0b9ba64d58b351610c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 10 of arXiv:2507.07702, 'Observables of random spanning trees in random environment'] Let $(G, \weight)$ be a weighted graph. Then
