{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:28.464620+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_57523c4e31c83e6569368f140a2a65bcec7ba9ca4f25c0a6eb4c1e41ec6406de","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 2 of arXiv:2606.29131, '2606.29131'] Suppose that Assumption {\rm\ref{a1-1}}{\rm(ii)}, Assumption {\rm\ref{a1-2}} and Assumption {\rm\ref{a2-1}} hold, and that
