{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:02:28.578924+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5759c6237bf46eafc04255c6073f8934a6fe9c2cc45e43fac08b1713ae5ea226","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 2 (Janssen test) of arXiv:2609.01296, 'Asymptotic safety regions for Gabor frames generated by Hermite functions'] Let $g\in L^2(\mathbb R)$, $\|g\|_2=1,$ and let $\Lambda \subset \R^2$ be a lattice.
