{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T11:09:49.860629+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_57a9a201ca4c2f5605d0452d90a68afee7e5c92aa9c70f166e053672186db369","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 4 of arXiv:2609.03084, 'Convergence rates to traveling waves for an FKPP model with nonlinear advection'] Suppose that $u$ solves \eqref{main_eq} with the same assumptions as \Cref{main_result_theorem}. Then
        \begin{enumerate}[(i)]
            \item
            If $0 \leq \chi < 1$, then
