{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:24:10.187634+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_57dc465acd423633e09d0a723dfe1675b45c504e0eec6bc2f421c31a921d9a98","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 137 of arXiv:2605.03236, 'Stochastic It\^o Equations and Parabolic Second-Order Equations with singular Drift'] Let $u,f,f_{i}$,
