For $\Lambda$ replaced by $\mathbb{R}^d$, we write ${{\tt Q}}$ for the PPP on $\mathbb{R}^d\times {\mathcal C }^{\ssup\circlearrowleft}$ with intensity measure $\nu({\rm d} x,{\rm d} f)=\sum_{k\in\mathbb{N}}\frac 1k {\rm d} x\otimes\mu_{x,x}^{{{\scriptscriptstyle{({k}})}}}({\rm d} f)$.","status":"unverified"}

