{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:55.295323+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5889eb3e200b14f2cb06e5b4581df26691d764b476ec4c20bd5c818d6f7f8df7","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn 1 of arXiv:2609.02342, '2609.02342'] A \emph{directed tree} is a directed graph \(G=(V,E)\) satisfying:
