{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:42:39.106391+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_58b70d7f5898ad6102b39be25e9c78b2df68a206c633211d61eef1ccf94fd0a6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem THM713 of arXiv:2412.08886, 'On domination for (non-symmetric) Dirichlet forms'] Let $(\kappa, \theta)$ be a quasi-admissible pair. 
