{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:37:28.982332+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_58b93bb3526e6eb685c3acc9cfb681f2619b7aa7c66ce639c2edca6b3c100381","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem 3.4 of arXiv:2412.00708, 'Stochastic PDE approach to fluctuating interfaces'] Assume that $H\in L^2({\mathbb{R}}\times{\mathbb{T}}^{d-1})$ is twice differentiable in $z$ and
