{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:21:45.239087+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_58e82d6dc6fdce20709558434537c123c82062a9df4934c8b6921819b7578c51","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 11 of arXiv:2607.26564, 'Stochastic Scalar Conservation Laws on Moving Hypersurfaces'] ($L^1$-contraction)
