$\chi$ equals $0$ or $-1$ depending on the parameters, $\mathcal{R}^-$ is the half with negative imaginary part of the hyperbola $\mathcal{R}$ defined in (equation eq:curve_definition1 of the paper), and $w$ is the conformal gluing function defined in~(equation eq:expression_CGF_BM1 of the paper). (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

