{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:31:20.862486+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_594ddb28b5cfb9ff069f3af1ea272c1053f915859c24059fca6a163d20f01438","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2506.10817, 'On the Weak Error for Local Stochastic Volatility Models'] Assume the setting of Theorem \ref{thm_condExp_err} and recall $\hE^\eps_\delta$ from Definition \ref{Def_hEepsdelta}. It holds for  $j \in \{1,\dots,\frac Th\}$ that
