where $\{Z_\lambda\}_{\lambda\in\mathrm{Spec}^-(\triangle_{W})}$ are i.i.d. $N(0,\,1)$. 

\item[$(2)$] If $W(x,\,y)=\frac{1}{2}$ almost everywhere, then (equation eq:Wuniform of the paper) holds. 

