{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:47:32.862984+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_599ad8e7728a0569ace18dc8cde51f495e7833dcad49b4f84698a55a8fdba5c7","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 4 of arXiv:2609.02426, 'Deformations of the $\osp(n|2)$-action on the superspace\\ of symbols of differential oper'] As a $\Kc(n)$-module, the module of symbols of $\Dc^n_{\lambda,\mu}$ depends only on the difference
