{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T22:23:25.630062+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_59bf2dd85ea0b3f43bcf91b9c52cfb6d58854fcd325697d1e2a2bd7ed99edf3a","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary cor:argmax of arXiv:2609.01311, 'One-Layer Transformer Provably Learns Multiclass\\ One-Nearest Neighbor in Context'] Under the setting of (thm:shift of the paper),
