{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:24:25.989979+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5a0fc8d857b7b1036c04394dff288664a53c015f5751e49f3ce486f5fe30260d","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 88 (Kirchhoff's Formula) of arXiv:2507.07702, 'Observables of random spanning trees in random environment'] Given any finite electric network $(G, \weight)$ and corresponding weighted UST measure $\bP^\weight_G$, we have
