{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:40:26.990595+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5a569cd11facd3e3017d19e6d016a9c89bef40e97c6e6d7b0576c8bf63b85202","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem-UpperBound of arXiv:2604.14318, '\large The free energy of the interacting Bose gas:\\\medskip a variational description \\'] For any $N,R\in\mathbb{N}$, $\delta\in(0,1)$, $\rho_1,\rho_2\in[0,\infty)$,
