&\quad\times \1\Big\{\langle\Xi_{N,R}^{\ssup{\omega_{\rm P}}},\smfrac 1{|W|}{\mathfrak N}^{\ssup{\ell,{\mathcal L }}}_W\rangle  \in\overline{\mathcal B}_{2\delta}(\rho_1)\Big\}\1\Big\{\langle \partial \Xi_{N,R}^{\ssup{\omega_{\rm P},{\mathcal S }}},\smfrac 1{|W|}{\mathfrak N}^{\ssup{\ell,{\mathcal S }}}_{\partial W}\rangle \in\overline{\mathcal B}_{2\delta}(\rho_2)\Big\}
