{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:41:28.180469+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5a56edf22f9d56668379fffbcfc4f036cc058e63508da799957dd7ef2420a7c1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Conjecture conj:time of arXiv:2511.10630, 'Cutoff for generalised Bernoulli--Laplace urn models'] The chains $\mathbf{X}^{\textup{ord,lab}}$ and $\mathbf{X}^{\textup{ord,lab}}_{\textup{prod}}$ both exhibit cutoff around time
