{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:38:13.639866+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5a5b343a5a76ee5b4bf584af9f49fe3cb5f139f58a4939fda566efaf6832c840","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 14 of arXiv:2609.00690, 'Boundary behavior and optimal pointwise H\"older exponent of the total local time of $(1+\'] For any $X_0\in M_F(\mathbb R)$ and $\lambda>0$,
