{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:35:04.213987+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5a8acb8413e6984be1649daf315c18936b6d3975bf34b5c687e5cc160e05e96a","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Coro 12 of arXiv:2608.03956, 'From Triangular Array Progression\\ to Near-Log-Concave State Transitions'] Let $p^{(n)}_{\T}$ be the polynomial as given in (\ref{triangularpolynomial}) for every $n\geq 0$. Define 
