{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T10:51:11.501261+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5ac5ed341abaacfb1fc45c3baa48c60579b5f863c919ab06fb3a96d49967fa69","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 12 of arXiv:2609.02576, 'Sharp estimates for the Jacobi and trigonometric Dunkl heat kernels'] The Opdam--Cherednik heat kernel satisfies the lower bound
