{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:25:40.047178+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5acdcbac6b2f0853e883dc562373a589bee12a1254633c868945b0ca9d52f8f6","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 14 of arXiv:2510.24562, 'Hard wall repulsion for the discrete Gaussian free field in random environment on $\mathbb'] For every $\delta \in (0,1)$ and $\varepsilon > 0$, 
