{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:58:28.480160+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5af78bba1570ded30518b831c58f460f6375819fd019b37145d72c7af9278e70","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 110 (Canonical massive-GFF Wick multipliers) of arXiv:2606.29292, 'Intrinsic Gaussian Tensor Geometry and Random Operator Spectra'] Assume \eqref{eq:geom-wick-subcritical}, let $1\le p,q<\infty$, and
