{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:25:06.115641+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5b1ea36c1a71e781226482dcf20d92dc0fdb9ceecdc48c18563a07e13218525f","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Theorem 6 (Single-scale center and homogeneity calibration) of arXiv:2608.22334, 'Recovering Weighted Tangent Geometry from a Single-Scale Score Field'] Stack the rows $a_{\psi_j}$ into $A$ and the values $r_{\psi_j}$ into $r$.
