{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:23:03.030736+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5b9ca5de53e2540b899f545918796a060b8b413dce7738de11521fefa3ee6c4f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 12 of arXiv:2605.02713, '2605.02713'] Consider $f=f_n=\sum_{q=m}^p c_q  H_{q,n} =\sum_{q=m}^p c_q  H_q(\cdot;\mathrm{Var} (\cdot))$  for some fixed family $(c_q)$. Then
