{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T20:55:37.362079+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5bdfb8605f59cee3008bb91420d02a5e9ea9424176492c46796a4f63d2b88161","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 39 of arXiv:2606.17859, 'Full $\Gamma-$expansion for the level-two large deviation rate functionals of non-reversib'] For all $k\in \bb Z$,
