{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T14:09:34.488824+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5c23bd5d418fb349d5dcc3d469959f92edef27236be8117f4f086eca117b12d0","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Defn Neutrality condition of arXiv:2505.14762, 'Multiple radial SLE($\kappa$) and quantum Calogero-Sutherland system'] A double divisor $\left(\boldsymbol{\sigma}^{+}, \boldsymbol{\sigma}^{-}\right)$ satisfies the neutrality condition  if 
