{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:52:08.675963+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5c3448c4bddd62947b2312d7cd2aabd30601529253edc6801e44ba4f28449944","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition 5 of arXiv:2608.30077, 'Lie groupoid integration of singular isometries of the Poincaré disk'] The following vector fields in $\Dbarstar$
