{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T17:27:32.354135+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5c56e61155c244ceacf0465654b1b5f969dafe7725f5d763c700806f0a39e171","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma hkbound of arXiv:2509.20657, 'Scaling limit for Brownian motions \\ on the $l$-level Sierpinski gaskets: \\ The fractal '] There exists a constant $c$, independent of $l$, such that
