{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:42:47.753625+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5c58bb6a1e25ab4a7c0b7aca551d3244aff5be12dccdfeb21e4f34ef639f2846","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 21 of arXiv:2604.11682, 'Semilocalization for inhomogeneous random graphs'] Let $\nu > 0$. Then, for all
