{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:45:10.108106+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5c595613176d157a67a2a0d966dc3ae8bae644bd110afd7f105c78ecbea30de1","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma stochastic-boundedness of arXiv:2505.04942, '\textbf{Randomized Routing to Remote Queues}'] Assume the conditions of Theorem~(theorem:load-balancing of the paper) hold. Then,
