{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:09:23.965584+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5c6c2de3c710c1bdf75ece610975628a8f59c02c0fcd054d8606cfb75ee5829d","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Thm 14 of arXiv:2607.22414, 'Asymptotic fluctuations in supercritical multi-type Crump--Mode--Jagers processes'] Assume that~\ref{assumpt:Malthusian alpha} and~\ref{assumpt:hreprMoments} hold
	and let $\varphi$ be a characteristic satisfying~\ref{assumpt:dRimean} through~\ref{assumpt:local ui}.
