 \E(1-\psi_t)^k &= \frac{\gC((2m+\delta)(t-1)-m +k)}{\gC((2m+\delta)(t-1)-m)}\cdot \frac{\gC((2m+\delta)t-2m)}{\gC((2m+\delta)t-2m+k)}.
\end{align*}
In particular, we have $\norm{\theta_{ij}}_2 \cong \norm{\theta_{ij}}_1 \cong i^{\beta-1} j^{-\beta}.$ (Proof in the paper; no proof environment follows the statement in the TeX.)","status":"unverified"}

