{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:25:41.608901+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5cfe2e6047287c99b57d3af1c03354afd918e1f7352d3dc3c47065a38a1e8142","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma Gaussian bound of arXiv:2608.13154, 'Extreme principal minors of Wishart and deformed GOE matrices'] With $p_n \left( \bm i, \bm B, \varepsilon \right)$ as in (equation p_n of the paper), we have 
