{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:12:20.561517+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5d118cd0664a5f88dff74a0380b194b3f78613b8d4998b5b8db564a409f27f54","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition P:sojourn:LD of arXiv:2604.08129, 'Polarity of points for Gaussian random fields in critical dimension'] There exist constants $\varepsilon_0\in(0,1)$ and $K_1, K_2\in(0,\infty)$ such that
