{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T16:30:50.736147+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5d2ce295c4ddb1de38a112b563a79ed055a23ad44d7fd3dac07b3013c02122b4","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lemm_LSI_renorm_nonquad of arXiv:2503.24372, 'A criterion on the free energy for log-Sobolev inequalities in mean-field particle systems'] Let $\lambda_T>0$ and assume that $\mathcal V_T = \cU_T + \|\cdot\|^2_{\bbH}/2T$ is $\lambda_T$-convex (recall~(equation eq: V_T convexe of the paper)). 
