{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:16:46.700380+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5d2f46f92abd14be5a693d9a1396a6ce42b490c482be66d66d6652a8391c7ed9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Cor corLocalCond of arXiv:2411.18563, 'Lower tails for triangles inside the critical window'] Let $\lambda \ge 0$, $\zeta\in [0,1]$, and let $G\sim \mu_{\lambda,\zeta}$. Then
