{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T06:47:07.712644+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5d4f258de33f2a839b8f031b6d07338e0ff11af20399c901c2aa4d53691d50c8","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 11 of arXiv:2608.06317, 'Sharp Tail Bounds Beyond Twice the Mean'] Let $w\ge 0$ and $0\le m\le \min\{1,w\}$ and denote the remaining budget $r=w-m$. Let $x>1$ as well as $z\in [u_0,x)$. Then 
