{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:30:14.221446+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5d6fdde3d97181ed5d6b0bacd640de859991b47bc37f09c52c94c23b154eb99c","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:der-mart-multi-bis of arXiv:2608.20537, 'Persistent anisotropy in multi-dimensional\\ branching Brownian motion'] Let $\beta_t$ satisfy (equation eq:integral-condition of the paper).
