{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T18:25:35.678149+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5dc5b20e755ec573e1be154f1f59b2ad66f1d626a9585fb02c46f1629ebc4f0f","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition1 def_Lclose of arXiv:2603.05491, '\textbf{Local limits of uniform triangulations with boundaries in high genus}'] For $L > 0$, we say that $f_1$ and $f_2$ (see Figure~(Lclose of the paper)) are \emph{$L$-close} if:
