     \widehat{\sigma}\left(i,T_n\right)\mid  I(T_n)=\mathcal{I}.
     $$","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T21:37:08.953501+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5ded5327648000e8c4bf0bcc1ada7ef5f68fbe3cebc5272a30eca81aa0c2afc9","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Proposition prop:tilted_gen_density of arXiv:2609.01581, 'Concentration of additive functionals of Stratonovich-type'] The semigroup $(P_t^{k,\rho})_{t \geq 0}$
