     \end{aligned}
   \end{equation}","status":"unverified"}

{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:43:55.609245+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5e0b05e1ca15e1f4424398c33694d70b17960cb7b010f6c973bcd7ec7791bbca","kind":"concept","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:T1-limit of arXiv:2604.04922, 'Elephant random walk on the infinite dihedral group $\mathbb{Z}_2 * \mathbb{Z}_2$'] We have
