{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:45:32.074648+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5e39cf0f4a9c3d11ffb576d04a24264fe805f90e0a9aa25dbdd3763403a956d5","kind":"definition","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Definition banachmazur of arXiv:2411.14177, '\textbf{Invariant Sublinear Expectations}'] Let $\ell_{\infty}$ be the space of all bounded sequences. A positive linear functional $\Lambda: \ell_{\infty} \rightarrow \mathbb{R}$ is a Banach-Mazur limit if
