{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:26:17.760321+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5e63118c9c00cefcf49ee2bf3fba66320ba993bbf0c7b80efa8a6b28e76f8f0f","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 39 of arXiv:2511.05386, 'CLT for $\beta$-ensembles with Freud weights, application to the KLS conjecture in Schatte'] Let $r\geq 2$ be an even integer, $q\in [1,\infty)$ and $f(X)=\mrm{Tr}\left(X^{r}\right)^{q}$, then
