{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-28T00:26:20.653023+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5e6f3abb61d10aab3018cf8d7ab02d7ea7c66239abd00143829052f0b75d398e","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:y(t)-properties-ER of arXiv:2411.12076, 'Explicit solutions of the SI and Bass models on sparse Erd\H{o}s-R\'enyi and regular netwo'] Let~$y_{\rm Bass}(t)$ be the solution of~(equation eq:y-ER-Bass of the paper). Then 
