{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T07:10:05.719205+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5e781b3d56275b5d947895f99197d11fd0525e861feacb136de0f90d9da3180b","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Corollary 11 of arXiv:2608.17449, 'Spectral Simplicity and Joint Eigenvalue Densities\\ for a Non-Gaussian Brownian Time Chan'] Every $\mu\in\mathcal M_*$ satisfies the conclusions of
