{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T19:45:17.707098+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5ead0a270e827d31864c4fa4e00e9bdb5f5375a61114f291a5078de5ba850f56","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma lem:accumulate_early of arXiv:2604.10214, 'Large deviations for maximum local time of simple random walk in dimensions \texorpdfstrin'] For any $\beta>1$ and $\varepsilon>0$, and any integer sequence $(k_n)$ satisfying
