{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T09:43:00.038258+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5ead717557708d94f90910f16706453373f1132585eb4a8f7231b65323445931","kind":"theorem","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Prop 21 (Linear boundary densities) of arXiv:2609.00739, '2609.00739'] For every compact boundary arc $\Gamma'\subset\subset\partial\Omega$ there are
