{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:28:33.706537+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5eb9b59e1c577825ddd62d07bf92c985b4a0f6a3c1c027cf0ac30e89801d9d5b","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lem cA5 of arXiv:2504.07255, 'A Tail-Respecting Splitting Numerical Scheme\\ for L\'evy-Driven SDEs With Superlinear Dri'] For any $q\in(0,p)$,
