{"assumptions":[],"created_at":"2026-10-26T19:29:52.229421+00:00","domain":"probability theory","id":"claim_5ebded572a93bd053b289eff52dff8595e12e36a6d7b6e0add89872e2621a733","kind":"lemma","schema_version":1,"statement":"[Lemma 28 (Contribution of $\Gamma^{\pm}_{x,\alpha}$ in direction $\alpha_b$) of arXiv:2512.09136, 'On the Green's functions and Martin boundary structure of a planar diffusion in a disconti'] Let $z_0 \in \R^2$. Suppose $x_{\max}^+ < x_{\max}^-$. Then, the following asymptotic expansion holds:
